<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="2SA" style="id" />
  <para style="h">2 SAMAILA</para>
  <para style="toc3">2 Sam</para>
  <para style="toc2">2 Samaila</para>
  <para style="toc1">Katagarda ka Ire ka Samaila</para>
  <para style="mt2">Katagarda ka Ire ka</para>
  <para style="mt1">SAMAILA</para>
  <para style="imt1">Kuɓa̱yuwa̱</para>
  <para style="im">E yeve vuza na u ɗanai katagarda ka nampa ka ba. Ama o goɗumo o yotsongu ta̱ a ɗana ta̱ kaꞋa a̱ya̱ amangatawunkuci n kamangankupa (930) kafu umaci u Yesu, megeshe kenu ana Dawuda u kotsoi tsugono.</para>
  <para style="ip">
    <char style="bk">Katagarda ke ire ka Samaila</char> ka dansa ta̱ ukuna wi ili i na a yaꞋin a̱ ka̱tsuma̱ ka̱ a̱ya̱ amangere ko tsugono tsu Dawuda. Ukuna wa u gbaɓa ta̱ n ukuna u kuvon koɓolo n ulyaꞋi u na Dawuda u ciya̱i. Katagarda ka ka lyaꞋa ta̱ kelime n kadanshi ku ukuna wu uzuwi u tsugono u Dawuda mogono ma Yahuda 1:1-4, koɓolo n ukuna u kuzuwa yi wo okpo mogono mi Isaraila ra̱ka̱ 5:1-24.</para>
  <para style="ip">Ana Dawuda u lyaꞋi Urushelima n kuvon, ɗa u bonokoi likuci ya yo okpoi likuci i gbayin yi iɗika yi Isaraila. Ɗa kpamu u ɗikai Akpati vu Uzuwakpani vu Ka̱shile u zuwai punu.</para>
  <para style="ip">Katagarda ka ka shamgba adama a ukuna wu ulyaꞋi u Dawuda koci ba, ama ɗa ka lyaꞋi kelime n kadanshi ku ukuna wa atakaci a na a̱ ciya̱i Dawuda, a̱ ubuta̱ wu unushi u na u yaꞋin m Betusheba vuka vu Uriya koɓolo n ugbamukaci u na Abusalom kolobo ka̱ ni ka yaꞋankai ni. 15:1--18:18.</para>
  <para style="ip">Ili i gbangam i na katagarda ka ka yaꞋin kadanshi i ɗaɗa ukuna u tsumani tsu Dawuda mogono. Ko a na wo okpoi Dawuda mogono maꞋa, a ayin a na baci de dem u yaꞋin unushi, u tsu dakaka ta̱ adama a na u shika̱ unushi u ni ka̱ta̱ kpamu wu ushuku n atakaci a̱ Ka̱shile. <char style="it">Katagarda ka Samaila ka i re </char> ko yotsongu ta̱ n unushi u Dawuda dem Ka̱shile ka̱ kpa̱ɗa̱ kushatangu uzuwakpani u ni n uma a̱ ni ba.</para>
  <para style="iot">Ili i na yi punu udari a katagarda ka nampa.</para>
  <para style="io1">Tsugono tsu Dawuda wa aza a Yahuda 1:1--4:12.</para>
  <para style="io1">Tsugono tsu Dawuda wa aza a Isaraila ra̱ka̱ 5:1--24:25.</para>
  <para style="io2">a. A̱ ka̱ya̱ ku ugiti 5:1--10:19.</para>
  <para style="io2">b. Dawuda m Betusheba 11:1--12:25.</para>
  <para style="io2">c. Igbandarishi n atakaci a Dawuda 12:26--20:26.</para>
  <para style="io2">b. A̱ya̱ a na a lazai o tsugono tsu Dawuda 21:1--24:25.</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="2SA 1" />
  <para style="s1">Dawuda u panai ukpa̱ u Shawulu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2SA 1:1" />Ana shawulu u kuwa̱i, ci na ɗe Dawuda n uma a̱ ni o bono n a̱ ubuta̱ u na a lyaꞋi aza a Ameleki n kuvon, ɗa a̱ da̱sa̱ngi a Zikilagu ali ayin ere. <verse eid="2SA 1:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2SA 1:2" />A kanna ka tatsu ɗa vuma vu yoku, wu uta̱i ɗe a uɓon wa̱ a̱tsura̱ a shawulu, m motogu ukari, kpamu n kubuta̱ a kaci adama una̱mgbi u ka̱tsuma̱ u ni. Ana u yawai u Dawuda ɗa u kuɗa̱ngi a iɗika ɗa u nekei ni tsugbayin. <verse eid="2SA 1:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2SA 1:3" />Ɗa Dawuda we ecei ni, &lt;&lt;Te ɗai vu uta̱i?&gt;&gt; Ɗa vuma va wu ushuki, &lt;&lt;N laꞋaka ta̱ a̱ ka̱tsura̱ ko osoji ka aza a Isaraila.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="2SA 1:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2SA 1:4" />Ɗa Dawuda we ecei ni kpamu,&lt;&lt;Nini ɗai ka ki ɗe? Dana mu.&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2SA 1:4">Ɗa u danai, &lt;&lt;Osoji a Isaraila a suma ta̱ a̱ ubuta̱ u kuvon, kpamu osoji a̱bunda̱i a̱ kuwa̱ ta̱. Shawulu feu n kolobo ka̱ ni Janata a̱ kuwa̱ ta̱.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="2SA 1:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="2SA 1:5" />Ɗa Dawuda we ecei kolobo ka na ka̱ tuka̱i n arabali a, &lt;&lt;Nini ɗai vu yevei an Shawulu n kolobo ka̱ ni Janata a̱ kuwa̱ ta̱?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="2SA 1:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="2SA 1:6" />Ɗa kolobo ka ka̱ ushuki ɗa u danai, &lt;&lt;U gaꞋaka ta̱ a na mi lo gaɗi vu kusan ku Gilibowa, ɗa me enei Shawulu u tsubaki a masara ma̱ ni, ɗa me enei ekeke odoku n akumbi odoku a irala dakakai kuyawa ɗevu n a̱yi.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:6 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1SA 31:1-6">1 Sam 31:1-6</ref>; <ref loc="1CH 10:1-6">1 Ar 10:1-6</ref></char></note> <verse eid="2SA 1:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2SA 1:7" />Ana u vadalukpai ɗa we enei mu ɗa u ɗekei mu, ɗa mu ushuki, n danai, &lt;Mpa ɗa na&gt; <verse eid="2SA 1:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2SA 1:8" />Ɗa wu ecei mu, &lt;Avu ɗa ya?&gt; Ɗa mu ushuki, n danai, &lt;Mpa vuza vu Ameleki ɗa.&gt; <verse eid="2SA 1:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2SA 1:9" />Ɗa u danai mu, &lt;Yawa ɗevu nu mpa vu una mu, adama a na atakaci a yawa mu ta̱, kpamu mi a kulaꞋa ba.&gt; <verse eid="2SA 1:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2SA 1:10" />Ɗa n yawai ɗevu n a̱yi ɗa mu unai ni, adama a na n yeve ta̱ mayun wi a kulaꞋa ba adama a na a yaꞋanki ta̱ usa̱n ka̱u. Ɗa n ɗikai oroliko a na i a kaci ka̱ ni koɓolo m mashingi ma na mi o kubolu ku ni kpamu, a ɗanna n tuka̱i nu ra̱ka̱ vuzagbayin vu va̱.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="2SA 1:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2SA 1:11" />Ɗa Dawuda u remei motogu ma̱ ni u karai adama a̱ una̱mgbi u ka̱tsuma̱, ta feu uma a na i koɓolo n a̱yi a yaꞋin nannai <verse eid="2SA 1:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2SA 1:12" />Ɗa a̱ na̱mgba̱i ka̱tsuma̱ a̱ shika̱i, kpamu ɗa a yaꞋin kakuli ali a kubana kulivi adama a Shawulu n kolobo ka̱ ni Janata, kpamu adama a uma a Vuzavaguɗu m kpaꞋa ka aza a Isaraila, adama a na a bana ta̱ ukpa̱ u kotokobi.<verse eid="2SA 1:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="2SA 1:13" />Ɗa Dawuda we ecei kolobo ka na ka̱ tuka̱i n arabali a, u danai, &lt;&lt;Teɗai vu uta̱i?&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2SA 1:13">Ɗa wu ushuki, &lt;&lt;Mpa vuza vu Ameleki ɗa, ama ci ta̱ ida̱shi a iɗika yi Isaraila.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="2SA 1:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="2SA 1:14" />Ɗa Dawuda u danai ni, &lt;&lt;Yiɗa̱i i zuwai ɗa vu kpa̱ɗa̱i kupana ka̱rikpa̱ni ka̱ kuɗa̱ngusa̱ kukiye ku nu vu una Mazagbi ma Vuzavaguɗu?&gt;&gt; <verse eid="2SA 1:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2SA 1:15" />Ɗa Dawuda u ɗekei kolobo ke te a̱ ka̱tsuma̱ ko olobo a, u danai, &lt;&lt;Bana, vu una yi.&gt;&gt; Ɗa u lapai ni u vakangi a iɗika. <verse eid="2SA 1:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2SA 1:16" />Ɗa Dawuda u danai vuza vu Amaleki va, &lt;&lt;Mpasa n nu mi ta̱ a kaci ka̱ nu, adama a na nu una̱ u nu u ɗa vu dansai, &lt;Vu una ta̱ Mazagbi ma Vuzavaguɗu.&gt; &gt;&gt;<verse eid="2SA 1:16" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Dawuda u yaꞋin kpalu ku Shawulu n Janata</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="2SA 1:17" />Ɗa Dawuda u zuɓa̱i vishipa vu kpalu ku Shawulu n kolobo ka̱ ni Janata. <verse eid="2SA 1:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2SA 1:18" />Ɗa u danai a piꞋisaka aza a Yahuda vishipa va, vu ɗa vi ta̱ uɗani a katagarda ka Jasharu.<verse eid="2SA 1:18" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="2SA 1:19" />&lt;&lt;Isaraila una ta̱ tsugbayin tsu nu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2SA 1:19">una ta aza a tsugbayin aginda a̱ nu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2SA 1:19">La̱na̱ biꞋi osoji a utsura a̱ yikpa̱i.<verse eid="2SA 1:19" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="2SA 1:20" />Ka̱ta̱ a dana Gatu ba,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2SA 1:20">ka̱ta̱ feu a sala kaꞋa a uye kakau u Ashikelon ba,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2SA 1:20">ta lo nkere ma aza a Filisitiya n kuyaꞋan ma̱za̱nga̱,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2SA 1:20">ta lo nkere ma aza a ofoto a kuyaꞋan ma̱za̱nga̱.<verse eid="2SA 1:20" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="2SA 1:21" />&lt;&lt;A̱ɗa̱ Nsasan n Gilibowa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2SA 1:21">yaꞋan o doku a̱ ciya̱ ciza ko mini gaɗi wa̱ a̱ɗa̱ ba,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2SA 1:21">yaꞋan ashina a̱ ɗa̱ a̱ kpa̱ɗa̱ kudoku kumatsa ili i makara.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2SA 1:21">Adama a na ta ɗe a̱ la̱nga̱sa̱i nra̱ga̱ mo osoji a utsura gbani,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2SA 1:21">ma̱ra̱ga̱ ma Shawulu kpamu mo doku ma̱ ciya̱ maniꞋin ba.<verse eid="2SA 1:21" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="2SA 1:22" />Utan u Janata u munuka u ɗa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2SA 1:22">kotokobi ka Shawulu ki n asuvayali ba,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2SA 1:22">ka tsu una ta̱ osoji a utsura,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2SA 1:22">kpamu ka tsu una ta̱ irala.<verse eid="2SA 1:22" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="2SA 1:23" />&lt;&lt;Shawulu n Janata ncigi n ɗa, mu usuɓi kpamu.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2SA 1:23">A wuma i ta̱ koɓolo a̱ ukpa̱ kpamu i ta̱ koɓolo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2SA 1:23">a laꞋa ta̱ mashangi o moloko,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2SA 1:23">a laꞋa ta̱ kawu utsura.<verse eid="2SA 1:23" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="2SA 1:24" />&lt;&lt;A̱ɗa̱ nkere mi Isaraila,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2SA 1:24">shika̱i adama a Shawulu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2SA 1:24">a̱yi na u yaꞋankai ɗa̱ ntogu mi ikebe</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2SA 1:24">a̱yi na u ukai ɗa̱ ntogu n tsuzogu ma azanariya.<verse eid="2SA 1:24" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="2SA 1:25" />&lt;&lt;Osoji a utsura a̱ kuwa̱ ta̱, una le ta̱ a̱ ubuta̱ u kuvon.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2SA 1:25">Janata u vaku ta̱ ukpa̱ a nsasan.<verse eid="2SA 1:25" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="2SA 1:26" />N na̱mgba̱ ta̱ ka̱tsuma̱ ka̱u adama a̱ nu, vuza va̱ Janata,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2SA 1:26">macigi maꞋa vi wa̱ a va̱,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2SA 1:26">ucigi u nu wa̱ va̱ u gbani u ɗa ba,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2SA 1:26">u laꞋa ta̱ ucigi u maku ma vuka m mavali.<verse eid="2SA 1:26" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="2SA 1:27" />&lt;&lt;Ɗanna osoji a utsura a̱ yikpa̱i,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2SA 1:27">kpamu ucanuku u kuvon u le u na̱mgba̱ ta̱.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="2SA 1:27" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2SA 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="2SA 2" />
  <para style="s1">Erengi Dawuda wo okpo mogono ma Yahuda</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2SA 2:1" />Ana ukuna u nanlo u kotsoi, ɗa Dawuda we ecei Vuzavaguɗu, u danai,&lt;&lt;U gaꞋan ta̱ n gaɗukpa m bana a̱ likuci i te a̱ ka̱tsuma̱ ka̱ likuci i Yahuda?&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2SA 2:1">Ɗa Vuzavaguɗu u danai, &lt;&lt;Bana.&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2SA 2:1">Ɗa Dawuda u doku u danai, &lt;&lt;Likuci yi ne i ɗai m kubana?&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2SA 2:1">Ɗa Vuzavaguɗu wu ushuki u danai, &lt;&lt;Bana a Heburon.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="2SA 2:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="2SA 2:2" />Ɗa Dawuda u banai ɗe koɓolo n a̱ma̱ci a̱ ni ere, Ahinowam vuza vu Jezirelu n Abigelu kagapa ka vuka ka Nabalu vuma vu Kamelu. <verse eid="2SA 2:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2SA 2:3" />Ɗa Dawuda kpamu u ɗikai uma a na i koɓolo n a̱yi, yaba dem n aza a kpaꞋa a̱ ni, ɗa a̱ da̱sa̱ngi a̱ likuci i wawaꞋa i na yi uka̱ra̱Ꞌi n Heburon. <verse eid="2SA 2:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2SA 2:4" />Ɗa uma a Yahuda a̱ ta̱wa̱i a Heburon ɗa erengi Dawuda wo okpoi mogono a kpaꞋa ku Yahuda.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2SA 2:4">Ana a danai Dawuda aza a Jabeshi-giliyadu aɗa a̱ ciɗa̱ngi Shawulu, <verse eid="2SA 2:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2SA 2:5" />ɗa Dawuda u suki n akaka a kubana wa aza a Jabeshi-giliyadu, u danai, &lt;&lt;YaꞋan Vuzavaguɗu u zuwaka ɗa̱ una̱singai, adama a na i neke ta̱ Shawulu mogono ma̱ ɗa̱ tsugbayin a na i ciɗa̱ngi ni. <verse eid="2SA 2:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2SA 2:6" />Gogo na yaꞋan Vuzavaguɗu u yotsongu ucigi u gbangam n kasingai ka̱ ni wa̱ ɗa̱. Ka̱ta̱ mpa feu n yaꞋanka ɗa̱ kasingai a na i yaꞋin ili i nampa. <verse eid="2SA 2:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2SA 2:7" />Gogo na tsurukpai ka̱ta̱ i gbama asuvu, adama a na Shawulu mogono ma ɗa̱ ma̱ kuwa̱ ta̱, kpamu aza a kpaꞋa ku Yahuda a zagba mu ta̱ mo okpo mogono me le.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="2SA 2:7" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ishi-boshetu wo okpoi mogono mi Isaraila</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="2SA 2:8" />Ama Abuna kolobo ka Neru, kovonshi vo osoji a Shawulu, u ɗikai Ishi-boshetu kolobo ka Shawulu u bankai ni a̱ likuci i Mahanayim. <verse eid="2SA 2:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2SA 2:9" />Ta ɗe u zuwa ni wo okpo mogono ma aza a Giliyadu n Ashera n Jezirelu n Ifirayimu m Bayami koɓolo n aza a Isaraila ra̱ka̱.<verse eid="2SA 2:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="2SA 2:10" />Ishi-boshetu kolobo ka Shawulu ki ta̱ n a̱ya̱ amangere n umaci ana u lyaꞋi tsugono ci Isaraila, ɗa u lyaꞋi tsu ɗa a̱ya̱ ere. Ama ɗa aza a Yahuda o tonoi Dawuda. <verse eid="2SA 2:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2SA 2:11" />Dawuda u lyaꞋi tsugono tsa aza a Yahuda a a̱ya̱ e cindere n wotoi u ta̱li.<verse eid="2SA 2:11" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Kuvon ka aza a Isaraila n aza a Yahuda</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="2SA 2:12" />Kanna ko yoku Abuna kolobo ka Neru n agbashi a Ishi-boshetu kolobo ka Shawulu, uta̱i a Mahanayim a banai a Gibiyon. <verse eid="2SA 2:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2SA 2:13" />Ɗa Jowabu kolobo ka Zeruya n osoji a Dawuda a̱ uta̱i a gasai n ele a kadaɓa ka Gibiyon. Ɗa a̱ da̱sa̱ngi apashi ere, aza o yoku a kapashi ka kadaɓa n tsu nan ɗe aza o yoku tamkpamu a kapashi ka kadaɓa n tsu nampa.<verse eid="2SA 2:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="2SA 2:14" />Ɗa Abuna u danai Jowabu, &lt;&lt;YaꞋan olobo a̱ ɗa̱nga̱ a̱ gita̱ vishili kafu a̱ tsu.&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2SA 2:14">Ɗa Jowabu u danai, ta nannai, &lt;&lt;YaꞋan a̱ ɗa̱nga̱.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="2SA 2:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="2SA 2:15" />Ɗa a zagbai uma kupa n ere una̱ wa aza a Bayami aza a na i o kutono Ishi-boshetu kolobo ka Shawulu, n uma kupa n ere kpamu a una̱ u Dawuda. <verse eid="2SA 2:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2SA 2:16" />Ɗa yaba dem u ka̱na̱i vurala vi ni a kaci, yaba dem u sapai vurala vi ni n kotokobi e meɓele, ɗa ra̱ka̱ vu le a̱ yikpa̱i koɓolo a̱ kuwa̱i. Adama a nannai ɗa e ɗekei ubuta̱ wa kula Helikatu-hazurimu, vu na vi a Gibiyon. <verse eid="2SA 2:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2SA 2:17" />Kuvon ka tana ku suɗukpai a kanna ka nanlo ka. Ɗa o osoji a Dawuda a lyaꞋi Abuna n osoji a̱ ni n kuvon. <verse eid="2SA 2:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2SA 2:18" />Kpamu olobo a tatsu a Zeruya i ta̱ lo, Jowabu n Abishayi koɓolo n Asahelu. Asahelu tana vuza vi ilaɗi ɗa ka̱u, ilaɗi an mesheun. <verse eid="2SA 2:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="2SA 2:19" />Ɗa Asahelu va u ka̱na̱i kuguva Abuna n ilaɗi, babu kukpatala ugula̱ ko usungai. <verse eid="2SA 2:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="2SA 2:20" />Ana Abuna u la̱nuki kucina̱ ɗa wu ecei ni, &lt;&lt;Avu ɗa Asahelu?&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2SA 2:20">Ɗa wu ushuki, &lt;&lt;Mpa ɗa.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="2SA 2:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="2SA 2:21" />Ɗa Abuna u danai ni, &lt;&lt;Guva vuma te a̱ ka̱tsuma̱ ko olobo, ka̱ta̱ vu isa ucanuku u kuvon u ni.&gt;&gt; Ama Asahelu u ka̱sukpa̱ kuguva yi ba. <verse eid="2SA 2:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="2SA 2:22" />Ɗa Abuna u doku u danai Asahelu, &lt;&lt;Ka̱sukpa̱ kutono mu. Ka̱ta̱ vu zuwa mu una wu ba. Ɗa baci n yaꞋin nannai, nini ɗai n kuɗa̱ngusa̱ a̱shi a̱ va̱ ere mi inda toku nu Jowabu?&gt;&gt; <verse eid="2SA 2:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="2SA 2:23" />Ama ɗa u iwain ku kpatala. Adama a nannai ɗa Abuna u sovoi ni m masara ma̱ ni a̱ ka̱tsuma̱, ali masara ma ma̱ uta̱i n kucina̱. Ɗa u yikpa̱i lo u kuwa̱i. Ɗa yaba dem na u yawai a̱ ubuta̱ u na Asahelu u kuwa̱i ka̱ta̱ u shamgba wu inda.<verse eid="2SA 2:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="2SA 2:24" />Ama ɗa Jowabu n Abishayi a guvai Abuna. Kanna a̱ kuyikpa̱ ɗa a yawai a kusan ku Amaha, ku na ki a kinda Giya a uye wa akamba aza a Gibiyon. <verse eid="2SA 2:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="2SA 2:25" />Ɗa aza a Bayami o ɓolongi ka̱ci ke le n ka̱tsura̱ ka Abuna ɗa okpoi vi te, ɗa a shamgbai kashani ɗe a gaɗi vu kusan ka. <verse eid="2SA 2:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="2SA 2:26" />Ɗa Abuna u ɗekei Jowabu,&lt;&lt;Ci ta̱ a kulyaꞋa kelime m mu unanai ali ayin babu uteku ɗa? Avu feu vi yeve ta̱ a na ukocishi wa wi ta̱ a̱ kutuka̱ n una̱mgbi u ka̱tsuma̱ ka̱u. Ali wana ɗai va kudana osoji a̱ nu a̱ ka̱sukpa̱ kusaɓa otoku e le aza a Isaraila?&gt;&gt; <verse eid="2SA 2:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="2SA 2:27" />Ɗa Jowabu u danai, &lt;&lt;N kucina ta̱ n Ka̱shile ka wuma, ishi baci vu keɓece ukuna ba, mayun osoji a̱ va̱ i a̱ ka̱sukpa̱ kuguva wu ba, ali kayin washi.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="2SA 2:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="2SA 2:28" />Ɗa Jowabu u lika̱i kavana, ɗa osoji ra̱ka̱ a̱ ka̱sukpa̱i kusaɓa a aza a Isaraila, kpamu o doku a̱ shilika̱ ba.<verse eid="2SA 2:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="2SA 2:29" />Ɗa Abuna n osoji a̱ ni a dasai nwalu n kayin, o tonoi n Araba. Ɗa a pasai Kuyene ku Urudu, urangi Bituron ɗa a yawai a Mahanayim. <verse eid="2SA 2:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="2SA 2:30" />Ɗa Jowabu u kpatalai u ka̱sukpa̱i kutono Abuna. Ama ana u ɓolongi osoji a̱ ni ra̱ka̱, ana a e kecei le ɗa a nambai uma kupa n kuci a Dawuda babu punu tana a Asahelu. <verse eid="2SA 2:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="2SA 2:31" />Kpamu osoji a Dawuda una ɗe aza a Bayami amangatawantatsu n amangatatsu (360) ele vu na i koɓolo n Abuna. <verse eid="2SA 2:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="2SA 2:32" />Ɗa a ɗikai Asahelu a̱ ciɗa̱ngi a kasaun ke esheku a̱ ni, ka na ki a Batalami. Ɗa Jowabu n uma a̱ ni a dasai nwalu n kayin ka nanlo ɗa ubuta̱ wakanai le a Heburon.<verse eid="2SA 2:32" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2SA 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="2SA 3" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2SA 3:1" />KpaꞋa ku Shawulu n ku Dawuda e geshe ta̱ o kuvon, ɗa kpaꞋa ku Dawuda ku lyaꞋi kelime n kutsurukpa, ama kpaꞋa ku Shawulu tamkpamu ɗa ku lyaꞋi kelime n ko okpo ka̱ca̱pa̱.<verse eid="2SA 3:1" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Muku n na a matsakai Dawuda a Heburon</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="1CH 3:1-4">1 Ar 3:1-4</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="2SA 3:2" />Nava ele ɗa muku mo olobo n Dawuda, aza a na a matsakai ni a̱ likuci i Heburon, maku ma̱ ugiti a̱yi ɗa, Amonn a̱na̱ku a̱ ni a ɗa Ahinowam vuza vu Jezireyelu. <verse eid="2SA 3:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2SA 3:3" />Vuza ire a̱yi ɗa, Kiliyabu maku ma Abigelu vuka vu magasa Nabalu vuza vu Kamelu. Vuza tatsu a̱yi ɗa Abusalom, kula ka̱ a̱na̱ku a̱ ni ku ɗa MaꞋaka, mekere ma Talamayi mogono ma Geshuru. <verse eid="2SA 3:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2SA 3:4" />Vuza na̱shi a̱yi ɗa, Adonija a̱na̱ku a̱ ni aɗa Hagitu. Vuza tawun a̱yi ɗa Shefatiya a̱na̱ku a̱ ni aɗa Abitali. <verse eid="2SA 3:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2SA 3:5" />Vuza ta̱li a̱yi ɗa Iturim a̱na̱ku a̱ ni aɗa Egila. Na va ele ɗa muku n na a matsakai Dawuda a Heburon.<verse eid="2SA 3:5" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Abuna u bonoi u ɓa̱nka̱i Dawuda</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="2SA 3:6" />Ana wo okpoi kpaꞋa ku Shawulu n ku Dawuda ku lyaꞋi kelime n kuvon. Ɗa Abuna u ka̱na̱i kudoku ka̱ci ka̱ ni tsugbayin a̱ ka̱tsuma̱ ka aza a Shawulu. <verse eid="2SA 3:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2SA 3:7" />Shawulu wi ta̱ n vuka vu gbani vu na e ci ɗeke Rizapa mekere ma Ayiya. Kanna ke te ɗa Ish-boshetu u ɓarangi Abuna, u danai, &lt;&lt;Adama a yiɗa̱i ɗa vu banai vu vaki n vuka ve esheku a̱ va̱?&gt;&gt; <verse eid="2SA 3:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2SA 3:8" />Ɗa Abuna u yaꞋin wupa ka̱u n kadanshi ka na Ishi-boshetu u yaꞋankai ni, ɗa u danai, &lt;&lt;Vu zuwa ta̱ mpa vuza modoruko ɗa, vu zuwa ta̱ mpa mi ta̱ a̱ kuɓa̱nka̱ aza a Yahuda ɗa? Ali nu ugiti ɗe, ɗa n yotsongi usuɓi u va̱ a kpaꞋa ku Shawulu esheku a̱ nu koɓolo n aza a̱ ni n a̱ja̱Ꞌa̱ a̱ ni. Kpamu n neke wu e ekiye a Dawuda ba. Ama avu ɗa na anana vu shikai mu, n ukuna wu unushi u tsugbani n vuka vu nampa. <verse eid="2SA 3:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2SA 3:9" />YaꞋan Ka̱shile ka takacika mu Abuna, ɗa baci n kpa̱ɗa̱i kuɓa̱nka̱ Dawuda u ciya̱ i na Vuzavaguɗu u kucinakai ni, <verse eid="2SA 3:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2SA 3:10" />Adama a na Vuzaguɗu u dana ta̱ wi ta̱ a kutakpa tsugono a kpaꞋa ku Shawulu, ka̱ta̱ u neke Dawuda wo okpo mogono mi Isaraila m ma aza a Yahuda, ka̱ta̱ u lyaꞋa tsugono a Dan a uɓon u gaɗi ali a kubana a Biyasheba a uɓon u ɗakai.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="2SA 3:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2SA 3:11" />Ama Ishi-boshetu u kaꞋwan u doku u keɓece Abuna kakuna ba, adama na u pana ta̱ wovon u ni.<verse eid="2SA 3:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="2SA 3:12" />Ɗa Abuna u suki aza a usuki kubana u Dawuda, u danai,&lt;&lt;Iɗika ya i yayi? YaꞋan uzuwakpani nu mpa, ka̱ta̱ m ɓa̱nka̱ wu n zuwa aza a Isaraila ra̱ka̱ o tono wu.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="2SA 3:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2SA 3:13" />Ɗa Dawuda u danai, &lt;&lt;U gaꞋan ta̱, mi ta̱ a kuyaꞋan uzuwakpani n avu. Ama ili te i na n cigai wa̱ nu i ɗaɗa, vi a kugasa a̱shi nu mpa ba sai ayin a na vu tuka̱i mu m Mikalu mekere ma Shawulu, a makyan ma na vu ta̱wa̱i kene mu.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="2SA 3:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2SA 3:14" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:14 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1SA 25:44">1 Sam 25:44</ref></char></note>Ɗa Dawuda u suki aza a usuki u Ishi-boshetu kolobo ka Shawulu, u danai, &lt;&lt;Neke mu vuka vu va̱ Mikalu, a̱yi na n tsupai tsumana ci ni n ukpan wo ofoto aza a Filisitiya amangatawun (100).&gt;&gt; <verse eid="2SA 3:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2SA 3:15" />Ɗa Ishi-boshetu u suki a bana a ɗika Mikalu a kpaꞋa ku vali ni Palitiyelu kolobo ka Layishi. <verse eid="2SA 3:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2SA 3:16" />Ama ɗa vali ni u tonoi ni m ma̱shi ali a kubana a Bahurim. Ɗa Abuna u danai ni, &lt;&lt;Wala vu bono a kpaꞋa.&gt;&gt; Ɗa ta na u kpatalai.<verse eid="2SA 3:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="2SA 3:17" />Ɗa Abuna u nekei nkoshi m gba̱ra̱-gba̱ra̱ ma a aza a Isaraila odoki, u danai, &lt;&lt;M megeshe ɗe i la̱nsa̱ ta̱ Dawuda wo okpo mogono ma̱ ɗa̱. <verse eid="2SA 3:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2SA 3:18" />Gogo na i ciya̱ ta̱ kofon ka na i kuyaꞋan nannai, adama a na Vuzavaguɗu u yaꞋanka ta̱ Dawuda uzuwakpani, u danai, &lt;Mi ta̱ a ku isa uma a Isaraila ekiye a irala i le aza a Filisitiya n utsura u kukiye ku kagbashi ka̱ va̱ Dawuda.&gt; &gt;&gt; <verse eid="2SA 3:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="2SA 3:19" />Abuna feu u yaꞋin kadanshi n aza a Bayami. Ɗa u banai u danai Dawuda a Heburon ili ra̱ka̱ i na aza a Isaraila n kpaꞋa ku Bayami enei i gaꞋan ta̱ a yaꞋan.<verse eid="2SA 3:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="2SA 3:20" />Abuna u ɗikai osoji a̱ ni kamanga a banai u Dawuda ɗe a Heburon. Ɗa Dawuda u yaꞋin ka̱ɗiva̱ adama a Abuna koɓolo n uma a̱ ni. <verse eid="2SA 3:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="2SA 3:21" />Ɗa Abuna u danai Dawuda, &lt;&lt;YaꞋan n ɗa̱nga̱ n ɓolonku vuzagbayin vu va̱ mogono aza a Isaraila ra̱ka̱ adama a na a yaꞋan uzuwakpani n avu, a zuwa wu vu okpo mogono me le, ka̱ta̱ vu lyaꞋa tsugono a̱ ubuta̱ ra̱ka̱ tsu na ka̱ɗu ka̱ nu ka cikalai.&gt;&gt; Ɗa Dawuda wu utuka̱i Abuna, ɗa u lazai m ma̱ta̱na̱.<verse eid="2SA 3:21" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Jowabu wu unai Abuna</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="2SA 3:22" />Megeshe kenu ɗa osoji o yoku a Dawuda koɓolo n Jowabu o bonoi n a̱ ubuta̱ u kuvon, ɗa tuka̱i n ucanuku u gbani wa̱ a̱bunda̱i u na a̱ pura̱i. Ama Abuna u buwa koɓolo n Dawuda a Heburon ba, adama a na e pecemgbenei ta̱ ɗe n Dawuda, kpamu u laza ɗe m ma̱ta̱na̱. <verse eid="2SA 3:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="2SA 3:23" />Ana Jowabu koɓolo n osoji a na i koɓolo n a̱yi ra̱ka̱ a yawai, ɗa a danai ni, &lt;&lt;Abuna kolobo ka Neru ka ta̱wa̱ ta̱ a̱ ubuta̱ u mogono, kpamu u ka̱sukpa̱ yi ta̱ u lazai m ma̱ta̱na̱.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="2SA 3:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="2SA 3:24" />Ɗa Jowabu u banai u danai mogono, &lt;&lt;Yiɗa̱i vu yaꞋin nannai? Ali Abuna u ta̱wa̱i wu a̱ nu! Yiɗa̱i i zuwai ɗa vu ka̱sukpa̱i ni u lazai? A̱yi ɗa na tana u laza ɗe. <verse eid="2SA 3:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="2SA 3:25" />Vu yeve an Abuna kolobo ka Neru ka u ta̱wa̱ ta̱ adama a na u doro wu, ciya̱ u yeve kuꞋuwa ku nu n ku uta̱ ku nu, n ili i na vu sheshei kuyaꞋan dem.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="2SA 3:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="2SA 3:26" />Ana Jowabu wu uta̱i u ka̱sukpa̱i Dawuda, ɗa u suki aza a usuki a bana o bono n Abuna, ɗa a cina ni a kayinva ka Sira ɗa o bonoi n a̱yi. Ama Dawuda u yeve n ka ba. <verse eid="2SA 3:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="2SA 3:27" />Ana Abuna u bonoi a Heburon, ɗa Jowabu u ɗekei ni a̱ ka̱ga̱Ꞌin ka̱ utsutsu u likuci, adanshi wi ta̱ a kuyaꞋanka yi kadanshi paki, ɗa u sovoi ni m mawun a̱ ka̱tsuma̱ wu unai, adama a na u tsupa tsu na unai vangu ni Asahelu. <verse eid="2SA 3:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="2SA 3:28" />Ana Dawuda u panai kaꞋa, ɗa u danai, &lt;&lt;Vuzavaguɗu u yeve ta̱ mpa n uma o tsugono tsu va̱ ci n kukiye adama a ukpa̱ u Abuna kolobo ka Neru ba. <verse eid="2SA 3:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="2SA 3:29" />Ka̱sukpa̱ mpasa n Abuna m bono a kaci ka Jowabu m kpaꞋa ke esheku a̱ ni ra̱ka̱. YaꞋan ayin tutu a namba vuza vu kuɗoɗi ko vuza vu ukutu ko ma̱kutsuma̱ ko vuza vu usa̱n u muna ko vuza kambulu a kpaꞋa ku ni ba.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="2SA 3:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="2SA 3:30" />Ta Jowabu n toku ni Abishayi unai Abuna nannai, adama a na wu una ta̱ toku le Asahelu a̱ ubuta̱ u kuvon u na a yaꞋin a Gibiyon.<verse eid="2SA 3:30" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Dawuda u yaꞋin kpalu adama a Abuna</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="2SA 3:31" />Ɗa Dawuda u danai Jowabu n uma a na i koɓolo n a̱yi ra̱ka̱, &lt;&lt;Karai ntogu n ɗa̱, ka̱ta̱ i uka akashi a kpalu i na̱mgba̱ ka̱tsuma̱ adama a ukpa̱ u Abuna.&gt;&gt; Ɗa Dawuda mogono n ka̱ci ka̱ ni u tonoi aza a na a ɗikai keven ka. <verse eid="2SA 3:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="2SA 3:32" />A̱ ciɗa̱ngi Abuna a Heburon. Ɗa mogono mu utuka̱i ka̱la̱ka̱tsu ɗa u shika̱i gbani-gbani a kasaun ka Abuna, ɗa uma ra̱ka̱ a̱ shika̱i. <verse eid="2SA 3:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="2SA 3:33" />Ɗa mogono ma yaꞋankai Abuna vishipa vu kpalu, u danai,</para>
  <para style="b" vid="2SA 3:33" />
  <para style="q1" vid="2SA 3:33">&lt;&lt;Nini ɗai Abuna u kukuwa̱ tsu na kalau ka̱ tsu kuwa̱?<verse eid="2SA 3:33" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="2SA 3:34" />A shiya ekiye a̱ nu ba,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2SA 3:34">a daza ene a̱ nu n ikani ba,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2SA 3:34">tsu vuza na uma gbani-gbani unai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2SA 3:34">ta una nu nannai.&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="m" vid="2SA 3:34">Ɗa kpamu uma ra̱ka̱ o doku a̱ shika̱i adama a̱ ni. <verse eid="2SA 3:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="2SA 3:35" />Ɗa uma a̱ ta̱wa̱i u Dawuda a̱ ka̱na̱i kuleꞋeshe yi u lyaꞋa ilikulyaꞋa ali n kagimi ka kanna. Ama ɗa Dawuda u kucinai, u danai, &lt;&lt;YaꞋan Ka̱shile ka una mu na, ɗa baci m bankai n ilikulyaꞋa ko ili yoku a̱ una̱ u va̱ babu kanna ka̱ yikpa̱.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="2SA 3:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="2SA 3:36" />Ana uma a yaꞋin cicoꞋo n i na mogono ma yaꞋin, ɗa u gaꞋin le ɗa kpamu uma ra̱ka̱ a panai uyoꞋo wi ili i na mogono ma yaꞋin. <verse eid="2SA 3:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="2SA 3:37" />A kanna ka nanlo ka, ɗaɗa aza a Yahuda n aza a Isaraila ra̱ka̱ e yevei a na n ucigi u mogono u ɗa a unai Abuna kolobo ka Neru ba. <verse eid="2SA 3:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="2SA 3:38" />Ɗa mogono ma danai agbashi a̱ ni, &lt;&lt;I yeve a na vuza kelime n vuma gbayin u kuwa̱i a̱ ka̱tsuma̱ ki Isaraila anana ba? <verse eid="2SA 3:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="2SA 3:39" />Anana m pana ta̱ ka̱rikpa̱ni ko an wo okpoi mpa ɗa mogono ma na e erengi. Uma a nampa, olobo a Zeruya a laꞋa mu ta̱ utsura. YaꞋan Vuzavaguɗu u tsupaka vuza kawuya derere vi ili i na u yaꞋin.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="2SA 3:39" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2SA 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="2SA 4" />
  <para style="s1">A unai Ishi-boshetu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2SA 4:1" />Ana Ishi-boshetu kolobo ka Shawulu ka panai a danai Abuna u kuwa̱ ta̱ a Heburon, ɗa ikyamba i ni i kuwa̱i. Ɗa feu aza a Isaraila ra̱ka̱ a panai wovon. <verse eid="2SA 4:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2SA 4:2" />A̱yi Ishi-boshetu kolobo ka Shawulu ka, wi ta̱ n uma ere a na i aza e kelime a aza a̱ vishili, ula e le a ɗa BaꞋana koɓolo n Rikabu, olobo a Rimon vuza vu Beyerotu a iɗika i Bayami, adama a na e kece ta̱ Beyerotu a̱ ka̱tsuma̱ ka uɓon iɗika i Bayami, <verse eid="2SA 4:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2SA 4:3" />adama a na aza a Beyerotu a suma ta̱ a banai a Gitayim limoci, ta ɗe tana i a ida̱shi i limoci ali n anana<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">4:3 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">ali n anana </char><char style="ft" closed="false">I ta̱ a kadanshi ali a kubana a makyan ma na a ɗanai katagarda ka i re ka Samaila. </char></note>.<verse eid="2SA 4:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="2SA 4:4" />Janata kolobo ka Shawulu wi ta̱ m maku ma na e ci ɗeke Mefiboshetu ama ma̱kutsuma̱ maꞋa, maku ma mi ta̱ n a̱ya̱ a tawun. Ana vuka vu na vi o kuwoꞋo yi u panai arabali a na uta̱i a Jezirelu a danai Janata n Shawulu a̱ kuwa̱ ta̱, ɗa u ɗikai Mefiboshetu u sumai. Ama a̱yi o moloko ma a ilaɗi ɗa maku ma ma̱ yikpa̱i, ɗaɗa i zuwai wo okpoi ma̱kutsuma̱.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:4 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2SA 9:12">2 Sam 9:12</ref></char></note><verse eid="2SA 4:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="2SA 4:5" />Ɗa Rikabu m BaꞋana olobo a Rimon vu Beyerotu, a banai a kpaꞋa ku Ishi-boshetu n kanna a kaci, ɗa a cinai ni alavu a kanna. <verse eid="2SA 4:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2SA 4:6" />Ɗa a uwai a kpaꞋa adanshi i ta̱ a̱ kenuku alkama. Ana o sovoi ni ɗa a sumai. <verse eid="2SA 4:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2SA 4:7" />Ana a uwai asuvu a kpaꞋa ka, a̱yi ivaꞋin a kajiba a̱ kunu ku ni, ɗa o sovoi ni unai, ɗa a gbatyai ni kaci. Ɗa a ɗikai kaꞋa o tonoi uye u Araba n kayin ka nanlo. <verse eid="2SA 4:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2SA 4:8" />Ɗa a bankai n kaci ka Ishi-boshetu u Dawuda mogono a Heburon. Ɗa a danai ni, &lt;&lt;Kaci ka Ishi-boshetu ka ɗaɗa na, kolobo ka Shawulu, vurala vu nu, a̱yi na u la̱nsa̱i wuma u nu. Anana Vuzavaguɗu u tsupaka ta̱ mogono u Shawulu nu ntsukaya n ni.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="2SA 4:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2SA 4:9" />Ama ɗa Dawuda wu ushuki Rikabu m BaꞋana vuza ni, olobo a Rimon vu Beyerotu, &lt;&lt;N kucina ta̱ n kula ku Vuzavaguɗu vu wuma a̱yi na wi isai mu a̱ ka̱tsuma̱ ka atakaci dem. <verse eid="2SA 4:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2SA 4:10" />Ana vuza yoku u danai mu, &lt;La̱na̱, Shawulu u kuwa̱ ta̱,&gt; u sheshe ta̱ u tuka̱ mu ta̱ n arabali a singai, ama ɗa n ka̱na̱i ni ɗa n zuwai unai ni a Zikilagu, wo okpoi ni katsupu ku ukuna wa akaka a̱ ni. <verse eid="2SA 4:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2SA 4:11" />A̱ɗa̱ na yi uma gbani-gbani yi unai vuza singai a kpaꞋa ku ni a kajiba ka̱ ni. Mi ta̱ e ku ece mpasa n ni a kaci ka̱ ɗa̱, ka̱ta̱ n takpa ɗa̱ aduniyan.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="2SA 4:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2SA 4:12" />Ɗa Dawuda u zuwai olobo a̱ ni a una Rikabu m BaꞋana, ɗa a yaꞋin nannai. A gbatyai ekiye e le n ene e le, ɗa a saɓangi even a ikyamba e le ɗevu n kadaɓa ka Heburon. Ama ɗa a ɗikai kaci ka Ishi-boshetu a ciɗa̱ngi a kasaun ka Abuna a Heburon.<verse eid="2SA 4:12" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2SA 4" />
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="2SA 5" />
  <para style="s1">Dawuda wo okpoi mogono mi Isaraila</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="1CH 11:1-3">1 Ar 11:1-3</ref>; <ref loc="1CH 14:1-7">14:1-7</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2SA 5:1" />Ɗa kumaci ka aza a Isaraila ra̱ka̱ ku ta̱wa̱i u Dawuda a Heburon a danai ni, &lt;&lt;La̱na̱, a̱tsu mpasa n nu n ɗa. <verse eid="2SA 5:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2SA 5:2" />N ayin a cau, ana Shawulu wi mogono ma̱ tsu, avu ɗa vuza na vu tsu uta̱ n aza a Isaraila a kubana kuvon, avu ɗa kpamu vu tsu bono n ele. Ɗa Vuzavaguɗu u danai nu, &lt;Avu ɗa vuza na vo kokpo maguɓi ma aza a Isaraila, ka̱ta̱ kpamu vu okpo mogono me le.&gt; &gt;&gt;<verse eid="2SA 5:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="2SA 5:3" />Ana nkoshi m gba̱ra̱-gba̱ra̱ ma aza a Isaraila ra̱ka̱ a̱ ta̱wa̱i u mogono Dawuda a Heburon, ɗa Dawuda u yaꞋin uzuwakpani n ele ɗe e kelime ka Vuzavaguɗu, ɗa erengi ni wo okpoi mogono ma aza a Isaraila. <verse eid="2SA 5:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2SA 5:4" />Dawuda wi ta̱ n a̱ya̱ kamangankupa ana u gita̱i tsugono, ɗa u lyaꞋi tsugono tsa a̱ya̱ amangere.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:4 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1KI 2:11">1 Ng 2:11</ref>; <ref loc="1CH 3:4">1 Ar 3:4</ref>; <ref loc="1CH 29:27">29:27</ref></char></note> <verse eid="2SA 5:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2SA 5:5" />Ɗe a Heburon va u lyaꞋa ta̱ tsugono tsa aza a Yahuda ali a̱ya̱ e cindere n wotoi u ta̱li, ɗa u lyaꞋi tsugono tsa aza a Isaraila n aza a Yahuda a a̱ya̱ kamangankupa n a tatsu ɗe a Urushelima.<verse eid="2SA 5:5" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Dawuda u lyaꞋi Urushelima n kuvon</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="1CH 11:4-9">1 Ar 11:4-9</ref>; <ref loc="1CH 14:1-7">14:1-7</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="2SA 5:6" />Ɗa mogono Dawuda n osoji a̱ ni a banai a Urushelima adama a na a yaꞋan kuvon n aza a Jebusiya a na i a̱ ida̱shi ɗe. Ɗa a yaꞋankai Dawuda ulami a danai,&lt;&lt;Vi a kuꞋuwa na wa̱ tsu ba. Ko a̱yimba̱ nu nkutsuma̱ koci n yawa ta̱ o loko wu.&gt;&gt; E kusheshe ku le, &lt;&lt;Dawuda wi a kufuɗa kuꞋuwa punu a̱ ubuta̱ wa ba.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="2SA 5:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2SA 5:7" />N nannai dem, Dawuda u lyaꞋa iɗika yi ukanji i Sihiyona n kuvon, i na gogo na e ci ɗeke likuci i Dawuda. <verse eid="2SA 5:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2SA 5:8" />A kanna ka nanlo ka Dawuda u danai uma a̱ ni, &lt;&lt;Vuza na baci u cigai u lyaꞋa aza a Jebusiya n kuvon, mayun ɗa u tono n uye u mini nannai ɗa ya a ku una, &lt;Nkutsuma̱ n a̱yimba̱,&gt; aza a na Dawuda u iwain,&gt;&gt; i ɗaɗa i zuwai ɗa a danai, &lt;&lt;Nkutsuma̱ n a̱yimba̱ a kuꞋuwa A̱Ꞌisa̱ a gbayin a ba.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="2SA 5:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2SA 5:9" />Ana ka nanlo ko kotsoi, ɗa Dawuda u bonokoi likuci yi ukanji ya ubuta̱ wi ida̱shi i ni, u neꞋi i ɗa kula Likuci i Dawuda. Ɗa kpamu u yaꞋin imaꞋashi uka̱ra̱Ꞌi u ni. U gita̱i a Milo ubuta̱ u na a shatangi n kayala, uka̱ra̱Ꞌi n mashilya ma. <verse eid="2SA 5:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2SA 5:10" />Ɗa utsura u tsugono u Dawuda u lyaꞋi kelime n kutsurukpa, adama a na Vuzavaguɗu Ka̱shile MalaꞋimili wi ta̱ koɓolo n a̱yi. <verse eid="2SA 5:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2SA 5:11" />Ɗa Hiram mogono ma Taya ma̱ suki n aza a usuki a kubana u Dawuda, a banka yi nɗanga n Sida, n amaꞋi n e sheꞋwei, adama a na a maꞋaka Dawuda kpaꞋa ku tsugono. <verse eid="2SA 5:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2SA 5:12" />Ɗa Dawuda u yevei a na Vuzavaguɗu ɗa u zagbai ni mogono mi Isaraila, kpamu tsugono ci ni ci ciya̱i ucikpi adama a uma a̱ ni aza a Isaraila. <verse eid="2SA 5:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2SA 5:13" />Ana Dawuda u ka̱sukpa̱i Heburon a kubana a Urushelima, u doku u ɗikai a̱ma̱ci koɓolo n a̱ma̱ci a gbani a Urushelima, ɗa a matsakai ni muku mo olobo ni nkere. <verse eid="2SA 5:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2SA 5:14" />Na ɗa ula a̱ muku n na a matsakai ni a Urushelima. Shimeya n Shobabu n Natan koɓolo n Sulemanu, <verse eid="2SA 5:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2SA 5:15" />n Ibaharu, n Elishuwa n Nefegu, koɓolo n Jafiya, <verse eid="2SA 5:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2SA 5:16" />Elishama n Eliyada koɓolo n Elifeletu.<verse eid="2SA 5:16" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Dawuda u lyaꞋi aza a Filisitiya n kuvon</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="1CH 14:8-17">1 Ar 14:8-17</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="2SA 5:17" />Ana aza a Filisitiya a panai a zagba ta̱ Dawuda wo okpoi mogono ma aza a Isaraila, ɗa uta̱i ra̱ka̱ a banai kula̱nsa̱ Dawuda. Ɗa ta na Dawuda u ciya̱i izumgbi ɗa u banai u sheɗeki e kpenle ku gbayin. <verse eid="2SA 5:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2SA 5:18" />Ɗa aza a Filisitiya a̱ ta̱wa̱i e peciki ka̱ci ke le a̱ ka̱ra̱Ꞌa̱ ka Refimu. <verse eid="2SA 5:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="2SA 5:19" />Ɗa Dawuda we ecei Vuzavaguɗu, &lt;&lt;M bana n shilika̱ n aza a Filisitiya a? Vi ta̱ e kuneke le ekiye a̱ va̱?&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2SA 5:19">Ɗa Vuzavaguɗu u danai Dawuda, &lt;&lt;Bana, mi ta̱ e kuneke wu ele ekiye a̱ nu.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="2SA 5:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="2SA 5:20" />Ɗa Dawuda u banai a BaꞋalu-Perazim, u lyaꞋi le n kuvon ɗa u danai, &lt;&lt;Vuzavaguɗu u ɓoso ta̱ irala i va̱ tsu na mini mo tsu ɓoso.&gt;&gt; Ɗa e ɗekei ubuta̱ wa BaꞋalu-Perazim. <verse eid="2SA 5:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="2SA 5:21" />Ɗa aza a Filisitiya a sumai a̱ ka̱sukpa̱i a̱ma̱li e le lo, Ɗa Dawuda koɓolo n uma a̱ ni a̱ pura̱i a ɗa. <verse eid="2SA 5:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="2SA 5:22" />Ɗa kpamu aza a Filisitiya a̱ uta̱i ɗa e pecei ka̱ci ke le a̱ ka̱ra̱Ꞌa̱ ka aza a Refimu ka. <verse eid="2SA 5:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="2SA 5:23" />Ɗa Dawuda u doku we ecei Vuzavaguɗu, u danai, &lt;&lt;Ka̱ta̱ vu bana we ele magaba ba, ama ka̱ra̱Ꞌa̱ le n kucina̱, ka̱ta̱ vu uta̱ le n tsu uɓon wu nɗanga m Balasama. <verse eid="2SA 5:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="2SA 5:24" />A makyan ma na baci i panai izumgbi yi nwalu gaɗi vu nɗanga m balasama, ka̱ta̱ i wala gogoꞋo, adama a na urotu u ɗa u na Vuzavaguɗu u uwai e kelime ka̱ ɗa̱, adama a na u shilika̱ ka̱u no osoji a aza a Filisitiya.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="2SA 5:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="2SA 5:25" />Ɗa Dawuda u yaꞋin tsu na Vuzavaguɗu u danai ni, Dawuda n osoji a̱ ni a guvai aza a Filisitiya ili i na i ɗikai a Geba ali a kubana a Geza. Unai aza a Filisitiya n a̱bunda̱i.<verse eid="2SA 5:25" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2SA 5" />
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="2SA 6" />
  <para style="s1">A̱ tuka̱i n akpati vu uzuwakpani a Urushelima</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="1CH 13:1-14">1 Ar 13:1-14</ref>; <ref loc="1CH 15:1-16:3">15:1--16:3, 43</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2SA 6:1" />Ɗa Dawuda u doku u ɓolongi osoji a Isaraila aza a na a fuɗai o kuvon uma a̱kpa̱n kamangankupa (30,000). <verse eid="2SA 6:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2SA 6:2" />Ɗa u ɗa̱nga̱i a BaꞋala vu Yahuda ɗaɗa Kiriyatu-jerimu u banai koɓolo n uma ra̱ka̱ a na i koɓolo n a̱yi, adama a na a̱ tuka̱ n akpati vu uzuwakpani vu Ka̱shile, vu na e ci ɗeke n kula ku Vuzavaguɗu MalaꞋimili, a̱yi na wi ida̱shi e mere mi icorobi. <verse eid="2SA 6:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2SA 6:3" />Ɗa a ɗikai akpati vu uzuwakpani vu Ka̱shile a kpaꞋa ku Abinadabu ku na ki a gaɗi vu kusan, ɗa a kiyangi vu ɗa e keke va anaka vu savu. Uza koɓolo n Ahiyo olobo a Abinadabu, ele ɗa o kutono n keke va anaka a. <verse eid="2SA 6:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2SA 6:4" />Ahiyo ɗa wi a nwalu e kelime ka akpati vu uzuwakpani vu Ka̱shile va. <verse eid="2SA 6:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2SA 6:5" />Ɗa Dawuda koɓolo n aza kpaꞋa ki Isaraila ra̱ka̱ a̱ ka̱na̱i tsuwaꞋi n e jeꞋi, n utsura u le ra̱ka̱ e kelime ka Vuzavaguɗu, n ishipa n a waꞋi umolu n ishari m medele n agundari koɓolo n ugogi.<verse eid="2SA 6:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="2SA 6:6" />Ana a yawai a ulanga u kulapu ku Nakon, anaka a na i o kurono keke va a̱ ta̱ɗa̱tsa̱i, ɗa Uza u ba̱rukpa̱i kukiye ku ni ɗa u ka̱na̱i akpati vu uzuwakpani vu Ka̱shile va. <verse eid="2SA 6:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2SA 6:7" />Ɗa Vuzavaguɗu u yaꞋin wupa n Uza, adama a ugbamukaci u na u yaꞋin a na u saꞋwai akpati vu uzuwakpani va, ɗa Ka̱shile ku unai ni, ɗa u kuwa̱i lo ɗevu n akpati vu uzuwakpani vu Ka̱shile va. <verse eid="2SA 6:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2SA 6:8" />Ɗa Dawuda u na̱mgba̱i ka̱tsuma̱ adama a wupa u na Vuzavaguɗu u yaꞋin n Uza. Ɗa tana e ɗekei ubuta̱ wa kula Pereza-uza, ɗaɗa atakaci a Uza, ta tana ku ɗa ki ɗe nannai ali n anana.<verse eid="2SA 6:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="2SA 6:9" />Ɗa Dawuda u panai wovon u Vuzavaguɗu a kanna ka nanlo, u danai, &lt;&lt;Nini ɗai n kutuka̱ n akpati vu Vuzavaguɗu wa̱ va̱?&gt;&gt; <verse eid="2SA 6:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2SA 6:10" />Adama a nannai Dawuda wu ushuku kuɗika akpati vu Vuzavaguɗu va a kubanka a Urushelima Likuci i Dawuda ba. Ɗa kucikpa u bankai n vu ɗa a kpaꞋa ku Obedu-edom vuza vu Gatu. <verse eid="2SA 6:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2SA 6:11" />Ɗa Akpati vu Vuzavaguɗu vu yongoi a kpaꞋa ku Obedu-edom vuza vu Gatu ali wotoi u tatsu, ɗa ta na Vuzavaguɗu u zuwakai Obedu-edom koɓolo n aza a kpaꞋa a̱ ni ra̱ka̱ una̱singai. <verse eid="2SA 6:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2SA 6:12" />Ɗa o tonokoi mogono Dawuda, a danai, &lt;&lt;Vuzavaguɗu u zuwaka ta̱ kpaꞋa ku Obedu-edom una̱singai koɓolo n ili i kpaꞋa i ni dem, adama a akpati vu Ka̱shile va.&gt;&gt; Ɗa Dawuda u banai u ɗikai akpati vu Ka̱shile va a kpaꞋa ku Obedu-edom ɗa u bankai n vu ɗa a̱ likuci i Dawuda m ma̱za̱nga̱. <verse eid="2SA 6:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2SA 6:13" />Ana aza na a ɗikai akpati vu Vuzavaguɗu va a dasai adanga a̱ ta̱li, ɗa u yaꞋin alyuka o kobomburon koɓolo m medendem mi ikyamba. <verse eid="2SA 6:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2SA 6:14" />Dawuda u uki n motogu mu ucaꞋi ma efodu n tsuzogu, ɗa u yaꞋin kujeꞋe n utsura u ni ra̱ka̱ adama a na u cikpa Vuzavaguɗu. <verse eid="2SA 6:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2SA 6:15" />Ɗa Dawuda n aza a Isaraila ra̱ka̱ a̱ tuka̱i n akpati vu Vuzavaguɗu n yoroli i ma̱za̱nga̱ koɓolo n ciliki ci kavana.<verse eid="2SA 6:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="2SA 6:16" />Ana a ukai n akpati vu Vuzavaguɗu asuvu a̱ likuci i Dawuda, ɗa Makelu mekere ma Shawulu, u la̱na̱i n katusu ɗa we enei mogono Dawuda e kujeꞋe n u ɗikpangi e kelime ka Vuzavaguɗu, ɗa u goyoi ni a̱ ka̱ɗu ka̱ ni.<verse eid="2SA 6:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="2SA 6:17" />Ɗa a ukai n akpati vu Vuzavaguɗu asuvu ɗa a zuwai vu ɗa a̱ ubuta̱ wi ida̱shi u ni punu asuvu a̱ Ma̱va̱li ma Vuzavaguɗu, ma na Dawuda u foɓusokoi ni. Ɗa Dawuda u yaꞋin kuneꞋe ku kusongu n ku ma̱ta̱na̱ e kelime ka Vuzavaguɗu. <verse eid="2SA 6:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2SA 6:18" />Ana Dawuda u kotsoi kuyaꞋan alyuka e kuneꞋe ku kusongu koɓolo n kuneꞋe ku ma̱ta̱na̱, ɗa u zuwakai uma una̱singai n kula ku Vuzavaguɗu MalaꞋimili. <verse eid="2SA 6:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="2SA 6:19" />Ɗa u pecekei le ili kulyaꞋa, aza a Isaraila ra̱ka̱ a̱ma̱ci n ali, yaba dem ka̱kutsu ko boroji, n inyama yi uzungi, n ka̱kutsu ka umaci u mambulu u ɗekpu. Ɗa yaba dem vu le u bonoi a kpaꞋa ku ni.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:19 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1CH 16:43">1 Ar 16:43</ref></char></note><verse eid="2SA 6:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="2SA 6:20" />Ana Dawuda u bonoi a kpaꞋa ku ni adama a na u zuwaka kpaꞋa ku ni una̱singai. Ɗa Makelu mekere ma Shawulu wu uta̱i u gasai n Dawuda, ɗa u danai, &lt;&lt;Nini ɗai mogono mi Isaraila ma ɗikai ka̱ci ka̱ ni anana? U palukpai ikyamba i ni e kelime ka agbashi a̱ma̱ci a̱ ni, tsu na uma a wasasa a ci yaꞋan.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="2SA 6:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="2SA 6:21" />Ɗa Dawuda u danai Makelu, &lt;&lt;N yaꞋan ta̱ kujeꞋe e kelime ka Vuzavaguɗu adama a na n cikpa yi, a̱yi na u zagbai mu a̱ una̱ we esheku a̱ nu n aza a kpaꞋa ku ni ra̱ka̱, u zagba mu ta̱ mo okpo mogono mi Isaraila, uma a Vuzavaguɗu. Mi ta̱ a kuyaꞋan kujeꞋe adama a na n cikpa Vuzavaguɗu. <verse eid="2SA 6:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="2SA 6:22" />Mi ta̱ a kufuɗa kugoyo ka̱ci ka̱ va̱ u laꞋa tsu nampa, ali mo okpo ili i kugoyi wa̱ nu. Ama wa agbashi a̱ a̱ma̱ci a na vi a kadanshi i ta̱ e kuneke mu tsugbayin.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="2SA 6:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="2SA 6:23" />Adama a ili i nampa, Makelu mekere ma Shawulu u matsa maku ba, ali a ukpisa̱ u ni.<verse eid="2SA 6:23" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2SA 6" />
  <chapter number="7" style="c" sid="2SA 7" />
  <para style="s1">Ka̱shile ka yaꞋin Uzuwakpani n Dawuda</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="1CH 17:1-15">1 Ar 17:1-15</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2SA 7:1" />Ana Dawuda u da̱sa̱ngi a kpaꞋa ku ni, ɗa Vuzavaguɗu u nekei ni ida̱shi ma̱ta̱na̱ n irala i na yi uka̱ra̱Ꞌi n a̱yi, <verse eid="2SA 7:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2SA 7:2" />ɗa u danai keneki Natan, &lt;&lt;La̱na̱, gogo na mpa ɗa na a kuvuka a kpaꞋa ku nɗanga n sida, ama akpati vu uzuwakpani vu Ka̱shile ɗa ɗe a̱ Ma̱va̱li.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="2SA 7:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2SA 7:3" />Ɗa Natan u danai mogono, &lt;&lt;YaꞋan ili na yi a̱ ka̱ɗu ka̱ nu, adama a na Vuzavaguɗu wi ta̱ koɓolo n avu.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="2SA 7:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="2SA 7:4" />Ama n kayin ka nanlo ɗa Vuzavaguɗu u yaꞋin kadanshi n Natan, u danai, <verse eid="2SA 7:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2SA 7:5" />&lt;&lt;Bana vu dana kagbashi ka̱ va̱ Dawuda, &lt;Ili i na Vuzavaguɗu u danai i ɗanna. Avu ɗa vuza na va kumaꞋaka mu kpaꞋa ku na n kuda̱sa̱ngu? <verse eid="2SA 7:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2SA 7:6" />Ili i na i ɗikai a makyan ma na mu utuka̱i aza a Isaraila a iɗika i Masar, ali a̱ kuta̱wa̱ anana, n saꞋwa kuda̱sa̱ngu a kpaꞋa ba, ama mi ta̱ a̱ kuka̱ra̱sa̱ a̱ ubuta̱ u ma̱va̱li tsu ubuta̱ wi ida̱shi u va̱. <verse eid="2SA 7:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2SA 7:7" />A̱ ubuta̱ u na n ka̱na̱i kuka̱ra̱sa̱ n aza Isaraila ra̱ka̱, dana mu n saꞋwa ta̱ kuyaꞋan kadanshi n vuza te a̱ ka̱tsuma̱ ka aza e kelime a Isaraila vuza na n zagbai u tono n uma a̱ va̱ aza a Isaraila n danai, &lt;&lt;Yiɗa̱i i zuwai ɗa i kpa̱ɗa̱i kumaꞋaka mu kpaꞋa ku nɗanga n Sida?&gt;&gt; &gt; &gt;&gt;<verse eid="2SA 7:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="2SA 7:8" />&lt;&lt;Dana kagbashi ka̱ va̱ Dawuda, &lt;Ili i na Vuzavaguɗu MalaꞋimili ma danai i ɗanna, n ɗika wu ta̱ a̱ ubuta̱ u kaguɓa avu maku, adama a na vo okpo mogono ma uma a̱ va̱ aza a Isaraila. <verse eid="2SA 7:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2SA 7:9" />Kpamu n yongo ta̱ koɓolo n avu a ubuta̱ u na vu banai dem, ɗa mu unai irala i nu ra̱ka̱. N zuwa wu ta̱ vu ciya̱i kula ku gbayin uteku tsu ula aza a gbagbaꞋin a aduniyan. <verse eid="2SA 7:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2SA 7:10" />Mi ta̱ e kuneke aza a Isaraila ubuta̱ u ka̱ci ke le, ka̱ta̱ n zuwa le ɗe a̱ ubuta̱ wa wo okpo u le. Babu vuza na u kugbandarasa le, uma a gbani-gbani o kudoku a gbandarasa le uteku tsu na a kiwanai kuyaꞋansaka le ba, <verse eid="2SA 7:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2SA 7:11" />ili i na i ɗikai a makyan ma na n zagbai aza e kelime adama a na o tono n uma a̱ va̱ aza a Isaraila. Mi ta̱ e kuneke ɗa̱ ma̱ta̱na̱ e ekiye a irala i ɗa̱. Mpa Vuzavaguɗu n danai, mi ta̱ a kuzuwa kpaꞋa ku nu ko okpo kpaꞋa ku tsugono. <verse eid="2SA 7:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2SA 7:12" />A makyan ma na baci ayin a̱ nu o kotsoi ɗa vu bankai ukpisa̱, mi ta̱ a̱ kuɗa̱ngusa̱ vuza yoku a̱ ka̱tsuma̱ ka ntsukaya n nu u lyaꞋa tsugono a̱ una̱ u nu. Ka̱ta̱ n zuwa tsugono ci ni tsu tsurukpa. <verse eid="2SA 7:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2SA 7:13" />A̱yi ɗa vuza na u kumaꞋa A̱Ꞌisa̱ a gbayin adama a kula ku va̱, ka̱ta̱ n zuwa tsugono ci ni ci lyaꞋa kelime ali ayin babu uteku. <verse eid="2SA 7:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2SA 7:14" />Mi ta̱ o kokpo esheku a̱ ni, ka̱ta̱ a̱yi tamkpamu wo okpo maku ma̱ va̱. U yaꞋan baci ili i gbani-gbani, mi ta̱ a kuzuwa uma a takacikai yi. Uma a ɗa o ko okpo mashashawun ma̱ va̱.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:14 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 89:26-27">Ishp 89:26-27</ref>; <ref loc="2CH 6:18">2 Ar 6:18</ref>; <ref loc="HEB 1:5">A Ib 1:5</ref></char></note> <verse eid="2SA 7:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2SA 7:15" />Mi a̱ kukpa̱ɗa̱ kuyotsongu yi ucigi u va̱ u babu kukotso ba, tsu na n yaꞋankai Shawulu, vuza na n takpai adama a na m bonuko wu mogono. <verse eid="2SA 7:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2SA 7:16" />KpaꞋa ku nu koɓolo n tsugono tsu nu ci ta̱ a kulyaꞋa kelime ali ayin babu uteku, kakuba ko tsugono tsu nu ki ta̱ o kuyongo ali ayin babu uteku.&gt; &gt;&gt; <verse eid="2SA 7:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2SA 7:17" />Ɗa Natan u tonokoi Dawuda ili ra̱ka̱ i na we enei a̱ ubuta̱ u kene ku ni.<verse eid="2SA 7:17" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Dawuda u yaꞋin avasa a kucikpa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="1CH 17:16-27">1 Ar 17:16-27</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="2SA 7:18" />Ɗa Mogono Dawuda u uwai a̱ ubuta̱ u na a zuwai akpati vu uzuwakpani vu Vuzavaguɗu va, ɗa u da̱sa̱ngi e e kelime ka Vuzavaguɗu u yaꞋin avasa, u danai. Yayi Mpa, Vuzavaguɗu vuzagbayin, kpamu anan yayi aza a kpaꞋa ku va̱, ali ɗa vu nekei mu tsugbayin tsu nampa? <verse eid="2SA 7:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="2SA 7:19" />Kpamu me ene ta̱ adanshi kanampa ka yawa ba, Vuzavaguɗu Ka̱shile, vi yaꞋan ta̱ kpamu kadanshi adama a kpaꞋa ku kagbashi ka̱ nu, vu danai kumaci ku ni ki ta̱ o kuyongo ayin n a̱bunda̱i. Ta vu ci yaꞋanka vuma nannai Vuzavaguɗu Ka̱shile? <verse eid="2SA 7:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="2SA 7:20" />Yiɗa̱i kpamu mpa Dawuda u kudana wu? Adama a na vu yeve mu ta̱ kagbashi ka̱ nu, Vuzavaguɗu Ka̱shile. <verse eid="2SA 7:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="2SA 7:21" />Adama a uzuwakpani u nu, koɓolo kpamu nu ucigi u ka̱ɗu ka̱ nu, ɗa vi yaꞋin ili i gbagbain i nampa ɗa kpamu vu ka̱sukpa̱i mu n yevei i ɗa. <verse eid="2SA 7:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="2SA 7:22" />Avu vuzagbayin ɗa vi ka̱u, Vuzavaguɗu Ka̱shile. Babu vuza na wi tsu nu, babu kpamu Ka̱shile ko yoku sai avu endeꞋen, uteku tsu na tsu panai n atsuvu a̱ tsu. <verse eid="2SA 7:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="2SA 7:23" />Babu uduniyan u yoku a duniya u na wi tsu uma a̱ nu aza a Isaraila. Aza a na avu Ka̱shile vu shiba̱i okpo uma a̱ nu. vu zuwai e yevei nu, vu yaꞋankai uma a̱ nu ili i mereve i gbagbain, ɗa kpamu vu lokoi uduniyan u yoku kelime ka uma a̱ nu a na vu shiba̱i a iɗika i Masar. <verse eid="2SA 7:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="2SA 7:24" />Vu zagbakai ka̱ci ka̱ nu aza a Isaraila okpoi uma a̱ nu ali ayin babu uteku. Ɗa avu Vuzavaguɗu, vu okpoi Ka̱shile ke le.<verse eid="2SA 7:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="2SA 7:25" />&lt;&lt;Gogo na, Vuzavaguɗu Ka̱shile, shatangu uzuwakpani u nu u na vu yaꞋankai kagbashi ka̱ nu m kpaꞋa ku ni, ka̱ta̱ kpamu vu zuwa kaꞋa ka shamgba ayin babu uteku, kpamu vu yaꞋan uteku tsu na vu dansai. <verse eid="2SA 7:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="2SA 7:26" />YaꞋan e neke kula ku nu tsugbayin ayin babu uteku. Ali uma a dana, &lt;Vuzavaguɗu MalaꞋimili a̱yi ɗa Ka̱shile ka aza a Isaraila.&gt; Ka̱ta̱ kpaꞋa ku kagbashi ka̱ nu Dawuda kutsurukpa. <verse eid="2SA 7:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="2SA 7:27" />Vuzavaguɗu MalaꞋimili, Ka̱shile ka aza a Isaraila, vu ka̱sukpa̱ ta̱ kagbashi ka̱ nu ke yevei ili i nampa, vu danai, &lt;Mi ta̱ a kuzuwa kpaꞋa ku nu ku lyaꞋa kelime.&gt; Adama a nannai ɗa kagbashi ka̱ nu ka̱ ciya̱i utsura u kuyaꞋan avasa a nampa wa̱ nu. <verse eid="2SA 7:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="2SA 7:28" />Vuzavaguɗu Ka̱shile, avu ɗa Ka̱shile, a makyan dem vu tsu shatangu ta̱ kadanshi ka̱ nu, kpamu avu vu yaꞋanka ta̱ kagbashi ka̱ nu uzuwakpani wu ili i singai i nampa ya. <verse eid="2SA 7:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="2SA 7:29" />Gogo na n folono wu ta̱, zuwaka kagbashi ka̱ nu n kpaꞋa ku ni ra̱ka̱ una̱singai, u ciya̱ kulyaꞋa ku kelime ali a kubana ayin babu uteku. Adama a na avu Vuzavaguɗu MalaꞋimili, avu ɗa vi yaꞋin kadanshi, adama a na avu vu zuwaka ta̱ kpaꞋa ku kagbashi ka̱ nu una̱singai, u ɗa wi ta̱ tana o kokpo yi n una̱singai ali a kubana ayin babu uteku.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="2SA 7:29" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2SA 7" />
  <chapter number="8" style="c" sid="2SA 8" />
  <para style="s1">UlyaꞋi u mogono Dawuda</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="1CH 18:1-17">1 Ar 18:1-17</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2SA 8:1" />Ana ilo, ɗa Dawuda u lyaꞋi aza a Filisitiya n kuvon, ɗa u bonokoi le agbashi a̱ ni. Ɗa wu isai likuci i Metegu-Amah ekiye aza a Filisitiya.<verse eid="2SA 8:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="2SA 8:2" />Ɗa kpamu Dawuda u lyaꞋi aza a Mowabu n kuvon, ɗa u gerei le adaru-adaru a vaki a iɗika. Ɗa u ɗikai kawin u gisanki le, ugisanki u kawin kure dem u zuwai una le, ugisanki u kawin kutatsu u ka̱sukpa̱i le n wuma. Ɗa aza a Mowabu okpoi agbashi a Dawuda, a̱ ka̱na̱i ku ta̱wa̱sa̱ka̱ yi n utafu.<verse eid="2SA 8:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="2SA 8:3" />Ɗa Dawuda u lyaꞋi Hadadezeru kolobo ka Rehobu mogono ma Zoba n kuvon. Ili i nampa ya i gita̱ ta̱ a makyan ma na Hadadezeru wi a nwalu a kubana e kuyene ku Yufiretu, Adama a na u doku u bonoko n utsura u ni ɗe. <verse eid="2SA 8:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2SA 8:4" />Ɗa Dawuda wu isai akumbi odoku o mogono ma Zoba ka̱kpa̱n n amangatawencindere (1,700) n osoji a iɗika a̱kpa̱n kamanga (20,000). Ɗa Dawuda u gbatyasai ene odoku e le ra̱ka̱, ama ɗa u ka̱sukpa̱i o yoku adama ekeke odoku amangatawun (100). <verse eid="2SA 8:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2SA 8:5" />Ama ana osoji aza a Siriya vu Dimaska a̱ ta̱wa̱i adama a na a̱ ɓa̱nka̱ Hadadezeru mogono ma Zoba, ɗa Dawuda wu unai osoji a̱kpa̱n kamanga n ere (22,000) e le. <verse eid="2SA 8:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2SA 8:6" />Ɗa Dawuda va u zuwai a̱tsura̱ osoji a̱ ni a Siriya vu Dimaska, ɗa aza a Siriya okpoi agbashi a̱ ni, ɗa a̱ ka̱na̱i ku ta̱wa̱sa̱ka̱ yi n utafu. Vuzavaguɗu u tsu neke ta̱ Dawuda ulyaꞋi a̱ ubuta̱ dem u na u banai. <verse eid="2SA 8:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2SA 8:7" />Ɗa Dawuda u pura̱i nra̱ga̱ ma azanariya m aza e kelime n Hadadezeru ɗa u bankai a Urushelima. <verse eid="2SA 8:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2SA 8:8" />Ɗa kpamu u pura̱i iyum i shili n a̱bunda̱i ya aza a Beta m Berotayi vu likuci i tsugono tsu Hadadezeru.<verse eid="2SA 8:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="2SA 8:9" />Ana mogono Toyi ma aza a Hamata u panai arabali a danai Dawuda u lyaꞋa ta̱ osoji a Hadadezeru n kuvon ra̱ka̱, <verse eid="2SA 8:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2SA 8:10" />ɗa u suki kolobo ka̱ ni Joram<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">8:10 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Joram </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Va a̱ ubuta̱ u yoku e ci ɗeke yi ta̱ Hadoram.</char></note> u mogono Dawuda adama a na u kya̱sa̱ yi, ɗa kpamu u cikpai ni adama a na Dawuda u shilika̱ ta̱ n Hadadezeru ɗa kpamu u ciya̱i ulyaꞋi, Toyi u yaꞋan ta̱ nannai adama a na a̱yi Hadadezeru wi ta̱ o kuvon n a̱yi ayin tutu. A̱yi Joram va u tuka̱i ta̱ ucanuku wa azurufa n azanariya koɓolo n iyum i shili. <verse eid="2SA 8:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2SA 8:11" />Ɗa mogono Dawuda we erengi ucanuku wa u Vuzavaguɗu ra̱ka̱ uteku tsu na u yaꞋin n azurufa koɓolo n azanariya a na u pura̱i a uduniyan u na u lyaꞋi n kuvon. <verse eid="2SA 8:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2SA 8:12" />Uduniyan wa ele ɗa Edom m Mowabu n Amon n aza a Filisitiya, n aza a Ameleki. Ɗa kpamu we erengi ucanuku u na u pura̱i u Hadadezeru kolobo ka Rehobu mogono ma Zoba.<verse eid="2SA 8:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="2SA 8:13" />Ɗa Dawuda u yaꞋin kula ana u bonoi n ubuta̱ u kuvon, wu unai uma a Edom a̱kpa̱n kupa n kula̱i (18,000) a̱ ka̱ra̱Ꞌa̱ ka mkpaɗi. <verse eid="2SA 8:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2SA 8:14" />Ɗa Dawuda u zuwai a̱tsura̱ osoji a̱ ni a iɗika i Edom ra̱ka̱. Ɗa aza a Edom okpoi agbashi a̱ ni. Vuzavaguɗu u nekei Dawuda ulyaꞋi a̱ ubuta̱ u na u banai dem.<verse eid="2SA 8:14" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Aza e kelime a ulinga a Dawuda</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="1CH 18:14-17">1 Ar 18:14-17</ref>; <ref loc="2SA 20:23-26">2 Sam 20:23-26</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="2SA 8:15" />Ɗa Dawuda u lyaꞋi tsugono wa aza a Isaraila ra̱ka̱. Ɗa u yaꞋin kasingai n ukuna wu usuɓi a̱ ubuta̱ u uma ra̱ka̱. <verse eid="2SA 8:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2SA 8:16" />Jowabu vuza na e ci ɗeke a̱na̱ku a̱ ni Zeruya, a̱yi ɗa kovonshi vo osoji. Johoshafatu kolobo ka Ahiludu wo okpoi kaɗani ka tsumani. <verse eid="2SA 8:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2SA 8:17" />Zadoku kolobo ka Ahitubu koɓolo n Ahimeleki kolobo ka Abiyata ele ɗa anan ganu. Seraya ɗa kaɗani. <verse eid="2SA 8:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2SA 8:18" />Benaya kolobo ka Jehoyida, a̱yi ɗa vuza kelime va aza a Keritiya n aza a Peletiya, ɗaɗa osoji a kindi ku Dawuda. Ɗa olobo a Dawuda tamkpamu okpoi anan ganu.<verse eid="2SA 8:18" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2SA 8" />
  <chapter number="9" style="c" sid="2SA 9" />
  <para style="s1">Dawuda u panai asuvayali a Mefiboshetu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2SA 9:1" />Kanna ke te ɗa Dawuda u yaꞋin keci, u danai, &lt;&lt;Vuza wi ta̱ lo a kpaꞋa ku Shawulu vuza na u buwai n wuma, an ma kuyaꞋanka yi kasingai, adama a Janata?&gt;&gt; <verse eid="2SA 9:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2SA 9:2" />A makyan ma nanlo ma kagbashi ka kpaꞋa ka Shawulu ko yongo ta̱ lo tana, vuza na e ci ɗeke Ziba. Ɗa e ɗekei ni u bana a̱ ubuta̱ u Dawuda. Ɗa mogono me ecei ni,&lt;&lt;Avu ɗa Ziba?&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2SA 9:2">Ɗa u danai,&lt;&lt;Vuzagbayin, mpa ɗa kagbashi ka̱ nu.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="2SA 9:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="2SA 9:3" />Ɗa mogono me ecei ni u danai, &lt;&lt;Vuma vi yoku u buwa lo a kpaꞋa ku Shawulu an ma kuyaꞋanka yi kasingai ka̱ Ka̱shile ba?&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2SA 9:3">Ɗa Ziba wu ushuki mogono, &lt;&lt;Kolobo ka Janata ka buwa ta̱ lo. Ama ka̱kutsuma̱ kaꞋa.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="2SA 9:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="2SA 9:4" />Ɗa mogono Dawuda we ecei u danai, &lt;&lt;Te ɗai wi?&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2SA 9:4">Ɗa Ziba wu ushuki u danai, &lt;&lt;Wi ta̱ ɗe a kpaꞋa ku Makiru kolobo ka Amiyelu, a̱ likuci i Lodeba.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="2SA 9:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2SA 9:5" />Ɗa Mogono Dawuda ma̱ suki a bana a̱ ta̱wa̱ n a̱yi ɗe a kpaꞋa ku Makiru kolobo ka Amiyelu ɗe a̱ likuci i Lodeba. <verse eid="2SA 9:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2SA 9:6" />Ana Mefiboshetu kolobo ka Janata, matsukaya ma Shawulu u yawai u Dawuda, ɗa u kuɗa̱ngi ali iɗika u yaꞋin ikya̱shi.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2SA 9:6">Ɗa Dawuda u danai, &lt;&lt;Mefiboshetu.&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2SA 9:6">Ɗa wu ushuki, &lt;&lt;Vuzagbayin, wuma u nu u geshe, kagbashi ka̱ nu ka na.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="2SA 9:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="2SA 9:7" />Ɗa Dawuda u danai ni, &lt;&lt;Ka̱ta̱ vu pana wovon ba, mi ta̱ a kuyaꞋanka wu kasingai adama esheku a̱ nu Janata. Mi ta̱ o kubonoko wu n iɗika ya akaya a̱ nu Shawulu ra̱ka̱, ka̱ta̱ avu a̱ ka̱ci ka̱ nu vu lyaꞋa ilikulya i va̱ ayin dem.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="2SA 9:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2SA 9:8" />Ɗa Mefiboshetu u doku u kuɗa̱ngi u kya̱sa̱i mogono, ɗa u danai, &lt;&lt;Mpa ɗa ya, an va kuneke mu tsugbayin, mpa n laꞋa ta̱ mesheꞋe ma na ma̱ kuwa̱i?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="2SA 9:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="2SA 9:9" />Ɗa Mogono Dawuda u ɗekei Ziba, kagbashi ka Shawulu, u danai ni, &lt;&lt;N neke ta̱ Mefiboshetu matsukaya ma Shawulu vuzagbayin vu nu ili ra̱ka̱ i na yi i kpaꞋa ku Shawulu. <verse eid="2SA 9:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2SA 9:10" />Ama avu n olobo a̱ nu n agbashi a̱ nu, yi ta̱ a̱ kuka̱na̱ kucimbasa ka muku n Shawulu, ka̱ta̱ i ta̱wa̱sa̱ka̱ le n i na i cimbai adama a na a̱ ciya̱ ilikulyaꞋa. Ama Mefiboshetu wi ta̱ a kulyaꞋa ilikulyaꞋa i va̱ ayin tutu.&gt;&gt; Ziba tana wi ta̱ n olobo kupa n a tawun n agbashi kamanga. <verse eid="2SA 9:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2SA 9:11" />Ɗa Ziba u danai Mogono, &lt;&lt;Kagbashi ka̱ nu ki ta̱ a kuyaꞋan ili derere uteku tsu na vuzagbayin mogono ma danai ni u yaꞋan.&gt;&gt; Ɗa Mefiboshetu u lyaꞋi ilikulya i kpaꞋa ku Dawuda an muku n mogono. <verse eid="2SA 9:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2SA 9:12" />Mefiboshetu wi ta̱ n kolobo ka na e ci ɗeke kula Mika. Ɗa aza na i ida̱shi a kpaꞋa ku Ziba ra̱ka̱ o okpoi agbashi a Mefiboshetu. <verse eid="2SA 9:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2SA 9:13" />Mefiboshetu u da̱sa̱ngu ta̱ a Urushelima, u tsu lyaꞋa ta̱ ilikulyaꞋa i ni a kirukpa ku mogono ayin tutu. A̱yi ta na ka̱kutsuma̱ kaꞋa e ene e re dem.<verse eid="2SA 9:13" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2SA 9" />
  <chapter number="10" style="c" sid="2SA 10" />
  <para style="s1">Dawuda u lyaꞋi aza a Amon n aza a Siriya n kuvon</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="1CH 19:1-19">1 Ar 19:1-19</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2SA 10:1" />Ana i lo ɗa mogono Nahashi ma aza a Amon ma̱ kuwa̱i, ɗa Hanun kolobo ka̱ ni ko okpoi mogono a̱ una̱ u ni. <verse eid="2SA 10:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2SA 10:2" />Ɗa Dawuda u danai, &lt;&lt;Mpa n kuyaꞋanka ta̱ Hanun kolobo ka Nahashi kasingai, tsu na esheku a̱ ni a yaꞋankai mu kasingai.&gt;&gt; Ɗa Dawuda u suki uma adama a na a bana a̱ kya̱sa̱ Hanun adama a ukpa̱ we esheku ni.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2SA 10:2">Ama ana uma a Dawuda a yawai ɗe a iɗika i Amon, <verse eid="2SA 10:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2SA 10:3" />ɗa nkoshi m gba̱ra̱-gba̱ra̱ ma aza a Amon a danai Mogono me le Hanun, &lt;&lt;Avu vu shesheta̱ Dawuda wi ta̱ a kucikpa esheku a̱ nu, a na u suki aza a ikya̱shi wa̱ nu? Dawuda va ugboji u ɗa yi, adama a na u saka iɗika ya u yeve utsura u tsu ka̱ta̱ u lyaꞋa tsu n kuvon.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="2SA 10:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2SA 10:4" />Adama a nannai, ɗa Hanun u remei agbashi a Dawuda adama a na u neke le wono, ɗa u punai le ntsa̱ka̱ apashi e te-te, ɗa u karai ntogu n le e mere-mere a uɓon wa atagulu, ɗa u ka̱sukpa̱i le a laza.<verse eid="2SA 10:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="2SA 10:5" />Ama o bono a kpaꞋa ba adama a na a pana ta̱ wono ka̱u. Ana a danai Dawuda ukuna u nampa, ɗa u suki a gasa n ele, ɗa a danai mogono ma dana ta̱, &lt;&lt;I shamgba a̱ likuci i Jeriko ali ayin a na ntsa̱ka̱ n ɗa̱ n topoi, ka̱ta̱ i yeve i bono a kpaꞋa.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="2SA 10:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="2SA 10:6" />Ana aza a Amon e yevei okpo ta̱ a tsurala n Dawuda ka̱u adama a ili i na a yaꞋin. Ɗa a banai a ɗikai osoji a iɗika i Siriya vu Betu-rehobu n aza a Zoba uma a̱kpa̱n kamanga (20,000), ɗa a ɗikai kpamu osoji a̱kpa̱n kupa n ere (12,000) a Toba. O doki kpamu m mogono ma MaꞋaka koɓolo n osoji a̱ ni ka̱kpa̱n ke te (1,000). <verse eid="2SA 10:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2SA 10:7" />Ana Dawuda u panai nannai, ɗa u suki Jowabu n osoji a̱ ni ra̱ka̱ a na fuɗai kuvon, <verse eid="2SA 10:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2SA 10:8" />Ɗa aza a Amon uta̱i ɗa a darai kuyaꞋan kuvon, a̱ gita̱i a̱ utsutsu u likuci, ama ele aza a Siriya vu Zoba n va aza a Rehobu, n aza Toba n aza a MaꞋaka tamkpamu a shamgbai uɓon u le kau.<verse eid="2SA 10:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="2SA 10:9" />Ana Jowabu we enei kuvon ka ku kanza yi ta̱ kelime n ka̱ca̱pa̱, ɗa u zagbai ovonshi Isaraila a na fuɗai kuvon ɗa u zuwai le a̱ shilika̱ n aza a Siriya. <verse eid="2SA 10:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2SA 10:10" />Aza a na a buwai tamkpamu ɗa u ka̱sukpa̱i le e ekiye a Abishayi vuza ni u tono n ele, ɗa u darai le a̱ shilika̱ n aza a Amon. <verse eid="2SA 10:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2SA 10:11" />Ɗa Jowabu u danai Abishayi, &lt;&lt;Ɗa baci vi enei aza a Siriya a lyaꞋi utsura u va̱, ka̱ta̱ vu ta̱wa̱ vu ɓa̱nka̱ mu, ama ɗa baci me enei aza a Amon a lyaꞋi utsura u nu, ka̱ta̱ n ta̱wa̱ m ɓa̱nka̱ wu. <verse eid="2SA 10:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2SA 10:12" />Gbamai asuvu, ka̱ta̱ kpamu ci shilika̱ ka̱u adama a uma a̱ tsu n likuci i Ka̱shile ka̱ tsu. Ka̱sukpa̱ Vuzavaguɗu u yaꞋan i na i gaꞋin ni.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="2SA 10:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="2SA 10:13" />Ana Jowabu n osoji a̱ ni a yawai ɗevu adama a na a̱ shilika̱ n osoji a Siriya, ɗa aza a Siriya a sumai. <verse eid="2SA 10:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2SA 10:14" />Ana aza a Amon enei aza a Siriya a suma ta̱, ɗa ele feu a sumai a̱ ka̱sukpa̱i Abishayi o bonoi a̱ likuci i le a Raba. Ɗa Jowabu n osoji aza a Isaraila a̱ ka̱sukpa̱i kuvon n aza a Amon ɗa o bonoi a Urushelima.<verse eid="2SA 10:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="2SA 10:15" />Ama a na aza a Siriya enei aza a Isaraila a lyaꞋa le ta̱ n kuvon, ɗa o doku o ɓolongi ka̱ci ke le. <verse eid="2SA 10:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2SA 10:16" />Ɗa Hadadezeru mogono ma Zoba u suki a bana a̱ tuka̱ n osoji aza a Siriya a na i upashi u kuyene ku Yufiretu. Ɗa a yawai a Helam ekiye a Shobaka kovonshi vo osoji a Hadadezeru. <verse eid="2SA 10:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2SA 10:17" />Ana Dawuda u panai arabali, ɗa u ɓolongi osoji a Isaraila ra̱ka̱ ɗa a pasai Kuyene ku Urudu a kubana a Helam. Ɗa osoji a Siriya foɓusoi ka̱ci ke le a̱ shilika̱i n Dawuda. <verse eid="2SA 10:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2SA 10:18" />Ɗa aza a Siriya a sumai a̱ ka̱sukpa̱i aza a Isaraila, ɗa Dawuda wu unai osoji aza a Siriya aza ekeke o doku amangatawencindere (700) n aza o doku a̱kpa̱n amangere (40,000). Ɗa kpamu u lapai Shobaku kovonshi vo osoji a Siriya, ali ɗa u kuwa̱i ɗe. <verse eid="2SA 10:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="2SA 10:19" />Ana ngono ra̱ka̱ n na mi anan taji a Hadadezeru e enei aza a Isaraila a lyaꞋa le ta̱, ɗa a̱ la̱nsa̱i ma̱ta̱na̱ n aza a Isaraila a, ɗa okpoi agbashi e le. Adama a nannai ɗa aza a Siriya a panai wovon u na o kudoku kuɓa̱nka̱ aza a Amon.<verse eid="2SA 10:19" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2SA 10" />
  <chapter number="11" style="c" sid="2SA 11" />
  <para style="s1">Dawuda koɓolo m Betsheba</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2SA 11:1" />Ana ka̱ya̱ ko doku ko bonoi, a ayin a na ngono n tsu uta̱ kuvon, ɗa Dawuda u suki Jowabu n aza e kelime ko osoji a̱ ni koɓolo n osoji aza a Isaraila ra̱ka̱, a bana una aza Amon. Ɗa kpamu a kanzai likuci i Raba. Ama ɗa Dawuda u shamgbai a Urushelima. <verse eid="2SA 11:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2SA 11:2" />Kanna ko yoku n kulivi, Dawuda u ɗa̱nga̱i a̱ ubuta̱ u kuvuka u ni, ɗa wu uta̱i a̱ kuka̱ra̱sa̱ a gaɗi e kefeku ko tsugono ka̱ ni, ɗa we enei vuka a̱ kusumba̱ a̱ kushiri. Vuka va tana wi ta̱ n tsuloboi ka̱u. <verse eid="2SA 11:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2SA 11:3" />Ɗa Dawuda u suki agbashi a̱ ni ece ko vuka vu yayi. Ɗa kabara ka ko bonoi ka danai Dawuda, &lt;&lt;Vuka va kula ku ni ku ɗa Betusheba. Mekere ma Eliyam, vuka vu Uriya vuza vu Hitiya.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="2SA 11:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2SA 11:4" />Ɗa Dawuda u suki a bana e ɗeke yi, ana u yawai a kpaꞋa ku mogono ma, ɗa tana mogono ma ma vaki n a̱yi. Wana ɗai tana vuka va vu kotso kutakpa nshinda̱ ana we enei kusumbu ku ni, ɗa tana u bonoi a kpaꞋa. <verse eid="2SA 11:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2SA 11:5" />Ɗa tana vuka va vu ɗikai ka̱tsuma̱, ɗa u suꞋuki n akaka a dana mogono Dawuda, &lt;&lt;Mi ta̱ n ka̱tsuma̱.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="2SA 11:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2SA 11:6" />Ɗa Dawuda u suki n akaka a dana kovonshi vo osoji a̱ ni, Jowabu,&lt;&lt;SuꞋuku mu n Uriya vuza vu Hitiya.&gt;&gt;Ɗa Jowabu u suki Uriya u Dawuda. <verse eid="2SA 11:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2SA 11:7" />Ana Uriya u yawai, ɗa Dawuda we ecei ni ko Jowabu n osoji a̱ ni i ta̱ ɗe m ma̱ta̱na̱, n uteku tsu na kuvon ka ki ɗe. <verse eid="2SA 11:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2SA 11:8" />Ɗa Dawuda u danai ni, &lt;&lt;Bana vu uvuka biꞋi kenu a kpaꞋa ku nu.&gt;&gt; Ana Uriya wu uta̱i e kefeku ko mogono ka, ɗa mogono ma zuwai o tonoi ni n ili i kulyaꞋa. <verse eid="2SA 11:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2SA 11:9" />Ama Uriya u bana a kpaꞋa ku ni ba, ɗa wa asai lo a̱ utsutsu u kefeku ko mogono koɓolo n agbashi a vuzagbayin vi ni. <verse eid="2SA 11:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2SA 11:10" />Ana a danai Dawuda Uriya va u wu asa a kpaꞋa ba, ɗa u ɗeke ni we ecei ni, &lt;&lt;Yiɗa̱i i zuwai ɗa vu kpa̱ɗa̱i kubana a kpaꞋa? Avu na vi ishi vi yaꞋin nwalu?&gt;&gt; <verse eid="2SA 11:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2SA 11:11" />Ɗa Uriya u danai mogono Dawuda, &lt;&lt;Akpati vu uzuwakpani, n osoji a Isaraila n Yahuda i ta̱ ɗe a a̱pa̱m. Vuza vu kelime vu va̱ Jowabu n aza a gbagbaꞋin osoji i ta̱ ɗe e keteshe. Nini ɗai n kubana a kpaꞋa ku va̱ n lyaꞋa n soꞋo ka̱ta̱ kpamu n vaku n vuka vu va̱? N kucuna ta̱ mpa ma kuyaꞋan ili i nanlo ba.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="2SA 11:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2SA 11:12" />Ɗa Dawuda u danai Uriya, &lt;&lt;Doku vu asa na anana, ka̱ta̱ mkpa n yeve n dana wu vu wala vu bono ɗe.&gt;&gt; Ɗa Uriya u doku wa asai lo a Urushelima. <verse eid="2SA 11:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2SA 11:13" />Ana kayin ka asai ɗa Dawuda u ɗekei ni u ta̱wa̱ u lyaꞋa ilikulyaꞋa, ɗa kpamu u zuwai ni u soꞋi ma̱ra̱ ali ma makai ni. Ama n nannai dem Uriya u bana wa asa a kpaꞋa ku ni kayin ka nanlo ba, ɗa u vaki a kajiba wa asai e kefeku ko mogono koɓolo n agbashi a vuzagbayin vi ni.<verse eid="2SA 11:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="2SA 11:14" />Ana kayin ka asai n usana, ɗa Dawuda u ɗanai katagarda ka akaka ɗa u nekei Uriya u banka Jowabu. <verse eid="2SA 11:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2SA 11:15" />Punu akaka a u dana ta̱ Jowabu, &lt;&lt;Banka Uriya kelime a̱ ubuta̱ u na vishili vu laꞋi n usuɗukpi, ka̱ta̱ i bono n ka̱ca̱pa̱ i ka̱sukpa̱ a una yi.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="2SA 11:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2SA 11:16" />Ana Jowabu u yawai n vishili ɗevu n likuci ya, ɗa u zuwai Uriya u shamgba a̱ ubuta̱ u na u yevei osoji aza a Amon a na fuɗai kuvon i. <verse eid="2SA 11:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2SA 11:17" />Ana osoji a̱ likuci a̱ uta̱i a̱ shilika̱i n Jowabu, ɗa a unai osoji a Dawuda o yoku. Koɓolo n Uriya vuza vu Hitiya feu punu. <verse eid="2SA 11:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2SA 11:18" />Ɗa Jowabu u suki n akaka a bana a dana Dawuda tsu na kuvon ka ki a nwalu. <verse eid="2SA 11:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="2SA 11:19" />Ɗa Jowabu u danai vuza vu usuki va, &lt;&lt;Dana mogono Dawuda uteku tsu na kuvon ki a nwalu ra̱ka̱. <verse eid="2SA 11:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="2SA 11:20" />Ɗa baci vu enei mogono ma yaꞋin wupa ali ɗa we ecei nu, &lt;Yiɗa̱i i zuwai ali ɗa i yawai ɗevu n likuci ya n vishili? A̱ɗa̱ i yeve a na a kufuɗa kutawa ɗa̱ n ayaꞋa n tsu nshilya ba? <verse eid="2SA 11:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="2SA 11:21" />I ciɓa n ili i na i ciya̱i Abimeleki maku ma Jerubeshetu ba? Na ɗe a Tebezu vuka ɗa vu taɗuki kutali a mashilya ma̱ likuci ma, ɗa tana ku varai ni a kaci ɗa u kuwa̱i lo. Adama a̱ yiɗa̱i i banai ɗevu m mashilya ma̱ likuci ma?&gt; Dawuda mogono we ece wu baci nannai, ka̱ta̱ vu dana yi, &lt;Kagbashi ka̱ nu Uriya vuza vu Hitiya feu u kuwa̱ ta̱.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:21 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JDG 9:53">Aza 9:53</ref></char></note>&gt; &gt;&gt; <verse eid="2SA 11:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="2SA 11:22" />Ɗa tana vuza vu usuki va u banai u danai Dawuda ili i na Jowabu u danai ni ra̱ka̱. <verse eid="2SA 11:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="2SA 11:23" />Ɗa vuza vu suki va u danai Dawuda, &lt;&lt;Irala i tsu yi uta̱ ta̱ adama a na a̱ shilika̱ n a̱tsu e keteshe, ɗa tana tsu lokoi le a kubana a̱ utsutsu u likuci. <verse eid="2SA 11:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="2SA 11:24" />Ɗa aza a̱ vishili e le a na i a kuyaꞋan vishili nu njiki, a taki ayaꞋa n tsu mashilya ɗa a unai osoji a̱ nu o yoku. Ali kagbashi ka̱ nu Uriya feu u kuwa̱i.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="2SA 11:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="2SA 11:25" />Ɗa Dawuda u danai vuza vu suki va,&lt;&lt;Bono ɗe vu dana Jowabu kadanshi ka nampa ka, &lt;Ka̱ta̱ u na̱mgba̱ ka̱tsuma̱ adama a kakuna ka nampa ba, adama a na kotokobi ka tsu zagba vuza na wa kuna ba. Dana yi u lulukpa̱ ka̱ta̱ kpamu u doku utsura ali u la̱nga̱sa̱ i ɗa ra̱ka̱-ra̱ka̱.&gt; Dokushi nannai.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="2SA 11:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="2SA 11:26" />Ana vuka vu Uriya Betsheba u panai vali vu ni vu kuwa̱ ta̱, ɗa u yaꞋin kpalu adama a vali vu ni. <verse eid="2SA 11:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="2SA 11:27" />Ana ayin a kpalu a lazai, ɗa Dawuda u suki a̱ tuka̱ yi m Betsheba va a kpaꞋa ku ni, ɗa wo okpoi vuka vu ni ali ɗa tana u matsakai ni maku mo kolobo. Ama Vuzavaguɗu u pana uyoꞋo n ili i na Dawuda u yaꞋin va ba.<verse eid="2SA 11:27" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2SA 11" />
  <chapter number="12" style="c" sid="2SA 12" />
  <para style="s1">Natan u ɓarangi Dawuda</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2SA 12:1" />Vuzavaguɗu u suki Natan keneki a kubana u Dawuda. Ana u yawai, ɗa u danai ni, &lt;&lt;Uma ere o yoku i ta̱ o kuyongo a̱ likuci i yoku, vuza te a̱ ka̱tsuma̱ ke le wi ta̱ n uciyi vuza te kpamu vuza yali ɗa. <verse eid="2SA 12:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2SA 12:2" />Vuza vu uciyi va wi ta̱ n ushiga wu nkyon n wu nraɗika n wa anaka n a̱bunda̱i. <verse eid="2SA 12:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2SA 12:3" />Ama vuza yali va wi n ili ba, maku ma mashan mo mokyon maꞋa koci ma na u tsulai. Ɗa u ɓa̱na̱i maꞋa ali mo gbonguroi a kpaꞋa ku ni koɓolo m muku n ni. U tsu lyaꞋa ta̱ ilikulyaꞋa koɓolo n a̱yi, u tsu soꞋo ta̱ mini o mokoꞋo me te n a̱yi, kpamu u tsu lata ta̱ a̱ nkuta̱ n ni. Wo okpoi an maku me mekere ma umaci ma̱ ni. <verse eid="2SA 12:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2SA 12:4" />Ɗa kanna ke te vuza vu uciyi va u yaꞋin komoci, ama u ciga ku uta̱ka̱ malala me te ko kanaka asuvu a ushiga u ni u kiɗaka komoci ka ba. Ama ɗa u kucikpa u kiɗakai komoci ka̱ ni mokyon ma vuza vu yali va.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="2SA 12:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="2SA 12:5" />Ɗa Dawuda u na̱mgba̱i ka̱ɗu ka̱u adama a ili i na vuza vu uciyi va u yaꞋin, ɗa u danai keneki Natan, &lt;&lt;N kucuna ta̱ n Vuzavaguɗu vu na wi n wuma, vuma vu na u yaꞋin ili i nampa ya u yawa ta̱ a una yi. <verse eid="2SA 12:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2SA 12:6" />Mayun ɗa u tsupa vuza yali va mashan mo mokyon ma ali kuna̱shi, adama a unambi wa asuvayali a na u yaꞋankai vuza yali va.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="2SA 12:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="2SA 12:7" />Ɗa Natan u danai Dawuda, &lt;&lt;Avu ɗa vuma va! Ili i na Vuzavaguɗu Ka̱shile ki Isaraila u danai ɗaɗa, &lt;Mpa ɗa n erengi nu vu okpo mogono mi Isaraila, ɗa kpamu mi isai nu ekiye a Shawulu. <verse eid="2SA 12:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2SA 12:8" />Ɗa n nekei nu tsugono tsu Shawulu tsa koɓolo n a̱ma̱ci a̱ ni dem. Ɗa kpamu n zuwai nu vo okpo mogono ma aza a Isaraila n Yahuda. Ishi baci vu dana mu ta̱ ili i nanlo i yawa wu ba, mishi o kudoku wu i na i laꞋi i nanlo. <verse eid="2SA 12:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2SA 12:9" />Yiɗa̱i i zuwai ɗa vu goyoi kadanshi ka Vuzavaguɗu ali ɗa vu yaꞋin ili i gbani-gbani i nampa a̱ a̱shi a̱ ni? Vu una ta̱ Uriya vuma vu Hitiya n kotokobi ka aza a Amon, ɗa vu ɗikai vuka vu ni. <verse eid="2SA 12:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2SA 12:10" />Adama a nannai, a tsukaya dem a kunamba vuza na u kubana ukpa̱ u kotokobi a kpaꞋa ku nu ba, adama a na vu goyo mu ta̱ ali ɗa vu ɗikai vuka vu Uriya vuza vu Hitiya ɗa wo okpoi vuka vu nu.&gt; <verse eid="2SA 12:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2SA 12:11" />Ili i na Vuzavaguɗu u danai i ɗanna, &lt;Mi ta̱ a̱ kutuka̱ wu n kawuya a kpaꞋa ku nu. Ka̱ta̱ n ɗika a̱ma̱ci a̱ nu n neke vuza na yi a̱ ida̱shi ɗeɗevu, ka̱ta̱ kpamu u vaku n a̱ma̱ci a̱ nu n kanna e keteshe. <verse eid="2SA 12:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2SA 12:12" />Avu vu yaꞋan ta̱ i ɗa u sokongi, ama mpa mi ta̱ a kuzuwa a yaꞋanka vuka vu nu a̱ a̱shi aza a Isaraila ra̱ka̱.&gt; &gt;&gt;<verse eid="2SA 12:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="2SA 12:13" />Ɗa Dawuda u danai Natan, &lt;&lt;N yaꞋanka ta̱ Vuzavaguɗu unushi.&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2SA 12:13">Ɗa Natan wu ushuki, &lt;&lt;Vuzavaguɗu u cinukpaka wu ta̱ n unushi u nu. Vi a̱ kukuwa̱ ba. <verse eid="2SA 12:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2SA 12:14" />Ama adama a ili i na vu yaꞋin, i zuwa ta̱ irala i Vuzavaguɗu i lukanasai kula ku ni. Maku ma na a kumatsaka wu va mi ta̱ a̱ kukuwa̱.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="2SA 12:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="2SA 12:15" />Ɗa Natan u bonoi a kpaꞋa ku ni. Ɗa Vuzavaguɗu u zuwakai maku ma na vuka vu Uriya vu matsakai Dawuda va mɓa̱la̱, ɗa tana maku ma ma vaki mɓa̱la̱. <verse eid="2SA 12:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2SA 12:16" />Ɗa Dawuda u folonoi Ka̱shile adama a na u potsokpo maku ma. Ɗa u ka̱na̱i una̱ u lyaꞋa ili ba ɗa u uwai asuvu a̱ kunu ku ni ɗa u vaki a iɗika kayin ka̱ɓula̱. <verse eid="2SA 12:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2SA 12:17" />Ɗa nkoshi m gba̱ra̱-gba̱ra̱ m kpaꞋa ku Dawuda n yawai ɗevu n a̱yi adama a na n ɗa̱ngusa̱ yi a iɗika ya, ama ɗa u iwain, ali ɗa kpamu u iwain kulyaꞋa ilikulya n e le. <verse eid="2SA 12:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2SA 12:18" />A kanna ke cindere ɗa maku ma ma̱ kuwa̱i. Ɗa agbashi a Dawuda a panai wovon u kudana yi maku ma ma̱ kuwa̱ ta̱. Adama a na e sheshe ta̱, a danai, &lt;&lt;Ayin a na maku ma mi n wuma tsu yaꞋankai ni kadanshi ama u keɓece tsu ukuna ba, nini ɗai tsa kudana yi maku ma ma̱ kuwa̱ ta̱? Wi ta̱ a kufuɗa kuyaꞋanka ka̱ci ka̱ ni muna.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="2SA 12:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="2SA 12:19" />Ana Dawuda we enei agbashi a̱ ni a kuyaꞋankpanai kadanshi atsuvu, ɗa Dawuda u yevei a na maku ma ma̱ kuwa̱ ta̱. Ɗa wu ecei agbashi a̱ ni, &lt;&lt;Maku ma ma̱ kuwa̱ ta̱?&gt;&gt; Ɗa a̱ ushuki, &lt;&lt;E, u kuwa̱ ta̱.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="2SA 12:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="2SA 12:20" />Ɗa Dawuda u ɗa̱nga̱i a iɗika ya u sumba̱i u sukuya̱i maniꞋin, ɗa u sabaꞋi ucanuku. Ɗa u banai a kpaꞋa ku Vuzavaguɗu u cikpai ni. Ɗa u bonoi a kpaꞋa ku ni, u danai e neke yi ilikulyaꞋa, ɗa u lyaꞋi. <verse eid="2SA 12:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="2SA 12:21" />Ɗa nkoshi m gba̱ra̱-gba̱ra̱ me ecei ni, a danai, &lt;&lt;Yiɗa̱i i zuwai ɗa vi yaꞋin ili tsu nampa? Vu ka̱na̱ ta̱ una̱ ali ɗa kpamu vu shika̱i a makyan ma na maku ma̱ nu ma mi n wuma, ama ana maku ma ma̱ kuwa̱i, vu ɗa̱nga̱ ta̱ ali ɗa kpamu vu lyaꞋi ilikulyaꞋa.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="2SA 12:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="2SA 12:22" />Ɗa u danai, &lt;&lt;Ana maku ma mi n wuma, n ka̱na̱ ta̱ una̱ ɗa kpamu n shika̱i. Nsheshe ta̱, &lt;Yayi u yevei? U gaꞋan ba Vuzavaguɗu wi ta̱ a kupana asuvayali a̱ va̱ ali u ka̱sukpa̱ maku ma n wuma.&gt; <verse eid="2SA 12:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="2SA 12:23" />Ama gogo na u kuwa̱ ta̱. Yiɗa̱i i kuzuwa mu n ka̱na̱ una̱ u va̱? Mi ta̱ o kubonoko yi n wuma kpamu? Mpa ɗa n kubana wa̱ ni, ama a̱yi wi o kubono a̱ va̱ ba.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="2SA 12:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="2SA 12:24" />Ɗa Dawuda u nekei vuka vu ni Betsheba kadanshi, ɗa u doku vaki n vuka vu ni Betsheba, ɗa u yaꞋin ka̱tsuma̱. Ɗa u matsai maku mo kolobo, ɗa u nekei ni kula Sulemanu. Ɗa Vuzavaguɗu u cigai maku mo kolobo ma, <verse eid="2SA 12:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="2SA 12:25" />ɗa Vuzavaguɗu u suki n akaka a̱ una̱ u Natan u neꞋe maku ma kula Jedidiya<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">12:25 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Jedidiya </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ɗaɗa vuza vu na Vuzavaguɗu u cigai.</char></note>, adama a na u ciga yi ta̱.<verse eid="2SA 12:25" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Dawuda u lyaꞋi Raba n kuvon</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="1CH 20:1-3">1 Ar 20:1-3</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="2SA 12:26" />Ayin a na i lo ɗa Jowabu u bankai Raba Likuci i gbayin i Amuno n kuvon, ubuta̱ u na mogono me le mi, ɗa a ɗikai tsugbayin tsu likuci tsa. <verse eid="2SA 12:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="2SA 12:27" />Ɗa Jowabu u suꞋuki Dawuda n akaka, u danai, &lt;&lt;N shilika̱ ta̱ n likuci i Raba ɗa mi isai ubuta̱ u na a̱ ci ciya̱ mini. <verse eid="2SA 12:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="2SA 12:28" />Ɗa u danai, ɓolongu osoji a̱ nu i banka likuci ya n kuvon, vu isa i ɗa. Ɗa baci ba, mi ta̱ a kisa i ɗa n ka̱ci ka̱ va̱, ka̱ta̱ e ɗekushe i ɗa n kula ku va̱.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="2SA 12:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="2SA 12:29" />Ɗaɗa Dawuda u ɓolongi osoji a̱ ni ra̱ka̱ ɗa a bankai likuci i Raba n kuvon ali ɗa a lyaꞋi likuci ya. <verse eid="2SA 12:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="2SA 12:30" />Ɗa Dawuda u zuwai o foɗoi ma̱kun mo tsugono a kaci ko mogono me le, ɗa a kapaka yi ni maꞋa a kaci. A̱miki a̱ ma̱kun ma azanariya ma a yawa ta̱ a̱miki kilo kamangankupa n a tawun, ma̱kun mo tsugono ma mi ta̱ n tsuzogu tsa atali o tsuloboi upaɗi. Ɗa tana Dawuda u pura̱i ucanuku wa̱ a̱bunda̱i a suvu a̱ likuci ya. <verse eid="2SA 12:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="2SA 12:31" />Ɗa Dawuda u zuwai aza a̱ likuci a uta̱ ra̱ka̱ vu le, u zuwai le a yaꞋan kuvon n ugangafu, n arigida, n ogovu. Ɗa kpamu u zuwai le a yaꞋan iputa̱. Ɗa Dawuda u yaꞋankai likuci ya aza a Amuno i na i buwai nannai ra̱ka̱. Ɗa a̱yi koɓolo n osoji a̱ ni ra̱ka̱ a kpatalai o kubono a Urushelima.<verse eid="2SA 12:31" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2SA 12" />
  <chapter number="13" style="c" sid="2SA 13" />
  <para style="s1">Amunon n Tamaru</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2SA 13:1" />Abusalom maku ma Dawuda wi ta̱ n taku vu na wi n tsuloboi vuza na e ci ɗeke Tamaru, ɗa Amunon maku ma Dawuda ma̱ ka̱na̱i kuciga Tamaru va. <verse eid="2SA 13:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2SA 13:2" />Ɗa Amunon u ucigi ni gbani-gbani ali u ka̱na̱i mɓa̱la̱ adama taku vu ni Tamaru, we ne ta̱ adanshi wi a̱ kuciya̱ kuyaꞋan tsugbani n a̱yi ba, adama a na a̱yi Tamaru va ka̱ta̱ u yeve mavali ba. <verse eid="2SA 13:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2SA 13:3" />Ama Amunon va wi ta̱ n ka̱ja̱Ꞌa̱ ka̱ ni vuza kula Jonadabu maku ma Shimeya toku vu Dawuda. Jonadabu va wi ta̱ n ugboji ka̱u. <verse eid="2SA 13:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2SA 13:4" />Ɗa we ecei Amunon u danai, &lt;&lt;Yiɗa̱i i zuwai usana lakam vu yongo ka̱tsuma̱ una̱mgbi? Avu maku mo mogono ma ba? Dana mu.&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2SA 13:4">Ɗa Amunon wu ushuki, u danai, &lt;&lt;Mi ta̱ a kuciga Tamaru taku vu mokoshi ma̱ va̱ Abusalom.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="2SA 13:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="2SA 13:5" />Ɗa Jonadabu u danai ni, &lt;&lt;Bana vu vaku ka̱ta̱ vu dana vu pana uyoꞋo wi ikyamba i nu ba. Ɗa baci esheku a̱ nu a̱ ta̱wa̱i ku ene wu, ka̱ta̱ vu danai, &lt;YaꞋan taku vu va̱ Tamaru u ta̱wa̱ u neꞋeshe mu ilikulyaꞋa. Ka̱ta̱ kpamu u ta̱wa̱ u yaꞋanka mu ilikulyaꞋa ya a̱ a̱shi a̱ va̱, ali n lyaꞋa i na u yaꞋin n ekiye a̱ ni.&gt; &gt;&gt;<verse eid="2SA 13:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="2SA 13:6" />Ɗa Amunon u vaki a danshi ugaꞋin ba. Ana mogono Dawuda u ta̱wa̱i kene yi, ɗa Amunon u danai mogono ma, &lt;&lt;Mi ta̱ ufolu u nu danaka mu taku vu va̱ Tamaru u ta̱wa̱. Mi ta̱ a kuciga u yaꞋanka mu emeshe mpa e kene ka̱ta̱ u neꞋeshe mu.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="2SA 13:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2SA 13:7" />Ɗa Dawuda u suki a kpaꞋa a dana Tamaru, &lt;&lt;Bana a kpaꞋa ku taku vu nu Amunon vu yaꞋanka yi ilikulyaꞋa.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="2SA 13:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2SA 13:8" />Ɗa Tamaru u banai a kpaꞋa ku taku vu ni Amunon, a̱ ubuta̱ u na wi ivaꞋin. Ɗa u kenuki kiya ɗa u zuɓuki, ɗa u yaꞋankai ni emeshe a̱yi e kene. <verse eid="2SA 13:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2SA 13:9" />Ɗa u ɗikai kapara ɗa u kenuku ni emeshe a, ama ɗa u iwain kulyaꞋa. Ɗa Amunon u danai aza kuyaꞋanka yi ulinga a̱ uta̱ ra̱ka̱, ɗa ra̱ka̱ vu le a̱ uta̱i. <verse eid="2SA 13:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2SA 13:10" />Ɗa Amunon u danai Tamaru, &lt;&lt;Tuka̱ mu n ilikulyaꞋa a̱ kunu ki ivaꞋin ku va̱. Ka̱ta̱ vu neꞋeshe mu n kukiye ku nu n lyaꞋa.&gt;&gt; Ɗa Tamaru u ɗikai emeshe a na u yaꞋin va ɗa u banai n a ɗa a̱ kunu ki ivaꞋin ku taku vu ni Amunon. <verse eid="2SA 13:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2SA 13:11" />Ama ana u yawai ɗevu n a̱yi adama a na u neꞋeshe yi, ɗa u ka̱na̱i ni u danai, &lt;&lt;Taku vu va̱, ta̱wa̱ vu vaku nu mpa.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="2SA 13:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="2SA 13:12" />Ɗa wu ushuki ni u danai, &lt;&lt;A̱Ꞌa̱, taku vu va̱! Nannai va wi a kuyaꞋan ba, ka̱ta̱ kpamu vu zuwa mu n yaꞋan nannai n utsura ba. Adama a na a ci yaꞋan nannai a Isaraila ba, ka̱ta̱ vu yaꞋan ili i gbani-gbani i wono i nanlo ba. <verse eid="2SA 13:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2SA 13:13" />N yaꞋan ba ci nannai, teɗai n kuꞋuwa adama o wono? Avu feu i ta̱ o kubonoko wu vuza gbani-gbani a̱ ka̱tsuma̱ ka aza a Isaraila. Ama gogo na mi ta̱ ufolu u nu yaꞋan kadanshi m mogono, wi a̱ kusa̱nka̱ mu ku olo wu ba.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="2SA 13:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2SA 13:14" />Ama Amunon u panaka yi ba. Ana wo okpoi u laꞋa yi ta̱ utsura, ɗa u lyaꞋi ni utsura u yaꞋin tsugbani n a̱yi.<verse eid="2SA 13:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="2SA 13:15" />Ɗa Amunon u iwain Tamaru ka̱u, ali ɗa u laꞋi tsu na wi ishi a kuciga yi. Ɗa Amunon u danai ni, &lt;&lt;Ɗa̱nga̱ vu wala.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="2SA 13:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="2SA 13:16" />Ɗa Tamaru u danai ni, &lt;&lt;A̱Ꞌa̱ taku vu va̱, kuloko ku na vi a kuciga kuloko mu na wi ta̱ a kulaꞋa ili i na vu yaꞋankai mu ɗe n gbani-gbani.&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2SA 13:16">Ama Amuno u panaka yi ba. <verse eid="2SA 13:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2SA 13:17" />Ɗa u ɗekeshei maku mu ulinga ma̱ ni u danai ni, &lt;&lt;Utuka̱ vuka vu nampa va pulai, ka̱ta̱ vu ɓa̱ya̱ngu utsutsu wa.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="2SA 13:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2SA 13:18" />Ɗa maku mu ulinga ma̱ ni mu utukai ni pulai ɗa u ɓa̱ya̱ngi utsutsu wa. Tamaru va tana wi ta̱ u uki m motogu me ekiye a ugaɗi, adama a na ta nkere m kpaꞋa ku mogono, aza a na ka̱ta̱ e yevei ali ba a tsu uka. <verse eid="2SA 13:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="2SA 13:19" />Ɗa Tamaru u tsungi kokomo a kaci ka̱ ni adama o wono, ɗa kpamu u ka̱na̱i motogu ma̱ ni u karai. Ɗa u kiyangi ekiye a̱ ni a kaci u walai n u lapasai una̱. <verse eid="2SA 13:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="2SA 13:20" />Ana taku vu ni Abusalom we enei ni ɗa we ecei ni u danai, &lt;&lt;Amuno taku vu nu ɗa u vaki n avu? Gogo na paɗa bini taku vu va̱ ka̱ta̱ vu dana vuza ba. Ka̱ta̱ kpamu wo okpo wu ili i yoku ba, taku vu nu ɗa feu, ka̱ta̱ vu ka̱sukpa̱ i ɗa i la̱nga̱sa̱ wu ka̱ɗu ka̱u ba.&gt;&gt; Ɗa Tamaru u da̱sa̱ngi a kpaꞋa ku taku vu ni Abusalom endeꞋen.<verse eid="2SA 13:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="2SA 13:21" />Ana mogono Dawuda u panai ukuna wa ra̱ka̱, ɗa ka̱ɗu ka̱ ni ka̱ na̱mgba̱i ka̱u. <verse eid="2SA 13:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="2SA 13:22" />Ama Abusalom u keɓece Amuno kakuna ba, u iwan ta̱ Amuno adama a na u la̱nga̱sa̱ ta̱ taku vu ni Tamaru.<verse eid="2SA 13:22" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Abusalom wu unai Amuno</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="2SA 13:23" />Ana a̱ya̱ ere a lazai, ɗa Abusalom u danai a puna nlala n ni cileme ɗe a BaꞋalu Hazo likuci i na yi ɗevu n likuci i Ifirayimu. Ɗa Abusalom u banuki olobo o ngono ra̱ka̱. <verse eid="2SA 13:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="2SA 13:24" />Ɗa Abusalom u banai u mogono u danai ni, &lt;&lt;Wuma u nu u geshe, aza a na a kupuna ka mu cileme tsu nlala tsa a̱ ta̱wa̱ ta̱ kuyaꞋanka mu ulinga. Ko vi ta̱ a̱ kuta̱wa̱ koɓolo n abara a̱ nu ci yaꞋan ka̱ɗiva̱ ka koɓolo?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="2SA 13:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="2SA 13:25" />Ɗa mogono ma danai Abusalom, &lt;&lt;A̱Ꞌa̱ maku ma̱ va̱, tsa kubana ra̱ka̱ vu tsu ba, ci ta̱ a kuyaꞋan a̱bunda̱i.&gt;&gt; Ɗa Abusalom u gutsai ni, ama u iwain kubana ɗa u zuwakai ni una̱singai.<verse eid="2SA 13:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="2SA 13:26" />Ɗa Abusalom u danai, &lt;&lt;Vi baci a kubana ba, sai vu ka̱sukpa̱ Amuno vuza va̱ u bana koɓolo n a̱tsu.&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2SA 13:26">Ɗa mogono me ecei ni, &lt;&lt;Yiɗa̱i i zuwai ɗa vi a kuciga u bana koɓolo n a̱ɗa̱?&gt;&gt; <verse eid="2SA 13:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="2SA 13:27" />Ɗa Abusalom u gutsai ni, ali ɗa wu ushuki Amuno u bana koɓolo n a̱yi n olobo a̱ ni a na a buwai, ɗa a banai ra̱ka̱ n a̱yi.<verse eid="2SA 13:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="2SA 13:28" />Ɗa Abusalom u danai agbashi a̱ ni, &lt;&lt;Zukai, a makyan ma na baci ye enei Amuno ma̱ra̱ ma makai ni, ɗa baci i panai n danai ɗa̱, unai ni, ka̱ta̱ yu una yi, i pana wovon ba. Mpa ɗa vuza na n danai ɗa̱ i yaꞋan. Tsurukpai ka̱ta̱ i gbama asuvu.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="2SA 13:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="2SA 13:29" />Ɗa agbashi a Abusalom a unai Amuno uteku tsu na Abusalom u danai le a yaꞋan. Ɗa olobo o mogono a na a buwai ra̱ka̱ a̱ ɗa̱nga̱i, a kumbai mkparagi n le a sumai.<verse eid="2SA 13:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="2SA 13:30" />Ele a uye o kubono, ɗa kadanshi ka yawai u Dawuda a danai ni, &lt;&lt;Abusalom wu una ta̱ olobo o mogono ra̱ka̱, babu vuza na u buwai n wuma.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="2SA 13:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="2SA 13:31" />Ɗa mogono Dawuda u ɗa̱ngai u karai motogu ma̱ ni ɗa u vaki a iɗika adama a una̱mgbuka̱tsuma̱. Ɗa kpamu agbashi a̱ ni a na i kashani n a̱yi ra̱ka̱ vu le feu a karai ntogu n le.<verse eid="2SA 13:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="2SA 13:32" />Ama ɗa Jonadabu maku ma Shimeya, toku vu Dawuda, u danai, &lt;&lt;Vuzagbayin, ka̱ta̱ vu sheshe a una ta̱ olobo a̱ nu ra̱ka̱ ba, Amuno ɗa koci a unai. Abusalom va u foɓuso ta̱ ka nampa ka, ali a kanna ka na Amuno u yaꞋin tsugbani n taku vu ni Tamaru. <verse eid="2SA 13:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="2SA 13:33" />Vuzagbayin mogono ka̱ta̱ vu dana a una ta̱ olobo a̱ nu ra̱ka̱ ba, Amuno ɗa koci u kuwa̱i.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="2SA 13:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="2SA 13:34" />Ɗa Abusalom u sumai.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2SA 13:34">Ɗa vuza kindi u ɗa̱ngushi a̱shi a̱ ni ɗa we enei uma n a̱bunda̱i a̱ kuta̱wa̱ n uɓon u ɗakai u kusan. <verse eid="2SA 13:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="2SA 13:35" />Ɗa Jonadabu u danai mogono, &lt;&lt;La̱na̱, olobo a̱ nu a ɗa lo o kubono uteku tsu na n danai nu&gt;&gt; <verse eid="2SA 13:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="2SA 13:36" />A̱yi o kukotso kuyaꞋan kadanshi, ɗa olobo o mogono a yawai, ɗa a̱ ka̱na̱i ma̱shi. Ɗa Dawuda koɓolo n agbashi a̱ ni ra̱ka̱ a̱ shika̱i ka̱u. <verse eid="2SA 13:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="2SA 13:37" />Ɗa Abusalom u sumai a kubana u Talamayi maku ma Amihudu, mogono ma Geshuru. Ɗa Dawuda u na̱mgba̱i ka̱tsuma kanna n kayin adama a ukpa̱ u maku ma̱ ni Amunon. <verse eid="2SA 13:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="2SA 13:38" />Ana Abusalom u sumai a kubana a Geshuru, u yongoi ɗe ali a̱ya̱ a tatsu. <verse eid="2SA 13:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="2SA 13:39" />Ana mogono Dawuda ma cinukpai n ukpa̱ u maku ma̱ ni Amuno, ɗa u ka̱na̱i ma̱za̱nga̱ ma na we ene Abusalom.<verse eid="2SA 13:39" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2SA 13" />
  <chapter number="14" style="c" sid="2SA 14" />
  <para style="s1">Abusalom u bonoi a Urushelima</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2SA 14:1" />Jowabu vuza na e ci ɗeke a̱na̱ku a̱ ni Zeruya u yevei an ka̱ɗu ko mogono Dawuda ko bonoi u Abusalom. <verse eid="2SA 14:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2SA 14:2" />Ɗa Jowabu u suki a ɗikaka yi vuka vu ugboji ɗe a̱ likuci i Tekowa. Ana u yawai ɗa Jowabu u danai vuka va. &lt;&lt;YaꞋan adanshi vi ta̱ a̱ una̱mgbuka̱tsuma̱, vu uka akashi a kpalu, ka̱ta̱ kpamu vu sukuya̱ maniꞋin ba. YaꞋan adanshi vi geshe ta̱ ɗe a una̱mgbuka̱tsuma̱ tsu vuza na vuza u kuwa̱i ni. <verse eid="2SA 14:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2SA 14:3" />Ka̱ta̱ vu bana a̱ ubuta̱ u mogono vu yaꞋan kadanshi tsu nampa.&gt;&gt; Ɗa Jowabu u danai vuka va ili i na wa kudana mogono ma.<verse eid="2SA 14:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="2SA 14:4" />Ana vuka va aza a Tekowa u yawai a̱ ubuta̱ u mogono, ɗa u vaki ma̱kpa̱ɓa̱ a iɗika ɗa u danai, &lt;&lt;Wuma u nu u geshe mogono, ɓa̱nka̱ mu!&gt;&gt; <verse eid="2SA 14:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2SA 14:5" />Ɗa mogono me ecei ni u danai, &lt;&lt;Yiɗa̱i mɓa̱la̱ n nu?&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2SA 14:5">Ɗa wu ushuki, &lt;&lt;Mpa kagapa kaꞋa, vali vu va̱ vu kuwa̱ ta̱. <verse eid="2SA 14:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2SA 14:6" />Mpa kagbashi ka̱ nu mi ta̱ m muku mo olobo n re, ɗa a yaꞋin vishili ɗe a kashina, babu vuza lo vu na we pece le. Ɗa vuza te wu unai vuza ni. <verse eid="2SA 14:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2SA 14:7" />Gogo na nahannai, aza a̱ va̱ a̱ ta̱wa̱ ta̱ adama a na n neke le vuza na wu unai vuza ni va, adama a na una yi feu a̱ una̱ vuza ni na wu unai, ama a yaꞋan baci nannai mi ta̱ a ku namba maku ma na ma ku lyaꞋa ili yi uka̱ni i vali vu va̱. Maku ma̱ va̱ ma ɗaɗa mu koci ili i na mi a kinda, una yi baci i ta̱ a̱ ku ka̱sukpa̱ mu babu ili. Ka̱ta̱ kpamu kula ku vali vu va̱ ku puwa̱nka̱ aduniyan a nampa.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="2SA 14:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2SA 14:8" />Ɗa Mogono ma danai vuka va, &lt;&lt;Bono a kpaꞋa kunu, mi ta̱ e kuneke kadanshi adama ukuna u nu wa.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="2SA 14:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2SA 14:9" />Ɗa vuka vuza vu Tekowa va u doku u danai, &lt;&lt;Vuzagbayin vu va̱ mogono, yaꞋan unushi u nampa wu okpo a kaci ka̱ va̱ koɓolo m kpaꞋa ke esheku a̱ va̱. YaꞋan mogono n kakuba ko tsugono tsu nu tsu okpo babu unushi.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="2SA 14:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2SA 14:10" />Ɗa mogono ma danai ni, &lt;&lt;Vuza yoku u keɓece wu baci ukuna, ka̱ta̱ vu tuka̱i na a̱ va̱, wi o kudoku koꞋuso wu ba.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="2SA 14:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2SA 14:11" />Ɗa u danai, &lt;&lt;YaꞋan mogono ma kucina n Vuzavaguɗu Ka̱shile ka̱ nu, ka̱ta̱ vu ka̱sukpa̱ aza a na a kuciga kutsupa kutan a yaꞋan munuka ba adama a na una maku ma̱ va̱ ba.&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2SA 14:11">Ɗa mogono ma danai vuka va, &lt;&lt;N kucuna ta̱ n Vuzavaguɗu vu wuma n danai ko ka̱nji ka̱ ni ke te ki o kutoɗo ka̱ yikpa̱ a iɗika ba.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="2SA 14:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="2SA 14:12" />Ɗa vuka va vu doku vu danai, &lt;&lt;Mi ta̱ ufolu u nu vuzagbayin, yaꞋan n doku n dansa koyoku ke nu.&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2SA 14:12">Ɗa mogono ma̱ ushuki ma danai, &lt;&lt;Dansa.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="2SA 14:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="2SA 14:13" />Ɗa vuka va vu danai, &lt;&lt;Yiɗa̱i i zuwai ɗa vu yaꞋankai uma a̱ Ka̱shile kusheshe ku gbani-gbani tsu nampa? Adama a kadanshi ka na ka̱ uta̱i una̱ u nu mogono, vu kiɗaka ta̱ ka̱ci ka̱ nu afada a na vu kpa̱ɗa̱i kuka̱sukpa̱ maku ma̱ nu ma na o lokoi mo bono a kpaꞋa. <verse eid="2SA 14:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2SA 14:14" />Mayun ɗa ra̱ka̱ vu tsu tsu kuwa̱. Adama a na ci ta̱ uteku tsu mini ma na a̱ va̱ma̱i a iɗika, ma na babu vuza na wa kufuɗa kupura̱ maꞋa. Ama Ka̱shile ka tsu ɗika wuma u vuza nannai bini ba. Adama a nannai u tsu la̱nsa̱ ta̱ uye u na aza a na a sumai o bono. <verse eid="2SA 14:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2SA 14:15" />Wuma u nu u geshe mogono, gogo na n ta̱wa̱ ta̱ kudana wu ka nampa, adama a na uma a zuwa mu ta̱ m panai wovon. Ɗa mpa kagbashi ka̱ nu n sheshei n danai, &lt;Mi ta̱ a kuyaꞋan kadanshi m mogono, yoku ba wi ta̱ a kuyaꞋan ili i na kagbashi ka̱ nu ko folonoi. <verse eid="2SA 14:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2SA 14:16" />U gaꞋan ba mogono mi ta̱ a̱ kushuku ku isa kagbashi ka̱ ni a ekiye a vuza a na wi a kuciga ku una tsu mpa n maku ma̱ va̱, ka̱ta̱ feu e pece tsu n ili yi uka̱ni i na Ka̱shile ke nekei tsu.&gt; <verse eid="2SA 14:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2SA 14:17" />Vuzagbayin, n sheshe ta̱ n danai, &lt;Kadanshi ko mogono ma̱ va̱ ki ta̱ zuwa ka̱ɗu ka̱ va̱ ka̱ da̱sa̱ngu, adama a na wi ta̱ tsu kalingata ka̱ Ka̱shile, u tsu pece ta̱ kasingai n kagbanigbani.&gt; YaꞋan Vuzavaguɗu Ka̱shile ka̱ nu ko yongo n avu.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="2SA 14:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="2SA 14:18" />Ɗa mogono ma danai vuka va,&lt;&lt;Ka̱ta̱ vu sokongu mu ko i te a̱ ka̱tsuma̱ ki ili i na mi a ku ece wu ba.&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2SA 14:18">Ɗa vuka va vu danai, &lt;&lt;Vuzagbayin mogono yaꞋan keci ku nu.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="2SA 14:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="2SA 14:19" />Ɗa mogono me ecei ni, &lt;&lt;Jowabu wi ta̱ punu n kukiye a̱ ka̱tsuma̱ ka kadanshi ka nampa ko?&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2SA 14:19">Ɗa vuka vu ushuki, &lt;&lt;Wuma u nu u geshe, vuzagbayin va̱ mogono, babu vuza na wa kukpatala u gula̱ ko u singai a̱ ka̱tsuma̱ ke keci kana vu yaꞋin. Kagbashi ka̱ nu Jowabu ɗa u danai mu n yaꞋan ka wu keci ka ra̱ka̱, a̱yi ɗa kpamu vuza na u danai mu ili i na ma kudansa. <verse eid="2SA 14:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="2SA 14:20" />Kagbashi ka̱ nu Jowabu va u yaꞋan ta̱ nannai, adama a na u sabaꞋa ukuna u na wi an nwalu gogo na. Vuzagbayin vu va̱ wi ta̱ n kuyeve tsa alingata a̱ Ka̱shile, u yeve ta̱ i na yi punu a iɗika ya.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="2SA 14:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="2SA 14:21" />Ɗa mogono ma danai Jowabu, &lt;&lt;U gaꞋan ta̱ mi ta̱ a kuyaꞋan i ɗa. Bana vu bono n kolobo ka Abusalom.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="2SA 14:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="2SA 14:22" />Ɗa Jowabu u kuɗa̱ngi u lyaꞋakai ni kayala, ɗa u zuwakai mogono una̱singai. Jowabu u danai, &lt;&lt;Anana n ciya̱ ta̱ mapasa ma singai wa̱ nu, vuzagbayin vu va̱ mogono, adama a na vu ushuku ta̱ n ufolu u va̱.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="2SA 14:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="2SA 14:23" />Ɗa Jowabu u banai a̱ likuci i Geshuru u bonoi n Abusalom a Urushelima. <verse eid="2SA 14:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="2SA 14:24" />Ɗa mogono ma danai, &lt;&lt;Danai ni u wala o kubono a kpaꞋa ku ni, ka̱ta̱ u ta̱wa̱ wa̱ va̱ ba.&gt;&gt; Ɗa Abusalom u da̱sa̱ngi kpaꞋa ku ni, u bana a̱ ubuta̱ u mogono ba.<verse eid="2SA 14:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="2SA 14:25" />A̱ ka̱tsuma̱ ka aza a Isaraila ra̱ka̱ babu vuza na i a kucikpa tsuloboi tsu Abusalom. Ili i na i ɗikai a kaci ali a kubana e ene a̱ ni wi n uꞋiwin u Ka̱shile ba. <verse eid="2SA 14:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="2SA 14:26" />A̱ ka̱ya̱ dem u tsu puna ta̱ ka̱nji ka̱ ni adama a na ka ci yaꞋan yi ta̱ a̱miki. U puna baci ka̱ta̱ u gisanku kaꞋa, a̱miki a̱ ka̱nji ka a ci yawa ta̱ kilo vu re.<verse eid="2SA 14:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="2SA 14:27" />A matsaka ta̱ Abusalom muku mo olobo n tatsu n mekere me te, kula kuni ku ɗa Tamaru. Mekere ma tana mi ta̱ n tsuloboi.<verse eid="2SA 14:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="2SA 14:28" />Abusalom u da̱sa̱ngi a Urushelima a̱ya̱ e re tana we ne o mogono ba. <verse eid="2SA 14:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="2SA 14:29" />Ɗa Abusalom u suki e ɗekusheke yi Jowabu adama a na u suku yi u mogono, ama ɗa Jowabu u iwain kubana. Ɗa u doki u suki ire, ama ɗa u iwain kubana. <verse eid="2SA 14:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="2SA 14:30" />Ɗa u danai agbashi a̱ ni, &lt;&lt;Banai, a kashina ka Jowabu ka na ki ɗevu n ka̱ va̱, ka na ki m bali. I songu kaꞋa.&gt;&gt; Ɗa agbashi a Abusalom a banai o songi kaꞋa.<verse eid="2SA 14:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="2SA 14:31" />Ɗa Jowabu u banai a kpaꞋa ku Abusalom we ecei ni, &lt;&lt;Yiɗa̱i i zuwai ɗa vu suki agbashi a̱ nu a bana o songi kashina ka̱ va̱?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="2SA 14:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="2SA 14:32" />Ɗa Abusalom wu ushuki u danai ni, &lt;&lt;Vu iwan ta̱ kuta̱wa̱ a makyan ma na n ɗekushi nu. Mi ishi n ciga kusuku vu bana vu eceke mu mogono ili i na i zuwai ɗa u danai mu n ka̱sukpa̱ Geshuru m bono. Mpa n laꞋa ta̱ n kuciga n da̱sa̱ngu ɗe. Gogo na n ciga ta̱ tsu gasa a̱shi m mogono, n yaꞋanka yi baci unushi, yaꞋan wu una mu.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="2SA 14:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="2SA 14:33" />Ɗa Jowabu u banai u danai mogono ili i na Abusalom u danai, ɗa mogono ma̱ u suki e ɗekushe Abusalom ɗa u banai. Ana u yawai ɗa u vaki a iɗika u lyaꞋi kayala e kelime ko mogono. Ɗa mogono mo oɓongi Abusalom va.<verse eid="2SA 14:33" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2SA 14" />
  <chapter number="15" style="c" sid="2SA 15" />
  <para style="s1">Abusalom u yaꞋankai Dawuda ugbamiwasuvu.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2SA 15:1" />Ana ka nanlo ka lazai, ɗa Abusalom u ciya̱ka̱i ka̱ci ka̱ ni keke vo odoku, koɓolo n odoku, n uma amangerenkupa aza a na a kuwala kelime ka̱ ni. <verse eid="2SA 15:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2SA 15:2" />Abusalom u tsu ɗa̱nga̱ ta̱ n kpasani u shamgba ɗevu uye u na u banai a utsutsu u likuci. Ɗa baci vuza u ta̱wa̱i n kakuna u mogono adama afada, Abusalom u tsu ɗeke yi ta̱ we ece yi, &lt;&lt;Avu a̱ likuci i ne i ɗai vu uta̱i?&gt;&gt; Ɗa baci vuma va wu ushuki u danai, &lt;&lt;Vuzagbayin mu uta̱ ta̱ a̱ likuci i te a̱ ka̱tsuma̱ ka kumaci ka aza a Isaraila.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="2SA 15:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2SA 15:3" />Abusalom wi ta̱ a ku dana yi, &lt;&lt;La̱na̱, kadanshi ka̱ nu ki ta̱ n ugaꞋin n kamayun, ama mogono mi n vuza na wa ku panaka wu ba.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="2SA 15:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2SA 15:4" />Abusalom u tsu dana ta̱ kpamu, &lt;&lt;Ishi baci a dana mpa ɗa kayaꞋinkafada ka iɗika ka, mi ta̱ a kuyaꞋanka vuma dem vu na u ta̱wa̱i wa̱ va̱ n kadanshi, afada a mayun.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="2SA 15:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2SA 15:5" />Ɗa baci vuza yoku u ta̱wa̱i ɗevu n Abusalom ɗa u kuɗa̱ngi kukya̱sa̱ yi, u tsu ka̱na̱i ta̱ kukiye ka̱ta̱ u ɗa̱ngusa̱i wo oɓongu yi. <verse eid="2SA 15:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2SA 15:6" />Ɗa Abusalom u ka̱na̱i kuyaꞋanka aza a Isaraila nannai aza a na a banai u Dawuda adama a na u yaꞋanka le afada, ta u ka̱na̱i ku sabaꞋa a̱ɗu aza a Isaraila nannai.<verse eid="2SA 15:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="2SA 15:7" />Ana a̱ya̱ a̱ na̱shi a lazai, ɗa Abusalom u danai Mogono, &lt;&lt;Mi ta̱ ufolu u nu ka̱sukpa̱ mu m bana a Heburon adama a na n shatangu akucina a na n yaꞋin n Vuzavaguɗu. <verse eid="2SA 15:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2SA 15:8" />Adama a na kagbashi ka̱ nu ka yaꞋan ta̱ akucina a makyan ma na wi a Geshuru vu Siriya, u danai, &lt;Ɗa baci Vuzavaguɗu u bonokoi mu a Urushelima kpamu, mi ta̱ a̱ kuga̱nda̱ka̱ yi ɗe a Heburon.&gt; &gt;&gt;<verse eid="2SA 15:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="2SA 15:9" />Ɗa mogono ma danai ni, &lt;&lt;Wala m ma̱ta̱na̱.&gt;&gt; Ɗa u lazai a kubana a Heburon.<verse eid="2SA 15:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="2SA 15:10" />Ama Abusalom va u suku ta̱ ɗe aza a usuki n akaka usokongi a ubuta̱ u kumaci ka aza a Isaraila ra̱ka̱, u danai, &lt;&lt;Ɗa baci i panai ciliki tsu kavana, ka̱ta̱ i sala, &lt;Abusalom ɗa mogono wi ta̱ ɗe a Heburon.&gt; &gt;&gt; <verse eid="2SA 15:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2SA 15:11" />Ana Abusalom wu uta̱i a Urushelima a kubana a Heburon, uma a amangatawenre (200) a ɗa o tono ni. U banuki le o soki ni usokongi ta na e yeve kusheshe ku ni ba. <verse eid="2SA 15:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2SA 15:12" />A makyan ma na Abusalom wi a kuyaꞋan kuneꞋen kalyuka ka, ɗa kpamu u suki e ɗekusheke yi Ahitofelu vuza vu Gilo, vuza vo odoki vu mogono Dawuda. Ka̱bunda̱i ka uma ka na ka gbaɓai kaci n Abusalom aza a na i ufoɓushi adama a na a yaꞋan vishili n Dawuda a yimkpai n ka̱bunda̱i.<verse eid="2SA 15:12" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Dawuda u sumai a Urushelima</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="2SA 15:13" />Ɗa vuza vu usuki u ta̱wa̱i u dana yi Dawuda, &lt;&lt;A̱ɗu a uma a Isaraila ra̱ka̱ o bono ta̱ u Abusalom.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="2SA 15:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="2SA 15:14" />Ɗa Dawuda u danai agbashi a̱ ni a na i koɓolon n a̱yi ra̱ka̱ a Urushelima, &lt;&lt;Ɗa̱nga̱i, Tsu sumai, nannai ɗa baci ba Abusalom wi ta̱ a ku una tsu ra̱ka̱. Tsu sumai gogo na, ka̱ta̱ Abusalom u cina tsu ali wu una tsu koɓolo n uma a̱ likuci n kotokobi ba.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="2SA 15:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="2SA 15:15" />Ɗa agbashi o mogono a ushuki ni, &lt;&lt;Wuma u nu u geshe, ili i na baci mogono me enei i gaꞋan ta̱, ci ta̱ a kuyaꞋan.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="2SA 15:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="2SA 15:16" />Ɗa Mogono ma̱ uta̱i n aza a kpaꞋa a̱ ni koɓolo n agbashi a̱ ni. Ɗa mogono ma̱ ka̱sukpa̱i a̱ma̱ci kupa a gbani a̱ ni adama a na a̱ la̱na̱ ka̱ yi kpaꞋa. <verse eid="2SA 15:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2SA 15:17" />Ana mogono koɓolo uma a̱ ni ra̱ka̱ a̱ uta̱i adama a na a laza a̱ ka̱sukpa̱ likuci ya, ɗa a shamgbai a kpaꞋa ku ukocishi. <verse eid="2SA 15:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2SA 15:18" />Ɗa uma a̱ ni ra̱ka̱ a lazai kelime ka̱ ni, a̱ ka̱tsuma̱ ka uma a nanlo osoji aza a na a tsu inda mogono i ta̱ punu, koɓolo n osoji ali amangatawa̱nta̱li (600) aza a o tonoi ni a Gatu. Ra̱ka̱ vu le a lazai e kelime ko Mogono. <verse eid="2SA 15:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="2SA 15:19" />Ɗa mogono ma danai Itayi vuma vu Gatu, &lt;&lt;Yiɗa̱i i zuwai ɗa avu feu vi na o kutono tsu? Kpatala vu bono vu shamgba n Mogono ma savu Abusalom. Avu komoci kaꞋa, vuza na o lokoi a iɗika i nu. <verse eid="2SA 15:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="2SA 15:20" />Na̱yin na ɗa vu ta̱wa̱i. Niniɗai n kuzuwa wu vu gita̱ ka̱ ka̱ra̱sa̱ n a̱tsu anana, mpa n yeve biꞋi ubuta̱ u na maku bana ba? Kpatala, avu n uma a̱ nu ra̱ka̱. YaꞋan Vuzavaguɗu u yaꞋanka wu kasingai ka̱ ni, ka̱ta̱ kpamu u yotsongu ucigi u gbayin u ni.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="2SA 15:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="2SA 15:21" />Ama ɗa Itayi wu ushuki Mogono ma, &lt;&lt;N kucuna ta̱ n Vuzavaguɗu vu na wi n wuma, n wuma u mogono, ubuta̱ u na baci ɗe ɗem i banai, ko tsu kuwa̱ ko tana tsu yaꞋan wuma, mpa kagbashi ka̱ nu mi ta̱ o kutono wu.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="2SA 15:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="2SA 15:22" />Ɗa Dawuda u danai Itayi, &lt;&lt;Wala kelime.&gt;&gt; Ɗa Itayi vuza vu Gatu u walai kelime n uma a̱ ni koɓolo n muku n kenkeꞋen n na mi koɓolo n a̱yi.<verse eid="2SA 15:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="2SA 15:23" />Ɗa uma a na i punu a iɗika ya ra̱ka̱ a̱ ka̱na̱i ma̱shi n kacaꞋa a makyan ma na Dawuda n uma a̱ ni i a nwalu a kulaza ku ka̱sukpa̱ likuci ya. Ɗa Mogono koɓolo n uma a̱ ni a pasai kuyene ku Kidiron, ɗa ra̱ka̱ vu le a lazai a kuꞋuwa a kakamba ka na ki n vuza ba.<verse eid="2SA 15:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="2SA 15:24" />Zadoku ganu wi ta̱ lo, kpamu aza e Levi a na i koɓolo n a̱yi i ta̱ ucaniki n akpati vu uzuwakpani vu Ka̱shile va. Ɗa a zuwai akpati vu uzuwakpani va a iɗika ɗevu n Abiyata ganu, ali uma a o kotsoi ku uta̱ punu a̱ likuci ya.<verse eid="2SA 15:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="2SA 15:25" />Ɗa Mogono ma danai Zadoku, &lt;&lt;Ɗika akpati vu uzuwakpani vu bonuko punu asuvu a̱ likuci ya. N ciya̱ baci mapasa ma singai u Vuzavaguɗu wi ta̱ o kubonoko mu ka̱ta̱ n doku me ene akpati vu uzuwakpani va, ali n ida̱sa̱mkpa̱tsu i ni. <verse eid="2SA 15:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="2SA 15:26" />Ama u dana baci, &lt;M pana uyoꞋo u nu ba,&gt; ka̱ta̱ u yaꞋanka mu ili i na i gaꞋin ni.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="2SA 15:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="2SA 15:27" />Ɗa Mogono ma lyaꞋi kelime n kadanshi n Zadoku ganu, u danai, &lt;&lt;Avu va keniki kaꞋa ba? Kpatala vu bono a̱ likuci ya m ma̱ta̱na̱, n maku ma̱ nu Ahimazu n Janata maku ma Abiyata. <verse eid="2SA 15:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="2SA 15:28" />La̱na̱, mi ta̱ a kushamgba na a kapasa ka Urudu ka na ka tonoi a kubana e meremune sapu makyan ma na i ta̱wa̱i i yaꞋankai mu kadanshi.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="2SA 15:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="2SA 15:29" />Ɗa Zadoku koɓolo n Abiyata o bonokoi akpati vu uzuwakpani vu Ka̱shile va a Urushelima, ɗa feu a̱ da̱sa̱ngi ɗe.<verse eid="2SA 15:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="2SA 15:30" />Ɗa Dawuda u kumbai nsasan mu nɗanga n Zaitu a̱ ma̱shi. Ɗa u ka̱na̱i nwalu babu ataka, ɗa kpamu u palai kaci ka̱ ni adama u una̱mgbuka̱tsuma̱. Ɗa uma a na i o kutono yi feu a palai aci ele a̱ ka̱na̱i ma̱shi. <verse eid="2SA 15:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="2SA 15:31" />Ɗa a danai Dawuda, &lt;&lt;Ahitofelu wi ta̱ feu a̱ ka̱tsuma̱ ka aza a na o foɓusoi kuyaꞋanka Abusalom ugbamiwasuvu.&gt;&gt; Ɗa Dawuda u vasai, &lt;&lt;Mi ta̱ ufolu u nu Vuzavaguɗu, bonuko kadanshi ka Ahitofelu ukuna u gbani.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="2SA 15:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="2SA 15:32" />Ana Dawuda u yawai gaɗi vu kusan a ubuta̱ u na uma a tsu cikpa Ka̱shile, ɗa Hushayi vuza vu aza a Ariki u gasai n a̱yi. Ɗa Hushayi u karasai ntogu n ni ɗa u kiyangi e kiye a̱ ni gaɗi kaci adama una̱mgbi u ka̱tsuma̱. <verse eid="2SA 15:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="2SA 15:33" />Ɗa Dawuda u danai ni, &lt;&lt;Vu tono mu baci, vi ta̱ o kudoku mu atakaci. <verse eid="2SA 15:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="2SA 15:34" />Ama ɗa baci vu bonoi a̱ likuci ɗa vu danai Abusalom, &lt;Mi ta̱ o kokpo kagbashi ka̱ nu mogono. N tsu cau n yaꞋanka ta̱ eshevu tsugbashi, ama gogo na mi ta̱ o kokpo kagbashi ka̱ nu.&gt; Vu yaꞋan baci nannai, vi ta̱ a̱ kuɓa̱nka̱ mu n ciya̱ n bonoko kadanshi ka Ahitofelu ukuna u gbani. <verse eid="2SA 15:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="2SA 15:35" />Anan ganu Zadoku n Abiyata i ɗe ba? Vu dana le i na vu panai a kpaꞋa ku mogono ma savu. <verse eid="2SA 15:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="2SA 15:36" />Muku n re n le, Ahimazu maku ma Zadoku, n Janata maku ma Abiyata, i ta̱ ɗe koɓolo n ele suku le a̱ ta̱wa̱ a dana mu ili dem i na vu panai.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="2SA 15:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="2SA 15:37" />Ɗa Hushayi ka̱ja̱Ꞌa̱ ka Dawuda u bonoi a Urushelima a makyan ma na Abusalom wi a kuꞋuwa a̱ likuci ya.<verse eid="2SA 15:37" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2SA 15" />
  <chapter number="16" style="c" sid="2SA 16" />
  <para style="s1">Dawuda n Ziba</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2SA 16:1" />Ana Dawuda u wu urangi gaɗi kusan va kenu, ɗa Ziba kagbashi ka Mefiboshetu ka gasai n a̱yi. Wi ta̱ nu Njaki n re ucaniki n boroji ali amangatawenre (200), koɓolon n akala e ɗekpu kpamu amangatawun (100), n a̱kutsu a umaci u mambulu n kedele ka ma̱kya̱n. <verse eid="2SA 16:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2SA 16:2" />Ɗa mogono me ecei Ziba, yiɗa̱i i zuwai ɗa vu tukai n ili nampa?</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2SA 16:2">&lt;&lt;Ɗa Ziba wu ushuki, n tuka̱ ta̱ n njaki ma adama a kpaꞋa ku mogono a̱ ciya̱ a kumba. Boroji n umaci wu nɗanga tamkpamu adama a na uma a̱ ciya̱ a lyaꞋa. Ma̱kya̱n tamkpamu adama a aza a na oꞋoi a kakamba a̱ ciya̱ o soꞋo.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="2SA 16:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="2SA 16:3" />Ɗa Mogono me ecei, &lt;&lt;Teɗai Mefiboshetu matsukaya ma vuzagbayin vu nu Shawulu wi?&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2SA 16:3">Ɗa Ziba wu ushuki mogono u danai, &lt;&lt;Wi ta̱ ɗe a Urushelima, adama a na wi ta̱ a̱ kusheshe kpaꞋa ki Isaraila i ta̱ o kubonoko yi n tsugono tsa akaya a̱ ni Shawulu.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="2SA 16:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="2SA 16:4" />Ɗa Mogono ma danai Ziba, &lt;&lt;Ili ra̱ka̱ i na yi i Mefiboshetu anana yo okpo ta̱ i nu.&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2SA 16:4">Ɗa Ziba u danai, &lt;&lt;Wuma u nu u geshe mogono, n kuɗa̱nku ta̱, yaꞋan ka̱na̱ kuciya̱ mapasa ma singai wa̱ nu nannai, vuzagbayin mogono.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="2SA 16:4" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Dawuda n Shimeyi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="2SA 16:5" />Ana mogono Dawuda u yawai ɗevu n likuci i Bahurim, ɗa vuma vu yoku wu uta̱i u ka̱na̱i kushika yi. Vuma va kula kuni ku ɗa Shimeyi, maku ma Gera, a kumaci ku Shawulu. <verse eid="2SA 16:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2SA 16:6" />Ɗa Shimeya va u ka̱na̱i ku vara Dawuda n agbashi a̱ ni n atali, ko ana wo okpoi uma a̱ ni n osoji ra̱ka̱ a kanza ta̱ mogono Dawuda. <verse eid="2SA 16:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2SA 16:7" />Shimeya u ka̱na̱i ku shikusa Dawuda n u danai, &lt;&lt;Wala, wala, vuza munuka, vuma vu gbani-gbani. <verse eid="2SA 16:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2SA 16:8" />Vuzavaguɗu u tsupaka ta̱ Shawulu mpasa n uma a na vu unai a kpaꞋa ku ni, vuza na vu isai tsugono ci ni. Gogo na Vuzavaguɗu u neke ta̱ tsugono tsa u Abusalom, maku ma̱ nu. La̱na̱, kagbanigbani ka cina wu ta̱, adama a na avu vuza vu munuka ɗa.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="2SA 16:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="2SA 16:9" />Ɗa Abishayi vuza na e ci ɗeke a̱na̱ku a̱ ni Zeruya u danai mogono, &lt;&lt;Wuma unu u geshe, Yiɗa̱i i zuwai ɗa vu ka̱sukpa̱i ka̱kuwishi ke mesheꞋe ka nampa ki a ku shikusa Vuzagbayin mogono ma̱ va̱? YaꞋan n bana n gbatya kaci ka̱ ni.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="2SA 16:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="2SA 16:10" />Ama ɗa mogono ma danai, &lt;&lt;Yiɗa̱i i gasai mpa a̱ɗa̱, a̱ ɗa̱ muku n Zeruya? Wi baci a kuyaꞋan ishikushi ya adama a na Vuzavaguɗu ɗa u danai ni, &lt;Shika Dawuda,&gt; Yayi u ku ece yi, &lt;Yiɗa̱i i zuwai ɗa vu yaꞋin nannai?&gt; &gt;&gt; <verse eid="2SA 16:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2SA 16:11" />Ɗa Dawuda u danai Abishayi n aza ulinga a̱ ni ra̱ka̱, &lt;&lt;Maku ma na mpa n matsai, mi baci a kula̱nsa̱ wuma u va̱ kuna, teɗai tamkpamu vuza vu Bayami vu nampa. Ka̱sukpa̱i ni u lyaꞋa kelime n kushika mu, adama a na Vuzavaguɗu ɗa u danai ni u shika mu. <verse eid="2SA 16:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2SA 16:12" />U gaꞋan ba Vuzavaguɗu wi ta̱ a kupana asuvayali a̱ va̱, ka̱ta̱ u kucikpa u yaꞋan ka mu kasingai adama ishikushi i na mi a kupana anana.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="2SA 16:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="2SA 16:13" />Ɗa Dawuda koɓolo n uma a̱ ni a lyaꞋi kelime nu nwalu uye, Shimeya tamkpamu o kutono le n kakambu ka kusan a kushika le n u varai le n atali n u tsunki le kayala. <verse eid="2SA 16:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2SA 16:14" />Ɗa mogono n uma a na i koɓolo n a̱yi a yawai a̱ ubuta̱ u na a kubana n woꞋwi ka̱u. Ɗa uvukai lo.<verse eid="2SA 16:14" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Hushayi u gasai n Abusalom</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="2SA 16:15" />Ɗa makyan kenu, Abusalom koɓolo n aza a Isaraila a na i koɓolo n a̱yi a yawai a Urushelima, Ahitofelu feu wi ta̱ koɓolo n a̱yi. <verse eid="2SA 16:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2SA 16:16" />Ana Hushayi vuza vu Ariki ka̱ja̱Ꞌa̱ ka Dawuda u yawai ubuta̱ u Abusalom ɗa u danai, &lt;&lt;Wuma u nu u geshe mogono! Wuma u nu u geshe mogono!&gt;&gt;<verse eid="2SA 16:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="2SA 16:17" />Ɗa Abusalom we ecei Hushayi, &lt;&lt;Ucigi u na vi a kuyaꞋanka ka̱ja̱Ꞌa̱ ka̱ nu u ɗan na? Yiɗa̱i i zuwai ɗa vu kpa̱ɗa̱i kutono ka̱ja̱Ꞌa̱ ka̱ nu.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="2SA 16:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="2SA 16:18" />Ɗa Hushayi u danai Abusalom, &lt;&lt;A̱Ꞌa̱, mpa mi ta̱ a̱ kucina̱ ku vuza na Vuzavaguɗu koɓolo uma aza a Isaraila a zagbai. N a̱yi ɗa mpa mi o kuyongo. <verse eid="2SA 16:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="2SA 16:19" />N nannai dem, yayi n kuyaꞋanka tsugbashi maku ma Dawuda ma a ba? Uteku tsu na n yaꞋankai eshevu, ta feu maku yaꞋan ka wu nannai.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="2SA 16:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="2SA 16:20" />Ɗa Abusalom u danai Ahitofelu, &lt;&lt;Ta baci nannai, neke tsu odoki a̱ nu. Yiɗa̱i tsa kuyaꞋan?&gt;&gt; <verse eid="2SA 16:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="2SA 16:21" />Ɗa Ahitofelu u danai Abusalom, &lt;&lt;Bana vu vaku n a̱ma̱ci a gbani e esheku a̱ nu aza a na u ka̱sukpa̱i inda kpaꞋa ku ni. Vu yaꞋan baci nannai aza a Isaraila i ta̱ e kuyeve ana vu goyoi eshevu, tsu nanlo tsu ɗa u kuzuwa aza a na i o kutono wu a lasuka kuciga wu.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="2SA 16:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="2SA 16:22" />Ɗa a yaꞋan kai Abusalom ma̱va̱li a kpaꞋa ku mogono. Ɗa Abusalom u uwai, ɗa u vaki n a̱ma̱ci a gbani esheku a̱ ni aza a Isaraila e kene. <verse eid="2SA 16:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="2SA 16:23" />A makyan ma nanlo uma ra̱ka̱ a tsu pana ta̱ odoki a Ahitofelu adanshi kadanshi ka̱ Ka̱shile kaꞋa. Ta odoki a Ahitofelu i n utsura u Dawuda n Abusalom nannai.<verse eid="2SA 16:23" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2SA 16" />
  <chapter number="17" style="c" sid="2SA 17" />
  <para style="s1">Hushayi u nekei Dawuda odoki</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2SA 17:1" />Ɗa Ahitofelu u danai Abusalom, &lt;&lt;YaꞋan n zagba uma a̱ kpa̱n kupa n e re (12,000) tsu bana tsu tono Dawuda n kayin ka nampa. <verse eid="2SA 17:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2SA 17:2" />Mi ta̱ kubanka yi n kuvon a makyan ma na wu oꞋoi ɗa wi ɗevu n kutakpa ka̱ɗu. Mi ta̱ a ku neke yi wovon ka̱u ali uma a̱ ni ra̱ka̱ a suma a̱ ka̱sukpa̱ yi. Ama mogono Dawuda ɗa endeꞋin ɗa mi a ku una, <verse eid="2SA 17:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2SA 17:3" />ka̱ta̱ m bonoko wu n uma a na buwai ra̱ka̱. Tsu na a̱ tsu tuka̱ n vuka vu savu kpaꞋa ku vali vi ni, vuma vu te ɗa koci vi a̱ kula̱nsa̱, uma a na a buwai ra̱ka̱ o yongo n ma̱ta̱na̱.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="2SA 17:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2SA 17:4" />Odoki nanlo a yaꞋan ta̱ Abusalom koɓolo n nkoshi m gba̱ra̱-gba̱ra̱ ma aza a Isaraila ra̱ka̱.<verse eid="2SA 17:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="2SA 17:5" />Ama ɗa Abusalom u danai, &lt;&lt;Ɗeke Hushayi vuza vu Ariki, adama a na tsu pana ili i na wa kudansa.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="2SA 17:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2SA 17:6" />Ana Hushayi u ta̱wa̱i u Abusalom, ɗa Abusalom u danai ni, &lt;&lt;Odoki a na Ahitofelu u nekei a ɗaɗa na. U gaꞋan ta̱ ci yaꞋan ili i na u danai? Ko vi ta̱ n o yoku kau?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="2SA 17:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="2SA 17:7" />Ɗa Hushayi u danai Abusalom, &lt;&lt;Nampa odoki a na Ahitofelu u nekei a gaꞋan ba.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="2SA 17:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2SA 17:8" />Ɗa Hushayi u danai, &lt;&lt;Avu vu yeve ta̱ esheku a̱ nu n uma a̱ ni a fuɗi o kuvon a ɗa, i ta̱ n asuvu usuɗukpi an kawu na a ɗikai muku. Ko n tsu nannai ba, esheku a̱ nu keyevi ko kuvon kaꞋa, wi a ku asa n uma a̱ ni ba. <verse eid="2SA 17:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2SA 17:9" />U gaꞋan ba gogo na u bana ta̱ u sheɗeku a kaɓatsu ko ubuta̱ u yoku kau. Ɗa baci o kuvon ku giti ɗa osoji a̱ nu o yoku kenu a̱ kuwa̱i, vuza na baci u panai arabali a wi ta̱ a kudana, &lt;A una ta̱ osoji a Abusalom n a̱bunda̱i.&gt; <verse eid="2SA 17:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2SA 17:10" />Nannai va wi ta̱ a kuzuwa kosoji ka na ki n wovon ba tsu ka̱ɗu ka kawu u pana wovon. Adama a na aza a Isaraila ra̱ka̱ e yeve ta̱ esheku a̱ nu u yeve ta̱ vishili ka̱u osoji a̱ ni kpamu aza a ugbamiwasuvu a ɗa. <verse eid="2SA 17:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2SA 17:11" />Ama odoki a̱ va̱ a ɗa na, o ɓolonku wu aza a Isaraila ra̱ka̱, ili i na i ɗikai a Dan a kubana a Beyersheba, ka̱bunda̱i ke le ki ta̱ a kuyaꞋan tsu kayala ka malaꞋa. Ka̱ta̱ avu n ka̱ci ka̱ nu vu wala kelime a kubana a̱ ubuta̱ u vishili wa. <verse eid="2SA 17:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2SA 17:12" />Ta tsa kubana tsa la̱nsa̱ yi a ubuta̱ u na baci de dem wi, ka̱ta̱ tsu palai n kuvon tsu na ciza tsu tsupala iɗika. A̱yi n uma a̱ ni, babu vuza na tsa kuka̱sukpa̱ n wuma. <verse eid="2SA 17:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2SA 17:13" />Ɗa baci kpamu u sumai a kubana asuvu a̱ likuci ya, osoji a Isaraila ra̱ka̱ i ta̱ a̱ kutuka̱ n awin, ka̱ta̱ o rono atali a na i a mashilya ma̱ likuci ya a kubana a ka̱ra̱Ꞌa̱, ali wokpo babu vuza na wa kene kpamu katali u katsangbani n vutoku.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="2SA 17:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="2SA 17:14" />Ɗa Abusalom n aza a Isaraila ra̱ka̱ ushuki n a danai, &lt;&lt;Odoki a Hushayi vuza vu Ariki a laꞋa ta̱ a Ahitofelu.&gt;&gt; Adama a na Vuzavaguɗu ɗa u zuwai aza a Isaraila a̱ kpa̱ɗa̱ kupana odoki a singai a Ahitofelu, adama a na u tuka̱ Abusalom n kawuya.<verse eid="2SA 17:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="2SA 17:15" />Ɗa Hushayi u danai anan ganu Zadoku n Abiyata, &lt;&lt;Odoki a na Ahitofelu u danai Abusalom koɓolo nu nkoshi m gba̱ra̱-gba̱ra̱ ma aza a Isaraila a ɗaɗa na, ama odoki a na mpa n danai le a ɗa na. <verse eid="2SA 17:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2SA 17:16" />Gogo na yaꞋin moloko i bana i dana Dawuda, &lt;Ka̱ta̱ wa asa ɗevu m meremune anana ba, ama u pasa adama a na talo a ku una yi koɓolo n uma a̱ ni ra̱ka̱.&gt; &gt;&gt; <verse eid="2SA 17:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2SA 17:17" />Ɗa Janata koɓolo n Ahimazu a shamgbai lo a kuvana yi a̱ ubuta̱ u a̱shi a̱ mini a na e ci ɗeke Eni-rogelu. Kagbashi ke mekere ka tsu bana ta̱ n ka danai le ili na yi punu asuvu a̱ likuci ya, ka̱ta̱ ele tamkpamu a bana a dana mogono Dawuda. A tsu yaꞋan ta̱ nannai adama a na ka̱ta̱ ene le a ku uwa punu asuvu a̱ likuci ya ba. <verse eid="2SA 17:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2SA 17:18" />Ama ɗa maku mo kolobo me enei le ɗa u banai u danai Abusalom. Adama a nannai ɗa Ahimazu n Janata a yaꞋin moloko ɗa a uwai asuvu a kpaꞋa ku vuma vu yoku a̱ likuci i Bahurim. Vuma va tana wi ta̱ n kayinva punu asuvu a kpaꞋa ku ni, ɗa a uwai punu a suvu a kayinva ka ɗa e sheɗeki. <verse eid="2SA 17:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="2SA 17:19" />Ɗa vuka vu kpaꞋa va u palai una̱ u kayinva wa. Ɗa u tuka̱i n ili i kashina wu ecikpei gaɗi vu una̱ u kayinva ka. Ɗa u kalukpai i ɗa mayin uteku tsu na vuma u kuyeve a na ili yoku yi punu ba. <verse eid="2SA 17:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="2SA 17:20" />Ana uma a Abusalom a̱ ta̱wa̱i a kpaꞋa ku vuka ka, ɗa a danai, &lt;&lt;Teɗai Ahimazu koɓolo n Janata va i?&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2SA 17:20">Ɗa vuka va wu ushuki le u danai, &lt;&lt;A pasa ta̱ ɗe kuyene gogo na&gt;&gt; Ɗa tana a̱ la̱nsa̱i le ama e ne le ba, ɗa uma a a kpatalai o kubono a Urushelima.<verse eid="2SA 17:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="2SA 17:21" />Ana uma a a lazai, ɗa Ahimazu koɓolo n Janata va a̱ uta̱i punu a kayinva ka, ɗa a banai u mogono Dawuda a danai ni. &lt;&lt;YaꞋan moloko vu pasa kuyene ka, adama a odoki a na Ahitofelu u nekei adama a̱ nu a gbani-gbani a ɗa.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="2SA 17:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="2SA 17:22" />Ɗa Dawuda koɓolo n uma a na n a̱yi ra̱ka̱ a̱ ɗa̱nga̱i a pasai Kuyene ku Urudu. Kafu kayin ka asa vuza dem u pasai kuyene ka.<verse eid="2SA 17:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="2SA 17:23" />Ana Ahitofelu we enei a̱ kpa̱ɗa̱i kutono odoki a̱ ni, ɗa u foɓusoi majaki ma̱ ni ɗa u kumbai, u bonoi a̱ likuci i ni. Ana u foɓusoi kpaꞋa ku ni koɓolon n ucanuku u ni, ɗa u saki ka̱ci ka̱ ni a maɗanga u kuwa̱i, ɗa a̱ ciɗa̱ngi ni a kasaun ke esheku ka̱ ni.<verse eid="2SA 17:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="2SA 17:24" />Ɗa Dawuda u yawai a̱ likuci i Mahanayim, ana Abusalom koɓolo n uma a̱ ni aza a Isaraila ra̱ka̱ a pasai Kuyene ku Urudu. <verse eid="2SA 17:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="2SA 17:25" />Ɗa Abusalom u zuwai Amasa wo okpoi kovonshi vo osoji a̱ ni a una̱ u Jowabu. Amasa maku ma Itahara<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">17:25 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Itahara </char><char style="ft" closed="false">E ci ɗeke yi ta̱ kpamu n kula Yetere.</char></note> ma a, vuza kumaci ku Ishimaila. Itahara u zuwai Abigelu mekere ma Nahashi, taku vu Zeruya, a̱na̱ku a Jowabu. <verse eid="2SA 17:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="2SA 17:26" />Ɗa uma a Isaraila koɓolo n Abusalom a̱ shikpa̱i a̱pa̱m e le a uɓon u likuci i Giliyadu.<verse eid="2SA 17:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="2SA 17:27" />Ana Dawuda u yawai a̱ likuci i Mahanayim ɗa u cinai lo Shobi maku ma Nahashi vuza na wu uta̱i a̱ likuci i Raba a iɗika i Amona, Koɓolon n Makiru kolobo ka Amiyelu vuza vu likuci i Lodeba, koɓolo m Bazila vuza vu Giliyadu vu Rogelim. <verse eid="2SA 17:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="2SA 17:28" />Ɗa a̱ tuka̱i Dawuda n kajiba, nu nvene, nu mgbodo n kuya̱na̱, koɓolo n itabi, m bali, n kiya, n ya̱nji yi uzungi, n awaya, nu ngeceꞋin. <verse eid="2SA 17:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="2SA 17:29" />Ɗa kpamu o doku a̱ tuka̱i n ishigi, nu aruguda a mani ma anaka, n nkyon, n ukuja u mani adama a na e yeve ta̱ Dawuda n uma a̱ ni i ta̱ a kupana kambulu, n woꞋi, n kakuli, e meremune.<verse eid="2SA 17:29" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2SA 17" />
  <chapter number="18" style="c" sid="2SA 18" />
  <para style="s1">Ukpa̱ u Abusalom</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2SA 18:1" />Dawuda u foɓusoi osoji a na i koɓolo n a̱yi ɗa u peciki le a̱kpa̱n-a̱kpa̱n n amangatawun a tawun. A̱ ka̱tsura̱ dem u zagbakai le vuza e kelime. <verse eid="2SA 18:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2SA 18:2" />Ɗa Dawuda u pecei le a̱tsura̱ a tatsu. Ɗa Jowabu u tonoi n ugboku u iyain, Abishayi toku vu Jowabu maku ma Zeruya u tonoi n ugboku u ire. Ɗa kpamu Itayi vuza vu Gatu u tonoi n ugboku u tatsu. Ɗa Dawuda u danai le, &lt;&lt;Mpa n ka̱ci ka̱ va̱ mi ta̱ a kubana n a̱ɗa̱.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="2SA 18:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="2SA 18:3" />Ama osoji a a danai, &lt;&lt;A̱Ꞌa̱, vi a kubana n a̱tsu ba. Adama a na tsu suma baci a̱ ubuta̱ u kuvon, e kukeɓece ukuna u tsu ba. Ko kagimi ka̱ tsu ka baci a̱ kuwa̱i, e kukeɓece tsu ukuna ba, adama a na avu endeꞋin vi ta̱ a̱ una̱ u uma a̱kpa̱n kupa (10,000) a uma a̱ tsu. Wi ta̱ a kula n ku gaꞋan kpamu avu da̱sa̱ngu asuvu a̱ likuci vu ka̱na̱ ku suꞋuku tsu n uɓa̱nki.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="2SA 18:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="2SA 18:4" />Ɗa mogono ma danai le, &lt;&lt;Ili i na de dem ye enei yi ta̱ n ugaꞋin mi ta̱ a kuyaꞋan i ɗa.&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2SA 18:4">Ɗa mogono ma shamgbai a̱ utsutsu u likuci wa a makyan ma na osoji a i nwalu a kubana ubuta̱ u kuvon wa a̱tsura̱ amangatawun tawun n a̱tsura̱ a̱ a̱kpa̱n-a̱kpa̱n. <verse eid="2SA 18:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2SA 18:5" />Ɗa Mogono ma danai Jowabu n Abishayi n Itayi, &lt;&lt;Adama a̱ va̱ i tono n Abusalom kolobo ka nanlo ka sawu.&gt;&gt; A̱tsura̱ a ra̱ka̱ a pana ta̱ makyan ma na Mogono mi e kuneke ovonshi ra̱ka̱ kadanshi u tsu na a kuyaꞋan n Abusalom va.<verse eid="2SA 18:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="2SA 18:6" />Ɗa osoji a Dawuda a lazai a kubana a kakamba, a yaꞋin kuvon n a osoji a Isaraila a̱ kutsun ku Ifirayimu. <verse eid="2SA 18:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2SA 18:7" />Ɗa osoji a Dawuda a lyaꞋi osoji a Isaraila n kuvon, ɗa unai uma ka̱u a kanna ka nanlo, ali uma a̱kpa̱ kamanga (20,000). <verse eid="2SA 18:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2SA 18:8" />Ɗa vishili va vu ka̱ra̱Ꞌi asuvu a iɗika ya ra̱ka̱, aza a na kutsun ku lyaꞋi a laꞋa ta̱ aza a na unai n kotokobi.<verse eid="2SA 18:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="2SA 18:9" />Ana i lo ɗa Abusalom u gasai n osoji a Dawuda. A̱yi tana ilaɗi n makparagi ma̱ ni, ɗa makparagi ma ma uwai ɗaka vu acaka a maɗanga mo oku, ɗa kacaka ko koyonoi ni a kaci ɗa wokponoi, makparagi ma tamkpamu ma lazai ma̱ ka̱sukpa̱i ni uta̱la̱kpi.<verse eid="2SA 18:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="2SA 18:10" />Ana vuza te a̱ ka̱tsuma̱ ko osoji a Dawuda we enei nannai, ɗa u danai Jowabu, &lt;&lt;Me ene ta̱ Abusalom a̱ ka̱ta̱la̱la̱ gaɗi vu maɗanga magbayin mo oku.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="2SA 18:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="2SA 18:11" />Ɗa Jowabu u danai vuza na u danai ni va, &lt;&lt;Yiɗa̱i vu danai ve enei? Yiɗa̱i i zuwai ɗa vu kpa̱ɗa̱i ku unai yi lo vu vakangu a iɗika? Mi ishi tana e kuneke wu azurufa kupa koɓolon kaɗambura ka tsugbayin.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="2SA 18:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="2SA 18:12" />Ɗa Vuma va u danai Jowabu, &lt;&lt;Kukiye ku va̱ ki a ku saꞋawa maku ma mogono ba, ko vu neke mu baci azurufa ka̱kpa̱n (1,000) e kukiye ku va̱, adama a na ra̱ka̱ vu tsu tsu pana ta̱ makyan ma na mogono mi e kuneke ɗa̱ kadanshi, avu n Abishayi n Itayi, &lt;Adama a̱ va̱ i tono n Abusalom kolobo ka nanlo ka sawu.&gt; <verse eid="2SA 18:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2SA 18:13" />Mi ishi baci mu una yi, babu tsu na a kuyaꞋan mogono ma̱ kpa̱ɗa̱ kuyeve, ka̱ta̱ tana a vu n ka̱ci ka̱ nu vu ronono, vu ka̱sukpa̱ mu.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="2SA 18:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="2SA 18:14" />Ɗa Jowabu u danai, &lt;&lt;Mi a̱ kula̱nga̱sa̱ makyan na ba.&gt;&gt; Ɗa u ɗikai nsara n tatsu u banai a̱ ubuta̱ u na Abusalom wi. U cina ni a̱ uta̱la̱kpi a maɗanga ma gbayin mo Oku ma babu u kuwa̱, ɗa u sapai Abusalom nu nsara ma a̱ ma̱ka̱nga̱, <verse eid="2SA 18:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2SA 18:15" />Ɗa olobo kupa aza a na a tsu ɓa̱na̱ ucanuku u kuvon u Jowabu wa, a kambuki Abusalom ɗa una ni.<verse eid="2SA 18:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="2SA 18:16" />Ɗa Jowabu lika̱i kavana adama a na u shamkpa kuvon. Ɗa osoji a̱ ni ka̱sukpa̱i kutono osoji aza a Isaraila. <verse eid="2SA 18:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2SA 18:17" />Ɗa a ɗikai keve ka ikyamba ka Abusalom ɗa a vakangi kaꞋa asuvu e kpenle kugbayin a kakamba. Ɗa palai ni n atali kaginga. Ɗa aza Isaraila ra̱ka̱ a sumai a kubana a iꞋuwa i le.<verse eid="2SA 18:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="2SA 18:18" />A ayin a wuma a̱ ni, Abusalom u maꞋaka ta̱ ka̱ci ka̱ ni kashamkpatsu ka na a kuciɓa n a̱yi ɗe a̱ ka̱ra̱Ꞌa̱ ko mogono, adama a na u dana ta̱, &lt;&lt;Mi m maku ma na ma kuzuwa a ciɓa n Kula ku va̱ ba.&gt;&gt; Ɗa u neꞋe kashamkpatsu ka kula ku ni, ɗa tana a̱ ka̱na̱i kuɗekushei n kula ku Abusalom ali n anana.<verse eid="2SA 18:18" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Dawuda u yaꞋin kpalu ku ukpa̱ u Abusalom</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="2SA 18:19" />Ɗa Ahimazu maku ma Zadoku u danai Jowabu, &lt;&lt;YaꞋan n suma m bana n dana mogono uteku tsu na Vuzavaguɗu wu isai ni ekiye irala i ni.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="2SA 18:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="2SA 18:20" />&lt;&lt;Ɗa Jowabu u danai ni vi a kubanka n kadanshi ka anana ba. Ama vi ta̱ a kufuɗa kubanka kadanshi ka nanlo a kanna ko yoku, ama ka̱ta̱ vu yaꞋan nannai anana ba, adama a na maku mo mogono ma̱ kuwa̱ ta̱.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="2SA 18:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="2SA 18:21" />Ɗa Jowabu u danai vuza vu Kush, &lt;&lt;Bana vu dana mogono ili na ve enei.&gt;&gt; Ɗa vuza vu Kush u kuɗa̱ngi ki Jowabu, ɗa u ɗa̱nga̱i u sumai u ka̱sukpa̱i ni.<verse eid="2SA 18:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="2SA 18:22" />Ɗa Ahimazu maku ma Zadoku u doki u danai Jowabu, &lt;&lt;Ko yiɗa̱i baci i kuciya̱ mu, ka̱sukpa̱ mu n suma n tono kucina̱ ku vuza vu Kushi va.&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2SA 18:22">Ɗa Jowabu wushuki, &lt;&lt;Maku ma̱ va̱ yiɗa̱i i zuwai ɗa va kusuma, adama a na vi n katsupu ka arabali ka na va kubanka ba?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="2SA 18:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="2SA 18:23" />Ɗa u danai, &lt;&lt;Ko yiɗa̱i baci ya kucinaka mu sai mpa m bana.&gt;&gt; Ɗa Jowabu u danai, &lt;&lt;Suma.&gt;&gt;Ɗa tana Ahimazu va u sumai u tonoi n uye u na u walai a̱ ka̱pula̱ka̱ ali u lazai vuza vu Kushi va.<verse eid="2SA 18:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="2SA 18:24" />Dawuda tana ida̱shi e mere ma utsutsu u re u likuci, Ɗa vuza na wi a kinda likuci ya u kumbai mashilya ma̱ likuci ali gaɗi kukpa̱Ꞌa̱, ɗa u ɗa̱ngusa̱i a̱shi a̱ni ɗa we enei vuma yoku a ilaɗi n endeꞋin ni a̱ kuta̱wa̱. <verse eid="2SA 18:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="2SA 18:25" />Ɗa vuza vu kindi va u ɗekushei mogono u danai ni.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2SA 18:25">Ɗa mogono ma ma danai, &lt;&lt;A̱yi ɗa baci endeꞋen ni, u gaꞋan ba wi ta̱ n kadanshi kasingai.&gt;&gt; Ɗa vuma va u laꞋasakai kuyawa ɗevu.<verse eid="2SA 18:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="2SA 18:26" />Ɗa kpamu vuza kindi va u doku we enei vuma vi yoku ilaɗi, ɗa u ɗekushi vuza na wi a̱ kinda utsutsu, &lt;&lt;La̱na̱, vuma vi yoku ɗa lo ilaɗi a̱ kuta̱wa̱ endeꞋin.&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2SA 18:26">Ɗa mogono ma danai, &lt;&lt;U gaꞋan ba a̱yi feu wi ta̱ a̱ kutuka̱ n arabali a kasingai.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="2SA 18:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="2SA 18:27" />Ɗa vuza kindi va u danai, &lt;&lt;Mene ta̱ adanshi vuza vu gita̱i va wi ta̱ ilaɗi adanshi Ahimazu maku ma Zadoku maꞋa.&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2SA 18:27">Ɗa mogono ma danai,&lt;&lt;A̱yi vuma vu singai ɗa wi, u ta̱wa̱ ta̱ feu n arabali a singai.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="2SA 18:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="2SA 18:28" />Ɗa Ahimazu va u ɗekushei mogono, wuma u nu u geshe &lt;&lt;Ili ya yi ta̱ nwalu derere.&gt;&gt; Ɗa u vaki ma̱kpa̱ɓa̱ n a̱shi a̱ ni a iɗika e kelime ko mogono u danai,&lt;&lt;Una̱singai u ɗa a kubana u Vuzavaguɗu Ka̱shile ka̱ nu, a̱yi na wu isai nu ekiye aza a na i a tsurala n vuzagbayin mogono.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="2SA 18:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="2SA 18:29" />Ɗa mogono me ecei, &lt;&lt;Abusalom wi ta̱ n wuma?&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2SA 18:29">Ɗa Ahimazu wu ushuki, &lt;&lt;A ayin ana Jowabu u suki mu, ka̱ɗu ka̱ va̱ ka̱ muɗa̱ ta̱ ka̱u ama n yeve ili i na yi lo ba.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="2SA 18:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="2SA 18:30" />Ɗa mogono ma danai, &lt;&lt;Shamgba a kakambu vu vana punu na.&gt;&gt; Ɗa u bonoi a kakambu u shamgbai.<verse eid="2SA 18:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="2SA 18:31" />Ɗa Vuza vu Kushi va u yawai u danai, &lt;&lt;Vuzagbayin vu va̱ mogono, pana arabali asingai a nampa. Vuzavaguɗu wu isa wu ta̱ anana ekiye aza a na i a tsurala n avu.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="2SA 18:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="2SA 18:32" />Ɗa mogono me ecei vuza vu Kushi va u danai, &lt;&lt;Abusalom kolobo ka nanlo wi ta̱ m ma̱ta̱na̱?&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2SA 18:32">Ɗa Vuza vu Kushi va u danai, &lt;&lt;YaꞋan aza a na i a tsurala n mogono ma̱ va̱ koɓolo n aza a na i o ku foɓosuko wu kagbanigbani ra̱ka̱ okpo uteku tsu kolobo ka nanlo ka.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="2SA 18:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="2SA 18:33" />Ɗa mogono mo voɗotsoi. Ɗa u kumbai gaɗi vu kunu ko oɓolo ku na ki utsutsu u likuci ɗa u shika̱i. U ka̱na̱i ma̱shi nu udanai, &lt;&lt;Maku ma̱ va̱ Abusalom, maku ma̱ va̱ Abusalom. Wi ishi u laꞋa n ugaꞋin mpa n kuwa̱ ana maku ma̱ va̱ Abusalom wa̱ kuwa̱, maku ma̱ va̱ maku ma̱ va̱.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="2SA 18:33" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2SA 18" />
  <chapter number="19" style="c" sid="2SA 19" />
  <para style="s1">Jowabu u ɓarangi Dawuda</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2SA 19:1" />A danai Jowabu, &lt;&lt;Mogono mi ta̱ ɗe a̱ ma̱shi m kpalu u adama a Abusalom.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="2SA 19:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2SA 19:2" />Ɗa u lyaꞋi u kuvon una osoji ra̱ka̱ a̱ ciya̱i a kanna ka nanlo ka wo okpoi le ili una̱mgbi u ka̱tsuma̱, adama a na a kanna ka nanlo ka osoji a pana ta̱ a danai, &lt;&lt;Mogono mi ta̱ ɗe a una̱mgbuka̱tsuma̱ adama a ukpa̱ u maku ma̱ ni.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="2SA 19:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2SA 19:3" />Ɗa osoji a o bonoi asuvu a̱ likuci i le n ka̱bini uteku tsu osoji a na a panai wono ana sumai a ubuta̱ u kuvon. <verse eid="2SA 19:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2SA 19:4" />Ɗa mogono ma palai a̱shi a̱ ni, ɗa u shika̱i n kacaꞋa n u danai, &lt;&lt;Maku ma̱ va̱ Abusalom, maku ma̱ va̱ Abusalom.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="2SA 19:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="2SA 19:5" />Ɗa Jowabu u uwai asuvu a kpaꞋa ku na mogono ma mi ɗa u danai ni, &lt;&lt;Anana vu neke ta̱ osoji a̱ nu wono. Ele na isai wuma u nu, koɓolo n wuma u muku n nu n a̱ma̱ci a̱ nu n a̱ma̱ci a gbani a na vu zuwai. <verse eid="2SA 19:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2SA 19:6" />Adama a na vu laꞋa ta̱ n kuciga aza a na a iwain nu, ɗa vu iwain aza a na a cigai nu. Anana vu yotsongu tsu ta̱ e keteshe ovonshi n osoji le ili i ɗa i wa̱ nu ba. Mene ta̱ vi ta̱ a kulaꞋa m ma̱za̱nga̱ anana Abusalom wi baci n wuma, ka̱ta̱ a̱ tsu tamkpamu tsu kuwa̱. <verse eid="2SA 19:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2SA 19:7" />Ama gogo na uta̱ ka̱ta̱ vu neke uma ra̱ka̱ kadanshi, vu yaꞋan baci nannai ba n kucina ta̱ n Vuzavaguɗu anana babu vuza te na wa ku asa n a vu n kayi ka nampa. Nannai va wi ta̱ a kulaꞋa nu mɓa̱la̱ ali u laꞋa ili i wuya i na i saꞋwai kucina ka wu a ayin a na vi ishi kolobo ali a̱ kuta̱wa̱ anana.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="2SA 19:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="2SA 19:8" />Ɗa mogono ma ɗa̱nga̱i ma banai ma̱ da̱sa̱ngi a utsutsu u likuci. Ana uma a panai,&lt;&lt;Mogono mi ta̱ ɗe ida̱shi a utsutsu u likuci,&gt;&gt; ɗa uma ra̱ka̱ a banai a̱ ubuta̱ u ni.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2SA 19:8">Ɗa aza a Isaraila ra̱ka̱ yaba dem u sumai a kubana a kpaꞋa ku ni. <verse eid="2SA 19:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2SA 19:9" />Ɗa kumaci ka aza a Isaraila ra̱ka̱ a̱ ka̱na̱i kanananai n dansai, &lt;&lt;Mogono Dawuda ɗa wi isai tsu a ekiye i rala i tsu. A̱yi ɗa vuza na wi sai tsu ekiye a aza a Filisitiya. Ama ɗa gogo na u sumai a iɗika ya adama a Abusalom. <verse eid="2SA 19:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2SA 19:10" />Ama Abusalom vuza na tsu erengi wu okpo mogono ma̱ tsu u kuwa̱ ta̱ a̱ ubuta̱ u kuvon. Gogo na yiɗa̱i i zuwai ɗa tsu kpa̱ɗa̱i kukeɓece kakuna adama ukuna u kubonoko m mogono Dawuda?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="2SA 19:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="2SA 19:11" />Ana Dawuda u panai ili i na aza a Isaraila i a kudansa, ɗa u suki n akaka a kubana u Zadoku n Abiyata anan Ganu. Ɗa u danai le, &lt;&lt;Ecei nkoshi m gba̱ra̱-gba̱ra̱ ma aza a Yahuda i dana le, &lt;Yiɗa̱i i zuwai ɗa yo okpoi aza a ukocishi a ukuna u kubonoko Mogono ma̱ ɗa̱ a kpaꞋa ku ni? <verse eid="2SA 19:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2SA 19:12" />A̱ ɗa̱ aza a̱ va̱ a ɗa nu mpasa n va̱. Yiɗa̱i i zuwai ɗa yo okpoi aza a ukocishi u kubonoko mogono ma̱ ɗa̱ a kpaꞋa ku ni?&gt; <verse eid="2SA 19:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2SA 19:13" />Ka̱ta̱ i dana Amasa, &lt;Avu va vuza̱ va̱ ɗa nu mpasa n va̱ ba? Ka̱shile ka ɗika wuma u va̱ n zuwa wu baci vu okpo kovonshi vo osoji a̱ va̱ una̱ Jowabu ba.&gt; &gt;&gt;<verse eid="2SA 19:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="2SA 19:14" />Ɗa Amasa u fuɗai a̱ɗu aza a Yahuda o bonoi a ubuta̱. Ɗa a̱ suꞋuki mogono n akaka, &lt;&lt;Bono, avu n uma a̱ nu ra̱ka̱.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="2SA 19:14" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Dawuda u bonoi a Urushelima</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="2SA 19:15" />Ɗa mogono ma̱ ka̱na̱i uye o kubono a Urushelima. Ana u yawai e Kuyene ku Urudu, ɗa aza a Yahuda a̱ ta̱wa̱i lo a Giliga adama a na a gasa n a̱yi kpamu a pasa Kuyene Urudu n a̱yi. <verse eid="2SA 19:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2SA 19:16" />Shimeya maku ma Gera vuza vu Bayami vu likuci i Bahurim, u yaꞋin moloko a kubana koɓolo n uma aza a Yahuda, adama a a gasa m mogono Dawuda. <verse eid="2SA 19:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2SA 19:17" />Shimeya u ta̱wa̱i n aza a Bayami uma ka̱kpa̱n (1,000), koɓolo n Ziba vuza vu ulinga vu Shawulu a̱yi m muku mo olobo n ni gendu n agbashi a̱ ni uma kamanga. Ra̱ka̱ vu le a lazai a kubana e Kuyene ku Urudu adama a na a gasa m mogono Dawuda. <verse eid="2SA 19:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2SA 19:18" />Ɗa a pasai kuyene ka adama a na a pasaka mogono ma n uma a̱ ni, ka̱ta̱ kpamu a yaꞋanka yi ili i na wi a kuciga. <verse eid="2SA 19:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="2SA 19:19" />Ɗa u danai ni, &lt;&lt;Wuma u nu u geshe, mi ta̱ ufolu u nu ka̱ta̱ vu reme unushi u va̱ a̱ ka̱ɗu ka̱ nu ba. Ka̱ta̱ kpamu vu ciɓa n tsu na kagbashi ka̱ nu ka nusaka yi nu kanna ka na vu ka̱sukpa̱i Urushelima ba. YaꞋan vu takpa kaꞋa a̱ ka̱ɗu ka̱ nu mogono. <verse eid="2SA 19:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="2SA 19:20" />N yeve ta̱ mpa kagbashi ka̱ nu n yaꞋanka wu ta̱ unushi. I ɗaɗa i zuwai ɗa mo okpoi vuza iyain vuna wa kugasa n a vu a̱ ka̱tsuma̱ ka kpaꞋa ku Isufu, adama a na n ta̱wa̱ n gasa n avu vuzagbayin vu va̱ mogono.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="2SA 19:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="2SA 19:21" />Ɗa Abishayi maku ma Zeruya ma̱ ushuki ma danai, &lt;&lt;U gaꞋan a una Shimeya adama a kakuna ka nampa ba? U shika ta̱ Mazagbi ma Vuzavaguɗu.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="2SA 19:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="2SA 19:22" />Ama ɗa Dawuda wu ushuki, &lt;&lt;Yayi wu ecei ɗa̱ kakuna a̱ɗa̱ muku n Zeruya? I ciga ta̱ i ronoko mu kadama? Gogo na n yeve ta̱ mpa ɗa mogono ma aza a Isaraila, kpamu babu vuza na a ku una anana a̱ ka̱tsuma ka aza a Isaraila.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="2SA 19:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="2SA 19:23" />Ɗa mogono ma danai Shimeya, &lt;&lt;N kucina ta̱ babu vuza na wa ku una wu.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="2SA 19:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="2SA 19:24" />Ɗa Mefiboshetu vashi vu Shawulu u cipa̱i feu adama a na u gasa n mogono. Mefiboshetu va tana u saꞋa ene a̱ ni ba u puna kpamu ntsa̱ka̱ n ni ba u za̱Ꞌa̱ kpamu ntogu n ni ba a kanna ka na Dawuda u lazai ali n kanna ka na u bonoi m ma̱ta̱na̱.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">19:24 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2SA 9:1-13">2 Sam 9:1-13</ref>; <ref loc="2SA 16:1-4">16:1-4</ref></char></note> <verse eid="2SA 19:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="2SA 19:25" />Ana u yawai a Urushelima adama a na u gasa n mogono, ɗa mogono me ecei ni, &lt;&lt;Yiɗa̱i i zuwai ɗa vu kpa̱ɗa̱i kubana koɓolo nu mpa Mefiboshetu?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="2SA 19:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="2SA 19:26" />Ɗa Mefiboshetu wu ushuki u danai, &lt;&lt;Wuma u nu geshe, vu yeve ta̱ mpa ma̱kutsuma̱ maꞋa. A makyan ma na n danai Ziba vuza na wa kuyaꞋan ka wu u linga u foɓosuko mu majaki n kumba n tono wu mogono, ɗa Ziba u kparasai mu u lazai. <verse eid="2SA 19:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="2SA 19:27" />Ama ɗa u yaꞋankai mu kadanshi ka uwa. Wuma u nu geshe mogono, avu vi ta̱ tsu kalingata ka̱ Ka̱shile, mi ta̱ a kufolono wu vu yaꞋanka mu ili i na ve enei i gaꞋin nu. <verse eid="2SA 19:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="2SA 19:28" />Adama a na ntsukaya n akaya a̱ va̱ ra̱ka̱ u yotso ta̱ a̱ kuwa̱, adama a̱ nu vuzagbayin mogono, ɗa vu zuwai mu mo okpoi a̱ ka̱tsuma̱ ka aza a na i a kulyaꞋa a kirukpa kute n avu. M buwa n una̱ u kadanshi n folono ili i yoku e kiye a̱ nu kpamu ba?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="2SA 19:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="2SA 19:29" />Ɗa mogono ma danai ni, &lt;&lt;Yiɗa̱i vi o kufolono kpamu? N sheshe ta̱ ɗe avu n Ziba a̱ɗa̱ ɗa i kupece iɗika i Shawulu ya.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="2SA 19:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="2SA 19:30" />Ɗa Mefiboshetu u danai mogono, &lt;&lt;Vuzagbayin a̱ ka̱sukpa̱ka̱ Ziba ili ra̱ka̱, an me enei vu bonoi m ma̱ta̱na̱.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="2SA 19:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="2SA 19:31" />Ɗa feu Bazila vuza vu Giliyadu wu uta̱i a Rogelim u banai ɗe e Kuyene ku Urudu ka adama a na u pasa koɓolo mogono ma ka̱ta̱ u ka̱sukpa̱ yi u laza. <verse eid="2SA 19:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="2SA 19:32" />Bazila u kutsa ta̱ ka̱u wi ta̱ n a̱ya̱ amanga̱na̱shi. U ɓa̱nka̱ ta̱ mogono Dawuda n ili n a̱bunda̱i a makyan ma na wi ida̱shi a Mahanayim, adama a na a̱yi vuza vu uciyi ɗa. <verse eid="2SA 19:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="2SA 19:33" />Ɗa mogono ma danai Bazila, &lt;&lt;Ta̱wa̱ tsu pasa kuyene ka koɓolo a kubana a Urushelima, mpa mi ta̱ a̱ kuɓa̱nka̱ wu.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="2SA 19:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="2SA 19:34" />Ama ɗa Bazila wu ushuki mogono, &lt;&lt;A̱ya̱ e ne a ɗai a buwai mu a wuma, an ma kubana koɓolo m mogono a Urushelima? <verse eid="2SA 19:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="2SA 19:35" />Mpa gogo na mi ta̱ n a̱ya̱ amanga̱na̱shi. Mi ta̱ a kufuɗa kudoku ku kuyeve i singai n i gbani-gbani? Kagbashi ka̱ nu ki ta̱ o kudoku kuyeve uyo wi ili i na u kulyaꞋa n i na wo kusoꞋo? Mi ta̱ a kufuɗa kupana a̱la̱ka̱tsu a aza a ishipa ali ko a̱ma̱ci? Yiɗa̱i i kuzuwa n doku wu a̱miki vuzagbayin vu va̱ mogono? <verse eid="2SA 19:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="2SA 19:36" />U gaꞋan n ciya̱ katsupu tsunampa ba, kagbashi ka̱ nu ki ta̱ o kusoku wu mogono, ka̱ta̱ tsu pasa Urudu ali tsu bana daꞋangi kenu, <verse eid="2SA 19:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="2SA 19:37" />YaꞋan kagbashi ka̱ nu ka kpatala, adama a na n kuwa̱ a̱ likuci i va̱ ɗevu n kasaun ke esheku a̱ va̱ n ka̱ a̱na̱ku a̱ va̱. Ama vuzagbayin, kagbashi ka̱ nu ka na maku ma̱ va̱ Kimham. YaꞋan u pasa koɓolo n vuzagbayin va̱ mogono. Ka̱ta̱ kpamu vu yaꞋan ili dem i na ve enei i gaꞋin nu kuyaꞋanka yi.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="2SA 19:37" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="2SA 19:38" />Ɗa mogono ma danai, &lt;&lt;Kimham wi ta̱ a kupasa koɓolo nu mpa, ka̱ta̱ n yaꞋanka yi ili i na vi cigai. Ili i na vu cikalai wa̱ va̱ dem, mi ta̱ a kuyaꞋanka wu i ɗa.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="2SA 19:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="2SA 19:39" />Ɗa uma ra̱ka̱ a pasai Kuyene ku Urudu ka, ɗa feu mogono mo tonoi. Ɗa mogono moɓongi Bazila ɗa u zuwakai ni una̱singai, ɗa Bazila u kpatalai u bonoi a kpaꞋa ku ni.<verse eid="2SA 19:39" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="2SA 19:40" />Ana mogono ma pasai Giliga, ɗa Kimham feu u pasai koɓolo n a̱yi. Osoji aza a Yahuda ra̱ka̱ n kagimi ko osoji ka aza a Isaraila feu, a pasai koɓolo n mogono ma.<verse eid="2SA 19:40" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="2SA 19:41" />Ɗa aza a Isaraila ra̱ka̱ a banai u mogono ɗa a danai ni, &lt;&lt;Yiɗa̱i i zuwai ɗa uma a̱tsu aza a Yahuda o bokoi nu ɗa a lazakai n avu n uma a kpaꞋa ku nu ra̱ka̱ a kubana upashi u nampa u Urudu?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="2SA 19:41" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="2SA 19:42" />Ɗa aza a Yahuda a ushuki aza a Isaraila, &lt;&lt;Tsu yaꞋan ta̱ nannai va adama a na mogono ma kumaci kutsu ku ɗa ku cika. Yiɗa̱i i zuwai ɗa yi una̱mgbuka̱tsuma̱ adama ili i nampa? Yiɗa̱i ci lyaꞋi i mogono, ko i pana ta̱ u nekei tsu ili i yoku i ni.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="2SA 19:42" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="2SA 19:43" />Ɗa aza a Isaraila ushuki aza a Yahuda, a danai, &lt;&lt;A̱tsu ci ta̱ kumaci kupa a̱ ka̱tsuma̱ ko tsugono ka, kpamu tsu laꞋa ta̱ n katsura an tsa kuɗika Dawuda wo okpo mogono ma̱ tsu. Yiɗa̱i i zuwai ɗa i goyoi tsu? A̱tsu ɗa tsu gita̱i kudana mogono ma̱ tsu mo bono ba?&gt;&gt; Ama kadanshi ka na aza a Yahuda a dansai ka laꞋa ta̱ ka aza a Isaraila usuɗukpi.<verse eid="2SA 19:43" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2SA 19" />
  <chapter number="20" style="c" sid="2SA 20" />
  <para style="s1">Sheba u yaꞋankai Dawuda ugbamukaci</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2SA 20:1" />A yaꞋan ta̱ vuza vu ugbamukaci vu yoku vuza kula Sheba, maku ma Bikiri vuza vu Bayami. U lika̱i kavana ɗa u ɗa̱ngusa̱i ka̱la̱ka̱tsu u danai,</para>
  <para style="b" vid="2SA 20:1" />
  <para style="q1" vid="2SA 20:1">&lt;&lt;Yiɗa̱i i burai tsu n Dawuda!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2SA 20:1">Ci n ili yi uka̱ni u kolobo ka Jesi ba!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2SA 20:1">Aza a Isaraila yaba dem u bono a kpaꞋa ku ni!&gt;&gt;<verse eid="2SA 20:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="2SA 20:2" />Ɗa aza a Isaraila ra̱ka̱ a̱ ka̱sukpa̱i Dawuda, ɗa a̱ ka̱na̱i kutono Sheba maku ma Bikiri. Ama aza a Yahuda a gbagai mogono me le, ɗa a walai koɓolo n a̱yi ili i na i ɗikai e Kuyene ku Urudu ali a kubana a Urushelima.<verse eid="2SA 20:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="2SA 20:3" />Ana Dawuda u bonoi e kefeku ko tsugono ka̱ ni a Urushelima, Ɗa u ɗikai a̱ma̱ci a gbani kupa ana u ka̱sukpa̱i a indaka yi kefeku ka. Ɗa u lyaꞋi kelime n ku nekele i na a cigai dem, ama u doku u vaku n ele ba. Ɗa u ka̱sukpa̱i le lo ali a kubana a kanna ku ukpa̱ ke le, ta a̱ ka̱na̱i ida̱shi i le nannai tsa agapa.<verse eid="2SA 20:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="2SA 20:4" />Ɗa mogono ma danai Amasa, &lt;&lt;Ɗekushekei mu aza a Yahuda a̱ ta̱wa̱ a̱ ka̱tsuma̱ ka a yin a tatsu, ka̱ta̱ avu feu vu ta̱wa̱ koɓolo n e le.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="2SA 20:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2SA 20:5" />Ama ana Amasa u banai adama a na u ɗeke aza a Yahuda, ɗa u lazai makyan ma na mogono ma zuwakai ni.<verse eid="2SA 20:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="2SA 20:6" />Ɗa Dawuda u danai Abishayi, &lt;&lt;Gogo na Sheba maku Bikiri wi ta̱ a̱ kurono ko tsu kadama ka na ka laꞋi ka Abusalom. Ɗika osoji a vuzagbayin a̱ nu ka̱ta̱ vu tono yi, nannai ɗa baci ba wi ta̱ a kuꞋuwa a̱ likuci yi ukanji ka̱ta̱ u laꞋaka.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="2SA 20:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2SA 20:7" />Ɗa uma a Jowabu koɓolo na aza a Keritiya, n aza a Pelatiya koɓolo osoji a na fuɗai kuvon ra̱ka̱ a̱ uta̱i a Urushelima n utsura u Abishayi, adama a na a kiyangu Sheba maku ma Bikiri.<verse eid="2SA 20:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="2SA 20:8" />Ana a yawai a katali kagbayin ka Gibiyon ɗa Amasa u gasai n e le. Jowabu wi ta̱ u uki n motogu mo tsusoji. Asuvu o motogu ma̱ ni ma wi ta̱ n kotokobi a iven i ni ushiyi n kaɗambura. Ana u doki u walai n kelime ɗa kotokobi ka ka̱ uta̱i a iven ya ka̱ yikpa̱i a iɗika.<verse eid="2SA 20:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="2SA 20:9" />Ɗa Jowabu u danai Amasa, &lt;&lt;Nini ɗai vi, vuza va̱?&gt;&gt; Ɗa Jowabu va u ka̱na̱i ntsa̱ka̱ n Amasa n kukiye ku sungai ku ni adanshi wi ta̱ o ku oɓongi. <verse eid="2SA 20:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2SA 20:10" />Ama a̱yi Amasa va u zuka n kotokobi ka na ki e kukiye ku gula̱ ku Jowabu va ba. Tsu nannai tsu ɗa Jowabu u sapai Amasa a̱ ka̱tsuma̱ ali ma̱la̱ki ma Amasa i yikpa̱i a iɗika. Ɗa Amasa u kuwa̱i lo n u sapai u te u na Jowabu u yaꞋankai ni va, ɗa Jowabu n vuza ni Abishayi a lyaꞋi kelime n kutono Sheba maku ma Bikiri.<verse eid="2SA 20:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="2SA 20:11" />A̱ ka̱tsuma̱ ko osoji a Jowabu ɗa vuza te u banai ɗevu n keve ki kyamba ka Amasa va ɗa u danai, &lt;&lt;Vuza na baci de dem wi a kuciga Jowabu, ɗa kpamu wi a kuciga Dawuda, u tono Jowabu.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="2SA 20:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2SA 20:12" />Amasa tana wi ta̱ lo ivaꞋin a mpasa n ni e mere ma uye. Kpamu vuza na baci de dem u yawai lo ka̱ta̱ u shamgba. Ana kosoji ka kenei tsu na uma a ci shamgba lo a̱ ubuta̱ u keve ki kyamba ka, ɗa u takpai lo kaꞋa u zuwai asuvu a̱ mita̱ ɗevu n uye, ɗa u palai kaꞋa n kakashi. <verse eid="2SA 20:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2SA 20:13" />Ana a takpai keven ki kyamba ka Amasa lo a uye wa, ɗa osoji ra̱ka̱ o tonoi Jowabu a kubana kula̱nsa̱ Sheba maku ma Bikiri.<verse eid="2SA 20:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="2SA 20:14" />Ele a̱ ka̱tsuma̱ ka̱ kula̱nsa̱ Sheba va, cina ɗe u tono kumaci ka aza Isaraila ra̱ka̱, a̱ kula̱nsa̱ uɓa̱nki wa̱ aza a̱ ni. Ɗa tana o ɓolongi ka̱ci ke le o tonoi ni a kubana a Ebelu vu Betu-maka n uɓon wi iɗika i Berita, <verse eid="2SA 20:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2SA 20:15" />Ɗa Jowabu n uma ra̱ka̱ a̱ ta̱wa̱i a kambuki Sheba a suvu a̱ likuci i Ebelu vu Betu-maka. O ɓolongi kayala a̱ ka̱ra̱ka̱i derere vu ugaɗi u mashilya ma, ɗa tamkpamu uma a yoku a̱ ka̱na̱i moloko ma na a̱ fa̱da̱ maꞋan a varuku. <verse eid="2SA 20:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2SA 20:16" />Ɗa vuka vu ugboji vu yoku u yaꞋin meɗevile punu a suvu a̱ likuci ya u danai, &lt;&lt;Panakai mu. Ka̱ta̱ i dana Jowabu, &lt;Ta̱wa̱ na, adama a na n ciga ta̱ n yaꞋan kadanshi n a̱yi.&gt; &gt;&gt; <verse eid="2SA 20:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2SA 20:17" />Ɗa Jowabu u banai ɗevu n vuka va, ɗa vuka va vu ecei ni, &lt;&lt;Avu ɗa Jowabu?&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2SA 20:17">Ɗa wushuki vuka va u danai,&lt;&lt;E, mpa ɗa.&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2SA 20:17">Ɗa vuka va vu danai, &lt;&lt;Pana ili i na kagbashi ka̱ nu ka kudansa.&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2SA 20:17">Ɗa Jowabu u danai, &lt;&lt;Mi ta̱ a kupanaka wu,&gt;&gt; <verse eid="2SA 20:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2SA 20:18" />Ɗa u lyaꞋi kelime n kadanshi u danai, &lt;&lt;M megeshe ma ɗe a tsu dansa ta̱, &lt;Banai i la̱nsa̱ odoki a singai a̱ likuci i Ebelu,&gt; ka̱ta̱ tana kadanshi ka ko kotso. <verse eid="2SA 20:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="2SA 20:19" />A̱tsu ɗa aza a ida̱shi i ma̱ta̱na̱ n usuɓi a Isaraila. Yiɗa̱i i zuwai ɗa vi a kuciga ku la̱nga̱sa̱ likuci ya? Vu ciga ta̱ vu la̱nga̱sa̱ ili i na yi i Vuzavaguɗu?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="2SA 20:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="2SA 20:20" />Ɗa Jowabu wu ushuki, &lt;&lt;Ka̱shile kejebeshe! Mpa mi a̱ kula̱nga̱sa̱ ko mu una likuci i nu ba. <verse eid="2SA 20:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="2SA 20:21" />I ɗaɗa n sheshei ba. Ama vuma vu yoku wi ta̱ lo kula ku ni ku ɗa Sheba maku ma Bikiri wu uta̱ ta̱ a uɓon u likuci ya aginda a i Ifirayimu, a̱yi ɗa vuza na u yaꞋankai mogono Dawuda ugbamukaci. Nekei mu a̱yi, Ka̱ta̱ mpa n ka̱sukpa̱ka̱ ɗa̱ likuci ya.&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2SA 20:21">Ɗa vuka va u danai Jowabu, &lt;&lt;Ci ta̱ a ku taɗuku ku wu n kaci ka̱ ni n tsu mashilya.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="2SA 20:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="2SA 20:22" />Ɗa tana vuka va u bonoi u yaꞋin kadanshi n uma a̱ likuci ya ra̱ka̱ n odoki a ugboji ni. Ɗa a gbatyai kaci ka Sheba maku ma Bikiri ɗa a taki kaꞋa Jowabu. Jowabu u lika̱i kavana ɗa osoji a a̱ ka̱sukpa̱ likuci ya. Ɗa yaba dem u bonoi a kpaꞋa ku ni, ɗa Jowabu tamkpamu u bonoi ubuta̱ u mogono a Urushelima.<verse eid="2SA 20:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="2SA 20:23" />Jowabu ɗa vuza vu kelime vo osoji a Isaraila ra̱ka̱. Benaya maku ma Jehoyida a̱yi ɗa vuza vu kelime vo osoji aza a kindi ku mogono Dawuda. <verse eid="2SA 20:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="2SA 20:24" />Adoramu ɗa vuza kelime vu ulinga wa̱ a̱ga̱nda̱, Jehoshafatu maku ma Ahiludu ɗa kaɗani ka ukuna u tsumani. <verse eid="2SA 20:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="2SA 20:25" />Shewa ɗa kaɗani, Zadoku koɓolo n Abiyata ele ɗa anan Ganu. <verse eid="2SA 20:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="2SA 20:26" />Ira vuza vu Jayiru wi ta̱ a̱ ka̱tsuma̱ ka anan Ganu vu Dawuda.<verse eid="2SA 20:26" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2SA 20" />
  <chapter number="21" style="c" sid="2SA 21" />
  <para style="s1">Dawuda u tsupukai aza a Gibiyon</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2SA 21:1" />Ayin ana Dawuda wi a kulyaꞋa tsugono, a yaꞋan ta̱ kambulu ali a̱ya̱ a tatsu. Ɗa Dawuda u yaꞋin avasa u Vuzavaguɗu adama a kambulu ka na ki a iɗika ya. Ɗa Vuzavaguɗu wu ushuki, u danai, &lt;&lt;Mpasa ma aza a Gibiyon mi ta̱ a kaci ka Shawulu m kpaꞋa ku ni, adama a na wu una le ta̱.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="2SA 21:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2SA 21:2" />Ɗa mogono me ɗekei aza a Gibiyon u danai le, a̱ɗa̱ aza a Isaraila a ɗa ba, ama a̱ɗa̱ kagimi ka aza a Amoriya kaꞋa. Ama n tsu cau ɗe aza a Isaraila a kucina ta̱ a ku una aza a Gibiyon ba, ama ɗa Shawulu u yaꞋin tsu na u kuyaꞋan adama a na wu una le ra̱ka̱, adama a ucigi u na wi n uɗa a kubana wa aza a Isaraila n aza a Yahuda. <verse eid="2SA 21:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2SA 21:3" />Ɗa Dawuda we ecei aza a Gibiyon, &lt;&lt;Yiɗa̱i n kuyaꞋanka ɗa̱? Nini ɗai n kulapula kagbanigbani ka na a yaꞋankai ɗa̱, adama a na i zuwaka uma a Vuzavaguɗu una̱singai, ili yi uka̱ni i ni?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="2SA 21:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="2SA 21:4" />Ɗa aza a Gibiyon ushuki i ni, &lt;&lt;Ukuna wa azanariya ko azurufa u ɗaɗa u kuzuwa tsu ida̱shi i ma̱ta̱na̱ n Shawulu m kpaꞋa ku ni ba. ko ukuna u ku una vuza te a̱ ka̱tsuma̱ ka aza a Isaraila ɗa ba.&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2SA 21:4">Ɗa Dawuda we ecei le, u danai, &lt;&lt;Yiɗa̱i i cigai n yaꞋan ka ɗa̱?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="2SA 21:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="2SA 21:5" />Ɗa aza a Gibiyon ushuki ni, &lt;&lt;Vuma vu na wu unai tsu va, ɗa kpamu u sheshei ku kotso n a̱ tsu ra̱ka̱, adama a na ka̱ta̱ tsu ciya̱ ubuta̱ punu a iɗika ya aza a Isaraila ba, <verse eid="2SA 21:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2SA 21:6" />neke tsu muku mo olobo n cindere n ni. Ci ta̱ a ku una le, ka̱ta̱ tsu saɓangu le a nɗanga a Gibiyon likuci i Shawulu, mogono ma na Vuzavaguɗu u zagbai.&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2SA 21:6">Ɗa mogono ma danai, &lt;&lt;Mi ta̱ e kuneke le ekiye a̱ ɗa̱.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="2SA 21:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="2SA 21:7" />Ama adama a kucina a na Dawuda n Janata maku ma Shawulu a yaꞋin e kelime ka Vuzavaguɗu, wu ushuku u neke le Mefiboshetu maku ma Janata vashi vu Shawulu ba. <verse eid="2SA 21:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2SA 21:8" />Ɗa mogono ma ɗikai Aromoni m Mefiboshetu muku mo olobo nre n na Rizafa mekere ma Ayiya u matsakai Shawulu, koɓolo n muku molobo n tawun n Merabu mekere ma Shawulu, n na u matsakai Adiriyelu maku ma Bazila vuza vu Mehola. <verse eid="2SA 21:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2SA 21:9" />Ɗa Dawuda u nekei le wa aza a Gibiyon, ɗa unai le ra̱ka̱ ɗa a kiyangi even ikyamba e le gaɗi vu n nɗanga ɗe a kaginda e kelime ka Vuzavaguɗu. Ra̱ka̱ vu le uma e cindere a a̱ kuwa̱i koɓolo. A una le ta̱ a makyan ma na a̱ gita̱i vikyaꞋa vu bali.<verse eid="2SA 21:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="2SA 21:10" />Ɗa Rizafa mekere ma Ayiya, u la̱nsa̱i akashi a kpalu ɗa u banai u polokoi kaci ka̱ ni aɗa gaɗi vu kakpanlai. Ɗa u da̱sa̱ngi lo a ubuta̱ wa ali ugiti u vikyaꞋa a kubana a makyan ma na lyushi bonoi ɗa mini ma̱ ciya̱i even ikyamba a. N kanna u tsu loko ta̱ nnu ɗe ubuta̱ we even ikyamba ya, n kayi tamkpamu u tsu loko ta̱ n nama n kakamba a̱ ubuta̱ wa. <verse eid="2SA 21:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2SA 21:11" />Ana a danai Dawuda ili i na Rizafa vuka vu gbani vu Shawulu mekere ma Ayiya u yaꞋin, <verse eid="2SA 21:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2SA 21:12" />ɗa Dawuda u banai u ɗikai etele a Shawulu koɓolo n a maku ma̱ ni Janata, a kumaci ka aza a Jabeshi vu Giliyadu. Ele vu na o bokoi even a ikyamba a e keteshe ka̱ likuci i Betu-shan a̱ ubuta̱ u na aza a Filisitiya ishi a saki a ɗa gaɗi vu nɗanga, a kanna ka na a unai Shawulu a Gilibowa. <verse eid="2SA 21:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2SA 21:13" />Ɗa Dawuda u pura̱i etele a Shawulu n a maku ma̱ ni Janata, n etele a uma e cindere a na a unai va ɗa a saki.<verse eid="2SA 21:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="2SA 21:14" />Ɗa a̱ ciɗa̱ngi etele a Shawulu n a maku ma̱ ni Janata a kasaun ka esheku a̱ ni Kishu, asuvu a̱ likuci i Zela a iɗika i Bayami. Ɗa a yaꞋin ili ra̱ka̱ i na mogono ma danai. Ana a yaꞋin nannai ɗa Ka̱shile ka̱ ushuki avasa e le adama a iɗika ya.<verse eid="2SA 21:14" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Kuvon n aza a Filisitiya</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="1CH 20:4-8">1 Ar 20:4-8</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="2SA 21:15" />Ana i lo ida̱shi ɗa vishili vu doki vu ɗa̱nga̱i a̱ ka̱tsuma̱ ka aza a Filisitiya n aza a Isaraila. Ɗa Dawuda koɓolo n uma a̱ ni a banai a̱ yaꞋin kuvon n aza a Filisitiya, ɗa woꞋwi ka̱u. <verse eid="2SA 21:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2SA 21:16" />Ɗa vuza vi yoku kasagbada vuza na e ci ɗeke Ishibibenobu vuza te a̱ ka̱tsuma̱ ka ntsukaya n Rafa u sheshei wi ta̱ a kufuɗa ku una Dawuda. A̱yi na a̱miki a kaci ka masara ma̱ ni a yawai shekelu amangatawantatsu (300), n kotokobi ka savu, adama a na wu una Dawuda. <verse eid="2SA 21:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2SA 21:17" />Ama ɗa Abishayi maku ma Zeruya ma̱ ɓa̱nka̱i Dawuda. Ɗa u lapai vuza va aza a a Filisitiya va wu unai. Ɗa osoji a Dawuda a kucinai a danai ni, &lt;&lt;Wi o kudoku kutono tsu a kubana kuvon ba, adama a na wu a̱ nu u ɗa aza a Isaraila e keɗei a̱pa̱Ꞌa̱.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="2SA 21:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="2SA 21:18" />Ana kanampa ko kotsoi ɗa o doku a yaꞋin vishili n aza a Filisitiya ɗe o Gobu. A̱ ka̱tsuma̱ ka̱ vishili va ɗa Sibekayi vuza vu Husha wu unai vuza vu utsura vu na e ci ɗeke Safa.<verse eid="2SA 21:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="2SA 21:19" />Ɗa o doku a yaꞋin kuvon n aza a Filisitiya ɗe o Gobu. Ɗa Elihana maku ma Jayiru vuza vu Batalami wu unai toku vu Goliya vuza vu Gatu, vuza na kakutsu ka masara ma̱ ni ka yawai mgbayin m mashin.<verse eid="2SA 21:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="2SA 21:20" />Ɗa o doku a yaꞋin kuvon ɗe a Gatu, ɗe va kpamu vuma vu yoku wi ta̱ lo kasagbada n a̱jivu a̱ta̱li e kukiye dem, koɓolo n a̱jivu a̱ta̱li e kune dem, ra̱ka̱ va a̱jivu a̱ ni kamanga n a̱shi. A̱yi feu wi ta̱ a̱ ka̱tsuma̱ ka kumaci ka aza a Rafa. <verse eid="2SA 21:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="2SA 21:21" />Ana u goyoi aza a Isaraila, ɗa Janata maku ma Shimeya toku vu Dawuda wu unai ni.<verse eid="2SA 21:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="2SA 21:22" />Uma a̱na̱shi a nanlo dem i ta̱ a̱ ka̱tsuma̱ ka kumaci ka aza a Rafa a Gatu. Ɗa Dawuda koɓolon m uma a̱ ni unai le.<verse eid="2SA 21:22" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2SA 21" />
  <chapter number="22" style="c" sid="2SA 22" />
  <para style="s1">Vishipa vu Dawuda adama a kucikpa Vuzavaguɗu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="PSA 18:1-50">Ishp 18:1-50</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2SA 22:1" />A kanna ka na Vuzavaguɗu wu isai Dawuda e kukiye ku Shawulu n irala i na i buwai dem, ɗa Dawuda u yaꞋin vishipa vu nampa u Vuzavaguɗu. U danai,<verse eid="2SA 22:1" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="2SA 22:2" />&lt;&lt;Vuzavaguɗu, katali ke kusheɗeku ka̱ va̱,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2SA 22:2">mashilya ma̱ va̱ n kishi ka̱ va̱,<verse eid="2SA 22:2" /></para>
  <para style="q2">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="2SA 22:3" />Ka̱shile ka̱ va̱, ubuta̱ Kusheɗeku ka̱ va̱,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2SA 22:3">wa̱ a̱ nu ɗa n tsu sheɗeku.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2SA 22:3">Ma̱ra̱ga̱ ma̱ va̱, n utsura u wishi u va̱,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2SA 22:3">mashilya ma̱ va̱, n ubuta̱ u kusheɗeku u va̱,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2SA 22:3">kishi ka̱ va̱, vu isai mu a̱ ubuta̱ u vishili.<verse eid="2SA 22:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="2SA 22:4" />N tsu ɗeke ta̱ Vuzavaguɗu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2SA 22:4">a̱yi na u yotsoi kucikpa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2SA 22:4">kpamu u tsu wawa mu ta̱ ekiye a irala i va̱.<verse eid="2SA 22:4" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="2SA 22:5" />&lt;&lt;Mayu a aɓau a munuka a pala mu ta̱,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2SA 22:5">wayi u mala u laꞋa ta̱ utsura u va̱.<verse eid="2SA 22:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="2SA 22:6" />Kasaun ka shiya mu ta̱ n awin a̱ ni,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2SA 22:6">ukpa̱ u zuwaka mu ta̱ maza.<verse eid="2SA 22:6" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="2SA 22:7" />&lt;&lt;A makyan ma na mi a una̱mgbi u ka̱tsuma̱ n tsu ɗekushe ta̱ Vuzavaguɗu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2SA 22:7">ɗa kpamu n ɗekushi Ka̱shile ka̱ va̱.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2SA 22:7">Ɗe a̱Ꞌisa̱ a̱ ni u panai ka̱la̱ka̱tsu ka̱ va̱,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2SA 22:7">ɗa kpamu ma̱shi ma̱ va̱ ma yawai atsuvu a̱ ni.<verse eid="2SA 22:7" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="2SA 22:8" />&lt;&lt;Aduniyan a̱ gba̱ɗa̱i,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2SA 22:8">ɗa kumiꞋi ku zuva ku jeꞋi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2SA 22:8">adama a na wi ta̱ a wupa.<verse eid="2SA 22:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="2SA 22:9" />Ka̱nga̱ ka̱ ka̱na̱i ku uta̱ a̱ vunu vi ni,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2SA 22:9">melentsu ma akina, n a̱ga̱ruwa̱shi a̱ ku uta̱ a̱ una̱ u ni.<verse eid="2SA 22:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="2SA 22:10" />Ɗa u ɓa̱yuwa̱i gaɗi u cipa̱i a iɗika,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2SA 22:10">eleshu a̱ lima̱ ka̱u a ɗaka vu ene a̱ ni.<verse eid="2SA 22:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="2SA 22:11" />Ɗa u kumbai Corobi ɗa u imkpai zuva,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2SA 22:11">a gaɗi ve evelyu a ɗa enei ni tsu manunu.<verse eid="2SA 22:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="2SA 22:12" />U bonokoi ka̱yimbi ko okpoi kapalatsu ka̱ ni,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2SA 22:12">n eleshu a̱ lima̱ ka̱u a na a̱ tsu tuka̱ m mini.<verse eid="2SA 22:12" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="2SA 22:13" />Ɗa ulaɗi u gbayin wu akanai ni,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2SA 22:13">ɗa kpamu a̱ga̱ruwa̱shi uta̱i wu a̱ ni.<verse eid="2SA 22:13" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="2SA 22:14" />Vuzavaguɗu u lapai ɗe kakpanga gaɗi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2SA 22:14">ɗa a panai ka̱la̱ka̱tsu ka MalaꞋimili.<verse eid="2SA 22:14" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="2SA 22:15" />U tawai ayaꞋa a̱ ni u wacuwai irala,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2SA 22:15">ɗa u suꞋuki le n ulaɗi, ɗa u lokoi le.<verse eid="2SA 22:15" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="2SA 22:16" />Uɓarangi u Vuzavaguɗu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2SA 22:16">n utsura wa ayinviki a̱ vunu vi ni,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2SA 22:16">ɗa a̱ ɓa̱yuwa̱i a̱shi a mala,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2SA 22:16">ɗa kumiꞋi ka aduniyan ku okpoi e keteshe.<verse eid="2SA 22:16" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="2SA 22:17" />&lt;&lt;Ɗe gaɗi Vuzavaguɗu u ba̱rukpa̱i kukiye ku ni ɗa u ɗikai mu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2SA 22:17">a̱ ubuta̱ u mini mu uga̱vi ɗa wu utuka̱i mu.<verse eid="2SA 22:17" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="2SA 22:18" />Ɗa wi isai mu a̱ ubuta̱ wi irala i va̱ aza a utsura,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2SA 22:18">a̱ ubuta̱ wa aza na a iwain mu, adama a na a laꞋa mu ta̱ utsura.<verse eid="2SA 22:18" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="2SA 22:19" />A̱ gba̱nga̱ra̱ngi mu a kanna ka atakaci ka̱ va̱,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2SA 22:19">ama ɗa Vuzavaguɗu u ɓa̱nka̱i mu.<verse eid="2SA 22:19" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="2SA 22:20" />Ɗa u tuka̱i mu a̱ ubuta̱ u na wi isai mu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2SA 22:20">ɗa kpamu wu isai mu adama a na wi ta̱ a kupana uyoꞋo uva̱.<verse eid="2SA 22:20" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="2SA 22:21" />&lt;&lt;Vuzavaguɗu u tsupa mu ta̱ adama a usuɓi u va̱,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2SA 22:21">ɗa u zuwakai mu una̱singai adama a na mi n unushi ba.<verse eid="2SA 22:21" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="2SA 22:22" />Adama a na n tono ta̱ uye u Vuzavaguɗu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2SA 22:22">n ka̱sukpa̱ uye u Ka̱shile ka̱ va̱ ɗa n yaꞋin ka gbani-gbani ba.<verse eid="2SA 22:22" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="2SA 22:23" />N tono ta̱ wila̱ u ni ra̱ka̱,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2SA 22:23">n kpa̱ɗa̱ kutono ili i na u dansai ba.<verse eid="2SA 22:23" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="2SA 22:24" />Ɗa mo okpoi vuza vu babu unushi a̱ ubuta̱ ni.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2SA 22:24">Ɗa kpamu me erei ka̱ci ka̱ va̱ a̱ ubuta̱ u kuyaꞋan unushi.<verse eid="2SA 22:24" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="2SA 22:25" />Vuzavaguɗu u neke mu ta̱ katsupa mu ta̱ adama a usuɓi u va̱,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2SA 22:25">adama a na mi nu unushi a̱ a̱shi a̱ ni ba.<verse eid="2SA 22:25" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="2SA 22:26" />&lt;&lt;Vuzavaguɗu avu vuza vu uneki u ka̱ɗu ɗa, wa aza a na e nekei u a̱ɗu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2SA 22:26">vuza vu ma̱riki ɗa kpamu wa aza a̱ ma̱riki,<verse eid="2SA 22:26" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="2SA 22:27" />Wa aza a ciɗa, vu tsu yotsongu ta̱ ka̱ci ka̱ nu vi ta̱ ciɗa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2SA 22:27">ama wa aza a gbani-gbani vu tsu yotsongu ta̱ ka̱ci ka̱ nu an vu laꞋi le.<verse eid="2SA 22:27" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="2SA 22:28" />Vu ci isa ta̱ aza a na o goyoi ka̱ci ka le,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2SA 22:28">ama vu tsu goyo ta̱ aza a̱ra̱ɗi.<verse eid="2SA 22:28" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="2SA 22:29" />Vuzavaguɗu, avu ɗa kutashi ku va̱,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2SA 22:29">avu ɗa vu lokoi ka̱yimbi ka̱ va̱.<verse eid="2SA 22:29" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="2SA 22:30" />N utsura u nu mi ta̱ a ku una ka̱tsura̱ ko osoji,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2SA 22:30">n utsura u Ka̱shile ka̱ va̱ mi ta̱ a kupasa mashilya dem.<verse eid="2SA 22:30" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="2SA 22:31" />Uye u Ka̱shile wi ta̱ derere!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2SA 22:31">Kadanshi ka Vuzavaguɗu mayun ɗa.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2SA 22:31">Wi ta̱ tsu ma̱ra̱ga̱,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2SA 22:31">a u vuza na dem u la̱nsa̱i ubuta̱ u kusheɗeku wa̱ a̱ ni.<verse eid="2SA 22:31" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="2SA 22:32" />&lt;&lt;Vuzavaguɗu a̱yi ɗa Ka̱shile koci,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2SA 22:32">Ka̱shile kaꞋa koci ubuta̱ u kusheɗeku u tsu.<verse eid="2SA 22:32" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="2SA 22:33" />Ka̱shile kaꞋa vuza na u tsu neke mu utsura,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2SA 22:33">u tsu zuwa ta̱ kpamu uye u va̱ wo okpo derere.<verse eid="2SA 22:33" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="2SA 22:34" />Ana n walai a gaɗi vu n sansan,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2SA 22:34">ɗa n walai mayin babu ma̱ta̱ɗa̱ tsu na mesheun ma tsu suma.<verse eid="2SA 22:34" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="2SA 22:35" />Ɗa kpamu u gbarai e kiye a̱ va̱ adama a kuvon,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2SA 22:35">ciya̱ n fuɗa n ka̱nza̱ utan u vuyum vishili.<verse eid="2SA 22:35" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="2SA 22:36" />Vuzavaguɗu vu ere mu ta̱, ɗa vu isai mu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2SA 22:36">uɓa̱nki u nu u zuwa mu ta̱ mo okpoi vuzagbayin. <verse eid="2SA 22:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="2SA 22:37" />Ɗa vu zuwai mu a uye u singai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2SA 22:37">n saꞋwa kpamu kuyikpa̱ ba.<verse eid="2SA 22:37" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="2SA 22:38" />Ɗa n guvai irala i va̱ n lyaꞋi le,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2SA 22:38">n shamgba ba sai na mu unai le ra̱ka̱.<verse eid="2SA 22:38" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="2SA 22:39" />Ɗa n lapai le ali a iɗika, a fuɗa a̱ ɗa̱nga̱ ba,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2SA 22:39">a̱ yikpa̱i a ɗaka vu ene a̱ va̱.<verse eid="2SA 22:39" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="2SA 22:40" />Vu neke mu ta̱ utsura adama o kuvon,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2SA 22:40">ɗa vu zuwai irala i va̱ a ɗaka vu ene a̱ va̱.<verse eid="2SA 22:40" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="2SA 22:41" />Vu zuwai irala i va̱ a kpatalai a sumai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2SA 22:41">ɗa mu unai aza a na a iwain mu.<verse eid="2SA 22:41" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="2SA 22:42" />Ɗa a̱ la̱nsa̱i uɓa̱nki, ama babu vuza na wa ku isa le,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2SA 22:42">ɗa e ɗekushei Vuzavaguɗu, ama ɗa u iwain ku ushuku le.<verse eid="2SA 22:42" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="2SA 22:43" />Ɗa n lapai le luɓa̱ luɓa̱ ali okpoi tsu kubuta̱,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2SA 22:43">n dasai le uteku tsu kolyoꞋo ka uye.<verse eid="2SA 22:43" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="2SA 22:44" />&lt;&lt;Vu isai mu e ekiye a uma a̱ va̱ aza a ugbamukaci,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2SA 22:44">ɗa vu zuwai mu mo okpoi vuza kelime ku uduniyan,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2SA 22:44">aza a na n yevei ba, ɗa okpoi aza a ulinga a̱ va̱.<verse eid="2SA 22:44" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="2SA 22:45" />Ɗa omoci a̱ ka̱na̱i kuta̱wa̱ n a̱ kuɗa̱nki mu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2SA 22:45">ɗa baci de a panai ukuna u va̱ o tsu tono mu ta̱.<verse eid="2SA 22:45" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="2SA 22:46" />A̱ɗu e le a̱ gusa̱i</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2SA 22:46">ɗa uta̱i a̱ ubuta̱ u na ishi usheɗeki a̱ ta̱wa̱i n kujeꞋe ki ikyamba.<verse eid="2SA 22:46" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="47" style="v" sid="2SA 22:47" />&lt;&lt;Vuzavaguɗu wi ta̱ n wuma. Ucikpi a kubana a katali ke kusheɗeku ka̱ va̱.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2SA 22:47">Ucikpi a kubana u Ka̱shile ka̱ va̱, katali ka wishi ka̱ va̱.<verse eid="2SA 22:47" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="48" style="v" sid="2SA 22:48" />A̱yi ɗa Ka̱shile ka na ka kutsupaka mu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2SA 22:48">vuza na u zuwai kumaci ku uduniyan ɗaka vu va̱,<verse eid="2SA 22:48" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="2SA 22:49" />u tsu isa mu ta̱ a̱ ubuta̱ wa aza a na i a kuꞋiwan mu.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2SA 22:49">U tsu neke mu ta̱ tsugbayin wa aza a na i a tsurala nu mpa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2SA 22:49">u tsu isa mu ta̱ a̱ ubuta̱ wa aza a a̱ɗu a̱ vishili.<verse eid="2SA 22:49" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="2SA 22:50" />&lt;&lt;Adama a nannai Vuzavaguɗu, mi ta̱ a kucikpa wu a̱ ka̱tsuma̱ ku uduniyan,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2SA 22:50">mi ta̱ a kuyaꞋan ishipa i kucikpa kula ku nu.<verse eid="2SA 22:50" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="51" style="v" sid="2SA 22:51" />U neke ta̱ ulyaꞋi u gbayin u mogono ma na u zagbai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2SA 22:51">ɗa kpamu u yotsongi ucigi u na u tsu sabaꞋa ba u mazagbi ma̱ ni,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2SA 22:51">u Dawuda nu ntsukaya n ni ali ayin babu uteku.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="2SA 22:51" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2SA 22" />
  <chapter number="23" style="c" sid="2SA 23" />
  <para style="s1">Kadanshi ka Dawuda ku ukocishi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2SA 23:1" />Na ɗa kadanshi ka Dawuda ku ukocishi.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2SA 23:1">Kadanshi ka Dawuda maku ma Jesi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2SA 23:1">Kadanshi ka vuza na MalaꞋimili ma cikpai,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2SA 23:1">vuza na Ka̱shile ka Yakubu ka zagbai mogono</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2SA 23:1">vuma vi Isaraila kayaꞋin ki ishipa i singai.<verse eid="2SA 23:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="2SA 23:2" />&lt;&lt;Ayinviki a Vuzavaguɗu a yaꞋan ta̱ kadanshi a̱ una̱ u va̱,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2SA 23:2">Kadanshi ka̱ ni ki ta̱ e kelentsu ka̱ va̱.<verse eid="2SA 23:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="2SA 23:3" />Ka̱shile ka aza a Isaraila ka yaꞋan ta̱ kadanshi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2SA 23:3">Ubuta̱ u kusheɗeku wa aza a Isaraila u dana mu ta̱,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2SA 23:3">Vuza wi baci a kulyaꞋa tsugono tsu usuɓi a uma a̱ ni,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2SA 23:3">ɗa kpamu wi a kulyaꞋa tsu ɗa n wovon u Ka̱shile,<verse eid="2SA 23:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="2SA 23:4" />wi ta̱ tsu kutashi ku usana,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2SA 23:4">n tsu kanna ku usana ka na ka̱ uta̱i babu keleshu ka na ka palai kaꞋa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2SA 23:4">n tsu kutashi a makyan ma na u kotsoi kuyoꞋo mini, ku na ku tsu zuwa mi ta̱ ma̱ uta̱ a iɗika.<verse eid="2SA 23:4" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="2SA 23:5" />&lt;&lt;Ta Ka̱shile ka kuzuwaka ntsukaya n va̱ una̱singai nannai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2SA 23:5">adama a na u yaꞋanka mu ta̱ uzuwakpani u kowanai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2SA 23:5">kpamu wi ta̱ u foɓushi u tono u ɗa,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2SA 23:5">i ɗaɗa i na n cigai, ɗaɗa ulyaꞋi u va̱,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2SA 23:5">n yeve ta̱ mayun Ka̱shile ki ta̱ a kuzuwa ili ya yo okpo nannai.<verse eid="2SA 23:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="2SA 23:6" />Ama uma a gbani-gbani ra̱ka̱ i ta̱ tsa awana a na a variki,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2SA 23:6">i kuɗika n ekiye ba.<verse eid="2SA 23:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="2SA 23:7" />Ama vuza na baci u ku saꞋwa le</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2SA 23:7">u yaꞋan ulinga m viyum ko ukutsu u masara,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2SA 23:7">i ta̱ o kusongu le gbende.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="2SA 23:7" /></para>
  <para style="s1">A fuɗi o kuvon a Dawuda</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="1CH 11:10-19">1 Ar 11:10-19</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="2SA 23:8" />Na ɗa ula osoji a Dawuda a na a laꞋi n kufuɗa kuvon. Vuza vu ugiti a̱yi ɗa Joshebu-bashebetu vuza vu Takemon, e yeve yi ta̱ kpamu n kula Adini-izini. A̱yi ɗa vuza vu kelime vo osoji a tatsu a. U saꞋwa ta̱ kuɗika masara ma̱ ni wu unai uma amangatawunkunla̱i (800) a makyan me te.<verse eid="2SA 23:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="2SA 23:9" />Vuza ire a̱ ka̱tsuma̱ ka osoji a tatsu a, a̱yi ɗa Eliyaza maku ma Dodayi a kumaci ku Ahohi. Eliyaza wi ta̱ koɓolo n Dawuda a makyan ma na o goyoi aza a Filisitiya wana ɗai o ɓolongu a̱ ubuta̱ u kuvon. A makyan ma na aza a Isaraila a sumai. <verse eid="2SA 23:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2SA 23:10" />Ɗa a̱yi u shamgbai u shilika̱i na aza a Filisitiya a ali kukiye ku ni ku oꞋoi, ali kotokobi ka paɗai e kukiye ku ni. Vuzavaguɗu u nekei ni ulyaꞋi u gbayin a kanna ka nanlo ka. Osoji a na ishi a sumai ɗa a kpatalai o bonoi a̱ ubuta̱ u kuvon wa, adama a na a̱ pura̱ ucanuku wa aza a na a unai.<verse eid="2SA 23:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="2SA 23:11" />Vuza tatsu vu le a̱yi ɗa Shama maku ma Agi vuza vu Harara. Kanna ke te ana aza a Filisitiya o ɓolongi adama a na a yaꞋan kuvon ɗevu n kashina ka awaya, ɗa osoji a Isaraila a sumai. <verse eid="2SA 23:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2SA 23:12" />Ama ɗa Shama u shamgbai e mere ma kashina ma wu isai kaꞋa, ɗa wu unai aza a Filisitiya. Ɗa Vuzavaguɗu u nekei ni ulyaꞋi u gbayin.<verse eid="2SA 23:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="2SA 23:13" />Kanna ko yoku a ayin a vukyaꞋa, ɗa osoji a tatsu a na laꞋi n kufuɗa kuvon a̱ ka̱tsuma̱ ko osoji kamangankupa a banai u Dawuda a kaɓatsu ka Adulam. Cina ɗe ka̱tsura̱ ko osoji ka aza a Filisitiya a̱ shikpa̱ a̱pa̱m le a̱ ka̱ra̱Ꞌa̱ ka Refimu. <verse eid="2SA 23:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2SA 23:14" />A makyan ma nanlo Dawuda wi ta̱ ɗe a̱ ubuta̱ u na u tsu sheɗeku. Ka̱tsura̱ ko osoji o yoku ka aza a Filisitiya ɗe a Batalami. <verse eid="2SA 23:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2SA 23:15" />Ɗa kakuli ka̱ ka̱na̱i Dawuda, u danai, &lt;&lt;Ishi baci n kuciya̱ vuza na u ku kenuku mu mini a kayinva ka na ki na ɗe a̱ utsutsu u likuci i Batalami.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="2SA 23:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2SA 23:16" />Ɗa osoji a utsura uma a tatsu aza a na a fuɗai kuvon ka a uwai punu asuvu a̱ ka̱tsura̱ ko osoji a aza a Filisitiya. E keneki mini a kayinva ka na ki a̱ utsutsu u likuci wa. Ɗa a̱ tuka̱i Dawuda, ama ɗa u iwain kusoꞋo. Ɗa u kucikpa u va̱ma̱i maꞋa a iɗika tsa alyuka u Vuzavaguɗu. <verse eid="2SA 23:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2SA 23:17" />Ɗa u danai, &lt;&lt;Vuzavaguɗu u jebeshe ke mu n soꞋo mini ma nanlo. Wi ta̱ o kokpo mu uteku tsu mpasa ma aza a na e nekei wuma u le adama a na e kenuku mini ma.&gt;&gt;Adama nannai, ɗa Dawuda u iwain kusoꞋo maꞋa.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2SA 23:17">Na lo ɗa ili i na osoji a tatsu a na a laꞋi n kufuɗa kuvon a yaꞋin.<verse eid="2SA 23:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="2SA 23:18" />Abishayi toku vu Jowabu maku ma Zeruya a̱yi ɗa vuza kelime vo osoji a tatsu a na a laꞋi n kufuɗa kuvon ka, u ɗikai masara ma̱ ni ɗa wu unai osoji amangatawantatsu (300). Ɗa u yaꞋin kula a̱ ka̱tsuma̱ ko osoji. <verse eid="2SA 23:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="2SA 23:19" />Ɗa u ciya̱i tsugbayin u laꞋi kamangankupa va. Ɗa wo okpoi vuza kelime vu le, ko n tsu nannai u yawa aza a tatsu a nan ɗe a ba.<verse eid="2SA 23:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="2SA 23:20" />Benaya maku ma Jehoyida, vuma ɗa vuza a na u fuɗai kuvon vuza vu Kabuzeyelu, u yaꞋan ta̱ ili mereve. Wu una ta̱ aza a utsura a Mowabu e re aza a na tsu yaꞋan kuvon tsu kawu. Kanna ke te a ayin a uta̱ni ka̱u, ɗa u banai wu unai kawu a kaɓatsu. <verse eid="2SA 23:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="2SA 23:21" />Ɗa kpamu wu unai vuza va aza a Masar vu gbangam. Vuza na wi uka̱ni m masara e kukiye ku ni. Ama a̱yi Benaya wi ta̱ uka̱ni n kalangu, ɗa wi isai masara ma na mi e kukiye ku vuza va aza a Masar va, ɗa wu unai ni m maꞋa. <verse eid="2SA 23:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="2SA 23:22" />Ili i nanlo i ɗa Benaya maku ma Jehoyida u yaꞋin ali ɗa u yaꞋin kula uteku tsu osoji a utsura a tatsu a nanlo a. <verse eid="2SA 23:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="2SA 23:23" />Ɗa u ciya̱i tsugbayin u laꞋi uma kamangankupa a nanlo a, ama u yawa osoji a tatsu a nanlo ba. Ɗa Dawuda u zuwai ni wo okpo vuza kelime vo osoji aza a kindi a̱ ni. <verse eid="2SA 23:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="2SA 23:24" />Ele na va i ta̱ punu a̱ ka̱tsuma̱ ko osoji kamangankupa a Dawuda aza a na a fuɗai kuvon.</para>
  <para style="b" vid="2SA 23:24" />
  <para style="li1" vid="2SA 23:24">Asahelu toku vu Jowabu,</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="2SA 23:24">Elihana maku ma Dodayi vuza vu Batalami.<verse eid="2SA 23:24" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="2SA 23:25" />Shama n Elika aza a Harodu,<verse eid="2SA 23:25" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="2SA 23:26" />Helezu vuza vu Paliti,</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="2SA 23:26">Ira maku ma Ikesha vuza vu Tekowa,<verse eid="2SA 23:26" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="2SA 23:27" />Abiyeza vuza vu Anatotu,</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="2SA 23:27">Mebuna vuza vu Husha,<verse eid="2SA 23:27" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="2SA 23:28" />Zalimonu vuza vu Ahohi,</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="2SA 23:28">Mahara vuza vu Netofa,<verse eid="2SA 23:28" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="2SA 23:29" />Helebu maku ma BaꞋana vuza vu Netofa,</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="2SA 23:29">Itayi maku ma Rabai vuza vu Gibeya vu uɓon u kumaci ku Bayami,<verse eid="2SA 23:29" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="2SA 23:30" />Benaya vuza vu Piraton</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="2SA 23:30">Hidayi vuza vu a̱ra̱Ꞌa̱ a na i ɗevu n Gashi,<verse eid="2SA 23:30" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="2SA 23:31" />Abi-albonu vuza vu Araba,</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="2SA 23:31">Azamavetu vuza vu Bahurim,<verse eid="2SA 23:31" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="2SA 23:32" />Eliyabu vuza vu ShaꞋalbonu,</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="2SA 23:32">muku n Jashen,<verse eid="2SA 23:32" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="2SA 23:33" />Janata maku ma Shama vuza vu Harara,</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="2SA 23:33">Ahiyam maku ma Shara vuza vu Harara,<verse eid="2SA 23:33" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="2SA 23:34" />Elifeletu maku ma Ahasaba vuza vu Makatu,</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="2SA 23:34">Eliyamu maku ma Ahitofelu vuza vu Gilo,<verse eid="2SA 23:34" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="2SA 23:35" />Heziro vuza vu Kamelu,</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="2SA 23:35">Para vuza vu Araba,<verse eid="2SA 23:35" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="2SA 23:36" />Igalu maku ma Natan vuza vu Zoba,</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="2SA 23:36">Bani vuza vu Gatu,<verse eid="2SA 23:36" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="2SA 23:37" />Zeleku vuza vu Amona,</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="2SA 23:37">Naharayi vuza vu Beyerotu,</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="2SA 23:37">vuza na u tsu ɗikaka Jowabu maku ma Zeruya ucanuku u kuvon,<verse eid="2SA 23:37" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="2SA 23:38" />Ira n Garebu uma Itiriti,<verse eid="2SA 23:38" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="2SA 23:39" />Uriya vuza vu Hitiya.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2SA 23:39">Na va ele ɗa osoji kamangankupa n e cindere a na a laꞋi n kufuɗa kuvon.<verse eid="2SA 23:39" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2SA 23" />
  <chapter number="24" style="c" sid="2SA 24" />
  <para style="s1">Dawuda u kecei uma a̱ ni</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="1CH 21:1-27">1 Ar 21:1-27</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2SA 24:1" />Ɗa Vuzavaguɗu u doku u yaꞋain wupa ka̱u n aza a Isaraila, ɗa u kushangi Dawuda u danai, &lt;&lt;Bana vu kece uma aza Isaraila koɓolo n aza a Yahuda.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="2SA 24:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2SA 24:2" />Ɗa mogono ma danai Jowabu kovonshi vo osoji a̱ ni, &lt;&lt;Banai i kece kumaci ka aza a Isaraila ra̱ka̱, i na i ɗikai a kumaci ku Dan n uɓon u gaɗi ali a kubana a uɓon u ɗakai u Beyersheba adama a na n yeve uma a yaꞋin a ɗa i.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="2SA 24:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="2SA 24:3" />Ama ɗa Jowabu u danai mogono, &lt;&lt;YaꞋan Vuzavaguɗu Ka̱shile ka̱ nu ka doku ka̱bunda̱i ka uma a̱ nu ali amangatawun a laꞋa tsu na ishi, Ali vuzagbayin va̱ mogono wu ene n a̱shi a̱ ni. Ama yiɗa̱i i zuwai ɗa vuzagbayin va̱ mogono vu cigai kuyaꞋan ili i nampa?&gt;&gt; <verse eid="2SA 24:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2SA 24:4" />Ɗa mogono ma gutsakai Jowabu koɓolo n ovonshi o osoji, ɗa a̱ ka̱sukpa̱i ubuta̱ u na mogono mi adama a na a bana e kece uma a Isaraila. <verse eid="2SA 24:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2SA 24:5" />Ana a pasai Kuyene ku Urudu, ɗa a vaki ɗevu n likuci i Arowa e mere ma ka̱ra̱Ꞌa̱, ɗa o tonokoi n uɓon u likuci i Gadu a kubana Jaza. <verse eid="2SA 24:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2SA 24:6" />Ɗa o doku a lazai a kubana a̱ likuci i Giliyadu vuna vi a iɗika i Tatim vu Hoshi, ɗa o tonokoi n uɓon u Dan-jan a̱ ka̱ra̱Ꞌi a kubana a Sidon. <verse eid="2SA 24:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2SA 24:7" />Ɗa o tonoi a kubana a uɓon u ɗakai u likuci i Taya i na yi nu nshilya. Ɗa o tonoi n likuci ya aza a Hiviya n aza a KanaꞋana. Ɗa a ukocishi a banai a Biyasheba Negebu vu Yahuda. <verse eid="2SA 24:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2SA 24:8" />Ana o kotsoi ku ka̱ra̱Ꞌa̱ iɗika ya ra̱ka̱, ɗa o bonoi a Urushelima wana ɗai wotoi kuci n ayin kamanga a laza. <verse eid="2SA 24:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2SA 24:9" />Ɗa Jowabu u bonoi u danai mogono ka̱bunda̱i ka ali ka na ka yawai ku uwa tsu soji. Aza a a iɗika yi Isaraila a yawa ta̱ a̱kpa̱n amangatawunkunla̱i (800,000), aza a uɓon Yahuda tamkpamu ele ɗa a̱kpa̱n amangatawantawun (500,000).<verse eid="2SA 24:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="2SA 24:10" />Ana Dawuda u kotsoi kukece uma a, ɗa u dagazai u danai, Vuzavaguɗu, &lt;&lt;N yaꞋan ta̱ unushi u gbayin adama ili i na n yaꞋin. Gogo na Vuzavaguɗu n folono wu ta̱, takpaka mu u nushi u va̱. N yaꞋan ta̱ ili i tsulau.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="2SA 24:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="2SA 24:11" />Ana Dawuda u ɗa̱nga̱i n usana, ɗa Vuzavagɗu u yaꞋin kadanshi n keneki Gadu vuza na wi koɓolo n Dawuda, u danai, <verse eid="2SA 24:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2SA 24:12" />&lt;&lt;Bana vu dana Dawuda, &lt;Ili i na Vuzavaguɗu u danai i ɗaɗa na. N neke yi ta̱ ili i tatsu, adama a na u zagba ite a̱ ka̱tsuma̱ ke le i na a kuyaꞋanka yi.&gt; &gt;&gt;<verse eid="2SA 24:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="2SA 24:13" />Ɗa Gadu u ta̱wa̱i u Dawuda ɗa u danai ni, &lt;&lt;Vu ciga ta̱ a yaꞋan kambulu ali a̱ya̱ a tatsu a iɗika i nu? Ko vu ciga ta̱ vu ka̱na̱ kusuma irala i nu ali wotoi u tatsu? Ko kpamu vu laꞋa ta̱ ku ciga a yaꞋan ma̱dukpa̱ ayin a tatsu a iɗika i nu? Gogo na sheshe ka̱ta̱ vu dana mu i na n kubonoko Vuzavaguɗu.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="2SA 24:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="2SA 24:14" />Ɗa Dawuda wu ushuki u danai, &lt;&lt;Mi ta̱ a̱ una̱mgbi u ka̱tsuma̱, u laꞋa ta̱ n ugaꞋin Vuzavaguɗu u takacika tsu, adama a na wi ta̱ n asuvayali, ama ka̱ta̱ vu ka̱sukpa̱ vuma u takacika tsu ba.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="2SA 24:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="2SA 24:15" />Ɗa Vuzavaguɗu u suki m ma̱dukpa̱ a kubana wa aza a Isaraila, ili i na i ɗikai a usana ali a kubana a makyan ma na u zuwai. Ɗa uma a̱kpa̱n amangatatsu n kupa a̱ kuwa̱i (70,000), ili i na i ɗikai a Dan ali a kubana a Biyasheba <verse eid="2SA 24:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2SA 24:16" />Ana kalingata ka Vuzavaguɗu ka ka sapangi kukiye ku ni a adama a na wu una Urushelima, ɗa Vuzavaguɗu u panai asuvayali e le adama a ma̱dukpa̱ ma, ɗa u danai kalingata ka na ki a ku una uma a, &lt;&lt;U yawa ta̱, bonoko n kukiye ku nu.&gt;&gt; A makyan ma nanlo ma kalingata ka Vuzavaguɗu ka ki ta̱ lo a ulanga u kulapu u Aruna-jebusiya.<verse eid="2SA 24:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="2SA 24:17" />Ana Dawuda we enei kalingata ka na ki a ku una uma a, ɗa u danai Vuzavaguɗu, &lt;&lt;Mpa ɗa vuza na n yaꞋain n unushi. Mpa ɗa kpamu n yaꞋin kagbanigbani. Uma a nampa a i ta̱ tsa nkyon. Yiɗa̱i a yaꞋin? YaꞋan kukiye ku nu ku takacika mu n muku n va̱.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="2SA 24:17" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Dawuda u maꞋin katalikalyuka</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="2SA 24:18" />A kanna ka nanlo kaꞋa Gadu u banai u Dawuda ɗa u danai ni, &lt;&lt;Gaɗukpa vu bana vu maꞋaka Vuzavaguɗu katalikalyuka ɗe a ulanga u kulapu ku Aruna vuza vu Jebusiya.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="2SA 24:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="2SA 24:19" />Ɗa tana Dawuda u ɗa̱nga̱i u banai tsu na Vuzavaguɗu u dansai a̱ una̱ u keneki Gadu. <verse eid="2SA 24:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="2SA 24:20" />Ana Aruna u la̱nuki, ɗa we enei mogono n uma a̱ ni a̱ kuta̱wa̱ wa̱ a̱ ni, ɗa wu uta̱i u gasai n e le. Ɗa u kuɗa̱ngi e kelime ko mogono u lyaꞋaka yi ni kayala. <verse eid="2SA 24:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="2SA 24:21" />Ɗa Aruna u danai, &lt;&lt;Vuzagbayin, yiɗa̱i i tuka̱i mogono na wa̱ a̱ va̱?&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2SA 24:21">Ɗa Dawuda u danai, &lt;&lt;N ta̱wa̱ ta̱ adama a na n tsula ulanga u kulapu u nu, adama a na n maꞋaka Vuzavaguɗu katalikalyuka. Ta punu n kuyaꞋanka Vuzavaguɗu alyuka, adama a na u shamkpa m ma̱dukpa̱ ma na ma kuꞋuwa a̱ ubuta̱ u uma.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="2SA 24:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="2SA 24:22" />Ɗa Aruna u danai Dawuda, &lt;&lt;Vuzagbayin, ɗika i na de dem i gaꞋin nu ka̱ta̱ vi kuyaꞋanka alyuka. Kanaka kaꞋa na adama a kuneꞋe ku kusongu. Alangu a kulapu a ɗana koɓolo n ogboro anaka a vu cimba adama a na vu ciya̱ nɗanga n kusongu. <verse eid="2SA 24:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="2SA 24:23" />Mogono, ili i nampa ya ra̱ka̱ mpa Aruna n neke wu ta̱ i ɗa.&gt;&gt;Ɗa Aruna u doku u danai ni,&lt;&lt;YaꞋan Vuzavaguɗu Ka̱shile ka̱ nu ka̱ ushuku na alyuka a̱ nu.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="2SA 24:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="2SA 24:24" />Ɗa mogono ma̱ ushuku ki Aruna, u danai, &lt;&lt;A̱Ꞌa̱, mi ta̱ a kutsula ubuta̱ wa n ikebe tsu na wu untsai. Adama a na mi a kuyaꞋanka Vuzavaguɗu Ka̱shile ka va̱ alyuka o kusongu n ili i na yi i nu ba ko ili i na i kpa̱ɗa̱i kulyaꞋa mu ili ba.&gt;&gt; Ɗa Dawuda u tsupai Aruna ulanga u kulapu wa koɓolo n Kanaka ka, azurufa shekelu amangerenkupa. <verse eid="2SA 24:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="2SA 24:25" />Ɗa Dawuda u maꞋakai lo Vuzavaguɗu Katalikalyuka ɗa u yaꞋin kuneꞋen ku kusongu koɓolo n kuneꞋen ku ma̱ta̱na̱. Ɗa Vuzavaguɗu u panai ufolu wi iɗika ya, ɗa tana ma̱dukpa̱ ma ma̱ ka̱sukpa̱i aza a Isaraila.<verse eid="2SA 24:25" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2SA 24" />
</usx>